     map to a slate of Däniken-style conspiracy worlds. Each world leaves
     a permanent trace in Soho when the player returns. Counts NOT to
     touch: haunts(12), lilies(5), sefirot(10), alba(3). New currencies
     live alongside.
     ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
