/* 2026-10-19 (Sam: "When there are names labelled on a 3d scene, I want to make sure there is a line break between the venue name and its location"):
   every scene caption (.dss-room-caption: the rooms, the approaches, the dream worlds) breaks at its first ", " or " — ", so the name sits over
   the place (THE PILLARS OF HERCULES / GREEK STREET). Only the first text node is touched, so lines added after it (YOU CAME FOR, Talk to
   others first.) are kept; the CSS shows the break (white-space: pre-line). */
(function() {
  function split(cap) {
    cap.setAttribute('data-br', '1');
