deja: { fi: '‘Nothing gold can stay.’', ci: '‘Oh, no! no! You’ve been through this movie before.’', pi: '‘You will have to live once more and innumerable times more.’', ri: '‘Play it again [sic], Sam.’', cu: '‘Last night I dreamt that somebody loved me.’', cb: '‘In my beginning is my end.’', ti: '‘Of all the gin joints in all the towns in all the world, she walks into mine.’', lk: '‘Same as it ever was, same as it ever was.’', cf: '‘Back to life, back to reality.’', oi: '‘riverrun, past Eve and Adam’s…’' },
