'A menu': { now: 'COD, ROCK SALMON, SAVELOY, WALLY / CHOW MEIN, CHOP SUEY, FOO YUNG', then: 'Forty-five new pence is nine shillings.' },
'A ticket': { now: 'This is one of many possible orders.', then: 'Space and light and order. In this way heaven\'s like a late-night chip shop.' },
