:: StoryData
{
"ifid": "E3F7C9E2-3617-469A-AE5C-210AFB87B930",
"format": "Harlowe",
"format-version": "3.3.9",
"start": "Title",
"zoom": 0.6
}

:: A Doorway on Dean Street [outdoor hub] {"position":"700,550","size":"100,100"}
<!-- THE TEACHING DOORWAY (2026-09-12). This is the one the hub offers you by
     name when you are flagging, and its job is to show you what a doorway is
     for. It is surfaced by the two "Step into a doorway" nudges, which are gated
     on $hadBreather, so the prompt retires once you have used ANY doorway: the
     lesson has landed and the four out on the map take over from here.
     Its relief now MATCHES those four (Sam, 2026-09-12: "make the Dean Street
     one match the others"). It used to give morale +12 and sobriety +8/+18,
     which taught the wrong lesson: no doorway you find later is worth anything
     like that, so the tutorial was overselling the mechanic it exists to
     explain. Small gain, and one time in four nothing, exactly as elsewhere. -->
(set: $alleyReturn to true)\
(set: $hadBreather to true)(set: $justDoorway to true)<!-- 2026-10-19 (Sam, playtest: "I just took a piss in a doorway but it used the vomit 'spew up your guts' line. That should only be available later and use a different animation"): drunk (sobriety under 30) you retch in the doorway instead, and only then does the spew line follow on the street -->(set: $doorSpew to ($sobriety is a number and $sobriety < 30))\
(if: (random: 1, 4) > 1)[(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 4))(set: $sobriety to ($statGain: $sobriety, 6))]\
<span class="dss-door-mode" hidden>(if: $doorSpew is true)[spew]</span><script>(function(){var dm=document.querySelector('.dss-door-mode');var m=(dm&&dm.textContent.trim()==='spew')?'doorway-spew':'doorway';if(window.showSpewPopupSafe){window.showSpewPopupSafe(m,300);}else{setTimeout(function(){if(window.showSpewPopup)window.showSpewPopup(m);},300);}})();</script>\
(go-to: "Dean Street")

:: Doorway: Livonia Street [outdoor hub] {"position":"700,620","size":"100,100"}
<!-- One of the four extra doorways (2026-09-12, Sam: "multiple doorways that you
     can piss or retch in, maybe 4 over the map... and they should always be open").
     Always open, and deliberately cheap. These were first built when the night
     was a sixteen-lap budget and the lap cost was the limiter; the open-night
     $nightPhase rework removed that, so for a while they were an unlimited free
     top-up. Sam's ruling (2026-09-12): "you should just be able to piss when you
     like and regain a small amount of stats most times." So: no gate at all, a
     small gain, and one visit in four gives nothing -- you went, there was not
     much in it. $statGain is proportional to the headroom left, so this tapers
     to almost nothing when you are already in good order, which is the rest of
     the limiting and needs no rule of its own.
     $hadBreather is set here too: it means "you have been tonight", which retires
     the hub's teaching nudge once you have used any doorway at all. It was briefly
     left out while the Dean Street doorway was still a big one-off worth guarding;
     that one now gives exactly what these do, so there is nothing left to guard.
     The prompt itself is untouched: the same showSpewPopup('doorway'). -->
(set: $alleyReturn to true)\
(set: $hadBreather to true)(set: $justDoorway to true)<!-- 2026-10-19 (Sam, playtest: "I just took a piss in a doorway but it used the vomit 'spew up your guts' line. That should only be available later and use a different animation"): drunk (sobriety under 30) you retch in the doorway instead, and only then does the spew line follow on the street -->(set: $doorSpew to ($sobriety is a number and $sobriety < 30))\
(if: (random: 1, 4) > 1)[(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 4))(set: $sobriety to ($statGain: $sobriety, 6))]\
<span class="dss-door-mode" hidden>(if: $doorSpew is true)[spew]</span><script>(function(){var dm=document.querySelector('.dss-door-mode');var m=(dm&&dm.textContent.trim()==='spew')?'doorway-spew':'doorway';if(window.showSpewPopupSafe){window.showSpewPopupSafe(m,300);}else{setTimeout(function(){if(window.showSpewPopup)window.showSpewPopup(m);},300);}})();</script>\
(go-to: "Dean Street")

