(if: $resumingFromCall is true)[(set: $resumingFromCall to false)(if: $sobriety <= 15)[<div class="gents-side-action">(link: "Retch.")[(set: $sobriety to ($statGain: $sobriety, 14))(display: "Bars Now")(display: "Next Redraw")<script>if(window.showSpewPopupSafe){window.showSpewPopupSafe('gents',200);}else{setTimeout(function(){if(window.showSpewPopup)window.showSpewPopup('gents');},200);}</script>]</div>]](else:)[You’ve come to in a cubicle, in what you think is the gents in the Coach and Horses.

(if: $blackouts >= 2)[<div>Having nothing left to bring up disappoints you. Not even the slight pleasure of the purge; only bile and its stained encyclical.</div><div style="margin-top:1em;">Now there are only two paths to the dawn. How much fire do you have left in you? Go to the dawn or else head to the Square and burn it all down.</div>]\
<!-- 2026-10-10 (Sam): no blackout offers "Give up. Sleep here." (only the end-of-night crisis does); after the second you leave the gents for the street and only the fire path is open (hub flag fire-only). -->(if: _wasCoachUrgent)[<span class="alba-link-fade">[[Give up. Sleep here.|The Fetch]]</span>

]\
