:: Coach and Horses bar [venue-coach] {"position":"150,1450","size":"100,100"}
<!-- 2026-10-12 (the venues audit): LILY waits until the first visit, JEFFREY's, is done, as the French, Colony and Ronnie's wait for a first visit -->\
(set: _lilyRing to (($ringSnoozed is not true) and ($lilyNamed is true) and ($lilyCount >= 2) and ($hadLilyCall1 is false) and ($hadPhoneCall is true) and (($returns - $phoneCallReturnsAt) >= 3)))(unless: $sawJeffrey is true)[(set: _lilyRing to false)]<!-- 2026-10-24 sweep: every comparison bracketed; Harlowe read the long unbracketed chain as true with $ringSnoozed true (tested in a scratch build), so a refused ring came straight back on "Back to the bar" -->\
(set: _dualRing to (($refusedDualRing is not true) and ($lilyCount >= 2) and ($hadLilyCall1 is true) and ($hadDualRing is false) and ($crossedThreshold is true) and (($returns - $lilyCall1ReturnsAt) >= 2)))<!-- 2026-10-24 sweep: the dual ring took the Coach's first visit too (played live: the phone rang in place of JEFFREY, his cow and THE BEAST on the first walk in for the cow); it waits for his scene as LILY's ring does -->(unless: $sawJeffrey is true)[(set: _dualRing to false)]\
<div id="cb-container"></div>\
(set: $resumingFromCall to false)\
(if: $coachViaGents is true)[<span class="cb-via-gents" hidden></span>]\
<!-- 2026-10-21 (Sam): JEFFREY stays in the room on every visit; the 2026-10-12 cb-jeff-gone hook that removed him after his scene is gone -->\
<h2 class="venue-title">The Coach and Horses</h2>

(if: _lilyRing)[(set: $lilyCallReturn to "Coach and Horses bar")<div class="phone-ringing">A phone rings, the barman answers it, then looks you in the eye and mouths, ‘LILY’.

|lilyring>[(link: "Accept the call")[(set: $confidence to ($statLoss: $confidence, 6))(go-to: "Lily phone call 1")]
(link: "I’m not here")[(set: $confidence to ($statLoss: $confidence, 3))(display: "Bars Now")(unless: $refusedCalls is a num)[(set: $refusedCalls to 0)](set: $refusedCalls to $refusedCalls + 1)(set: $ringSnoozed to true)(set: $resumingFromCall to true)(set: $refusedLily1 to true)(replace: ?lilyring)[What would LILY want with you? You couldn’t speak to her now, you are not ready.
(if: $refusedCalls is 2)[<div class="glass-pane">(display: "Fetch Window SVG")</div>]
[[Back to the bar|Coach and Horses bar]]]]]</div>]
(else-if: _dualRing)[(set: $lilyCallReturn to "Coach and Horses lock")<div class="phone-ringing">The phone behind the bar rings.

|dualring>[(link: "Accept the call")[(set: $confidence to ($statLoss: $confidence, 7))(go-to: "The dual ring")]
(link: "Turn and leave")[(set: $refusedDualRing to true)(unless: $refusedCalls is a num)[(set: $refusedCalls to 0)](set: $refusedCalls to $refusedCalls + 1)(set: $resumingFromCall to true)(replace: ?dualring)[<!-- 2026-10-11 (Sam, option C part B): turning LILY away is a glimpse of the Fetch, not a meeting. PARKED (Sam): a musical intervention here, so the sound tells you something important has happened. --><div class="glass-pane">(display: "Fetch Window SVG")</div>
[[Back to the bar|Coach and Horses bar]]]]]</div>]
(else:)[<!-- 2026-10-11 structure pass 3: JEFFREY's scene (the cow, LACKLAND's name, his vanishing to Bohemia) played on every Coach visit, after each blackout and again on the return for the cow or the slip, and paid its morale each time. It plays once ($sawJeffrey); the cow and the slip wait on later visits. -->(unless: $sawJeffrey is true)[(set: $sawJeffrey to true)The place is empty except for JEFFREY BERNARD and, in the bar, his cow.

‘You don’t look well,’ he says. ‘Have you seen my cow?’

You heft your eyes to admire it, as he desires. He seems, for a moment, confused, then, owling his head in the direction you’re looking, cries, ‘There she is!’

She moos.

<!-- 2026-10-25 (Sam, ordering audit 2B): the refusal and its slip only while the book is in the bag; the rest of the scene stands -->(set: _bagBook to ((($bookAt is not a string) or ($bookAt is "")) and ($bookSold is not true) and (($bookLent is not a string) or ($bookLent is ""))))‘(if: _bagBook)[And I don’t want that book you’ve got, either. ](if: $knowsLackland is false)[Speak to LACKLAND, he’ll be about. ]You best find your own way out.’(if: _bagBook)[<span class="dss-refusal" data-k="jeffrey" data-who="JEFFREY BERNARD" hidden>‘And I don’t want that book you’ve got, either.’</span>]
(set: $knowsLackland to true)\
(display: "Office Opens Line")\
(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 6))

<!-- 2026-10-21 (Sam): JEFFREY’s Friesian speech moved to his click in the room (the Coach’s hotspots in the UserScript); "The cow regards you with milky indifference." cut -->‘Will you please do something about this cow?’

<!-- 2026-10-29 (Sam, playtest note 16: "You take its bridle" read as if you were about to ride it; moved to the ride, words unchanged) -->It sneezes. When you look back he’s disappeared to a timeshare on the seacoast of Bohemia.<span class="dss-refusal-after" data-k="jeffrey" hidden>Charming bastard, you think. For all his viciousness you are not hurt. You’ll take your book elsewhere and leave him be.</span>]

(if: not ($haunts contains $haunt3))[
(set: $haunts to $haunts + (a: $haunt3))
<div class="haunt-box">
<div class="haunt-header">⟡ HAUNT COLLECTED ⟡</div>
<div class="haunt-name">THE BEAST</div>
<div class="haunt-description">Is it New York or New Year?</div>
<div class="haunt-work"><em>The work: Putrefactio.</em></div>
<div class="haunt-progress">(print: $haunts's length) of 12 caught</div>(display: "Mantra Syllable Cue")
</div>
(if: $haunts's length is 1)[(set: $hauntExplained to true)(if: $hauntPrimerShown is not true)[(set: $hauntPrimerShown to true)<script>setTimeout(function(){ if(window.dssShowHauntPrimer) window.dssShowHauntPrimer(); }, 3500);</script>](if: $primerShown is false)[(set: $primerShown to true)<script>setTimeout(function(){ if(window.dssShowPrimer) window.dssShowPrimer(); }, 1600);</script>]]]

(if: ($alba contains $alba1) and ($alba contains $alba2) and ($cowRideDone is false))[|cowq>[What will you do with his cow?

[[Ride the beast|Ride Jeffrey Bernard's cow]]
<!-- 2026-10-28 (note 40): the cow can wait; the offer stands again next visit -->(link: "Not tonight.")[(replace: ?cowq)[]]]]]
<!-- 2026-10-16 (Sam: restore): the milking, from the 15 April backup, once a night while the cow is here -->(if: ($sawJeffrey is true) and ($milkedCow is not true))[[[Milk her|Milk Jeffrey Bernard's Cow]]]

<!-- 2026-10-24 (Sam): a favour, without spending either dream key; unavailable once the slip has left his glass. -->
(if: ($dreamKey is "lighter") and ($jeffreyTune is not true) and (($keySlip is "seed") or ($keySlip is "Coach and Horses bar")))[[[Give JEFFREY a light|JEFFREY’s tune]]]

<!-- v2 KEY PICKUP (phase 2, 2026-09-01): the slip. Pink draft for Sam. -->
(display: "Key Guards")\
(if: $inisToldOfPillars is true and $keySlip is "seed")[<div class="dss-key-offer" data-key="slip" data-kind="seed"><div class="dss-key-blurb">A stealable betting slip under JEFFREY’S glass.</div>(display: "Key Take slip")</div>]
(display: "Resting Keys")

