(if: $coachUrgent is false and $hasTrishaMatchbook is true and $metShana is false)[[[Try Trisha’s|Approach Trisha's]] (if: $haunts contains $haunt8)[<span class="hp hp-done">◆</span>](else:)[(if: $hauntExplained is true)[<span class="hp">◇</span>]]
