<!-- 2026-10-16 (Sam: restore): from the 15 April backup's Copper accepts, words unchanged (names in the game's capitals); the matchbook opens Trisha's by this road too -->SALVU COPPER’S face droops under the heat of his internal furnace. ‘So someone’s looking after you? That’s enough,’ he says. QUIET FRANKIE lifts his hand without looking. ASHTON GRANGER is happy you’re alive. He presses a book of matches into your hand: ‘Tell TRISHA I sent you.’
