<!-- 2026-10-17 (Sam's lines): the verdict varies with the night. Lived (flowers and haunts at the Fetch's thresholds), nothing gathered (no flowers), else the fixed line. The slip takes the quoted words. -->(if: ($lilyCount >= $needLilies) and ($haunts's length >= $needHaunts))[<span class="shana-lived" hidden>‘Something’s got into this since I last saw it,’ she says, pushing it back at you. ‘Go on. Bring it back to me six months from now.’

You hide it in your bag like a nursemaid’s thing.<span class="dss-refusal" data-k="shana" data-who="SHANA" hidden>‘Something’s got into this since I last saw it.’ ‘Bring it back to me six months from now.’</span><span class="dss-refusal-after" data-k="shana" hidden>That’s as good as in the bag, it has to be.</span></span>](if: $lilyCount is 0)[‘There’s nothing here,’ she says. ‘Not now. Go out and gather what you can, then bring it back to me.’

You hide it in your bag like a nursemaid’s thing.<span class="dss-refusal" data-k="shana" data-who="SHANA" hidden>‘There’s nothing here.’ ‘Go out and gather what you can, then bring it back to me.’</span><span class="dss-refusal-after" data-k="shana" hidden>How hard can it be to fold a world into these pages? you think, and head into the night.</span>](else-if: not (($lilyCount >= $needLilies) and ($haunts's length >= $needHaunts)))[‘Nothing is particularly wrong with it,’ she says, pushing it back towards you.

You hide it in your bag like a nursemaid’s thing.

‘Bring it back to me in six months’ time.’<span class="dss-refusal" data-k="shana" data-who="SHANA" hidden>‘Nothing is particularly wrong with it.’ ‘Bring it back to me in six months’ time.’</span><span class="dss-refusal-after" data-k="shana" hidden>Yes, you think, you’ll guard-dog and you’ll incubate; it’ll grow.</span>](else:)[<span class="shana-default">‘Nothing is particularly wrong with it,’ she says, pushing it back towards you.

You hide it in your bag like a nursemaid’s thing.

‘Bring it back to me in six months’ time.’<span class="dss-refusal" data-k="shana" data-who="SHANA" hidden>‘Nothing is particularly wrong with it.’ ‘Bring it back to me in six months’ time.’</span><span class="dss-refusal-after" data-k="shana" hidden>You wonder what AOIFE will make of six months’ time. Thought is enough to send you back into the cold: you must do better.</span></span><script>/* 2026-10-17: the lived line is hers only once she has read it on an earlier night (a shana slip from before tonight in the slips store); otherwise the fixed lines stand */(function(){ try { var n = window.dssRefusals ? window.dssRefusals.night() : 0; var before = !!(window.dssRefusals && window.dssRefusals.list().some(function(r){ return r.k === 'shana' && r.n < n; })); if (before) { var l = document.querySelector('.shana-lived'), d = document.querySelector('.shana-default'); if (l) l.removeAttribute('hidden'); if (d) d.remove(); } } catch (e) {} })();</script>]

