<span id="ronnies-lore-entry" class="dss-claimed">(link: "⟡ LORE: Ronnie Scott’s ⟡")[(set: _lore to "Ronnie Scott’s")(display: "Lore Read")<div class="lore-box">
You hear four stories about Ronnie Scott’s and half of them are true.

1. My mother and father went one night in the eighties. No particular occasion and they didn’t know who was playing. They sat behind the piano; too close for anyone who really wanted to hear it. Nina Simone played that night.

2. Ronnie once gave a pianist a fulsome introduction: Where he’d played and who with; where he’d seen him play and with whom; and nobody came on stage. The band loops twice round the head and still nobody’s there. That’s the best I’ve ever heard him, said Ronnie. He was never heard of again.

3. You know about the jam they do upstairs? One night my friend’s friend was playing it; a physicist by trade and a brilliant jazz piano player.

Partway through his turn someone whispers in his ear: There’s a man in the stalls who will take a harmonic solo. The band turned the tune around then grew gentle to wait for him.

He comes in: it’s Stevie Wonder, it could be no other. I hear he’s a very kind man.

4. A man was paying for a scotch when the horn started soloing. He finished his drink, put on his coat, his hat and stepped out into the cold Soho rain to see a woman, returning just as the horn seemed to finish her solo.
</div>]</span>

(if: not ($completedSetlist is true))[<span id="ronnies-drinks-entry" hidden>[[Speak to the musicians|Ronnie’s Drinks]]</span>]
(else:)[(if: $tookLily3 is true)[<div class="venue-exhausted">They’ve played out all they have to play, there’s no more here tonight.</div>]

[[Back to the street|Dean Street]]]]

<div class="dss-claimed">(display: "Ronnies Rule SVG h14")</div>
</div>

:: Ronnie’s Drinks [venue-ronnies] {"position":"1900,1575","size":"100,100"}
(if: not ($completedSetlist is true))[
Ronnie Scott’s, Ronnie Scott’s, just like you pictured it: jazz music.

Onstage there are three: MOE D’ALCOUSIN on the saxophone, a pianist, and a guitarist.

The pianist has a long and sculpted face, like El Greco painted a heron, and a young guitarist who looks like he was groomed by Bruce Springsteen.

Says MOE: ‘Lost boy, get us a drink.’ You acquiesce.

‘Bourbon.’

‘A Moscow Mule.’

‘Scotch.’

<span id="sob-data-bar" style="display:none;">(print: $sobriety)</span>\
<div class="bar-chat-action"><button type="button" id="bar-instructions-btn" onclick="window.dssOpenBarInstructions()">Go to the bar</button></div>
(display: "Ronnies Rule SVG h14")\
<div class="pp-arena" id="bar-arena" style="display:none"><div class="pp-score" id="bar-round-display" style="position:relative;overflow:visible;padding:0.6em 0.5em 0.3em;"><span class="bar-rules-title">THE BAR</span><svg class="bar-etched-glasses" viewBox="0 0 340 100" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#bba17a" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M48 78 Q169 95 292 78 M58 82 Q172 99 282 82" opacity=".5"/><path d="M75 33 L116 33 L112 70 Q95 77 79 70 Z M79 57 L112 57 M81 59 L83 69 M86 59 L87 71 M91 59 V72 M96 59 V72 M101 59 L100 72 M106 59 L104 70"/><path d="M150 30 Q146 52 150 69 Q169 79 190 69 L190 31 M150 30 Q169 25 190 31 M150 36 Q169 31 190 36 M191 37 Q215 34 209 53 Q205 64 191 59 M195 41 Q207 39 203 51 Q201 56 193 55 M156 40 L157 65 M162 38 L163 68 M169 38 V70 M176 38 L175 70 M183 39 L181 67"/><path d="M235 21 L272 21 L268 64 Q254 71 240 64 Z M239 46 L268 46 M253 69 V81 M242 83 Q253 80 265 83 M243 49 L245 63 M250 49 L251 66 M257 49 L256 66 M264 49 L261 63"/><path d="M20 48 H58 M285 48 H321 M20 53 H54 M289 53 H321" opacity=".3"/></g></svg></div><canvas id="bar-canvas" aria-label="Bar minigame: pour three drinks, then carry the tray to the stage" width="560" height="400" style="display:none;width:100%;height:auto;"></canvas><div id="pre-bar"><div class="bar-rules" aria-label="How to play">
<section class="bar-rule-step"><div class="bar-rule-heading"><span class="bar-rule-number">I</span><h3>Pour three drinks</h3></div><div class="bar-rule-body"><svg class="bar-pour-diagram" viewBox="0 0 150 150" role="img" aria-label="Pour into the glass and release when the liquid reaches the brass line"><defs><linearGradient id="bar-pour-ink" x1="0" x2="1"><stop stop-color="#725138"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#bb945d"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#80613d"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill="none" stroke="#c4ac83" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M51 56 Q44 83 58 112 Q73 118 88 112 Q103 83 96 56 Z" fill="#17151a66"/><path d="M54 91 Q73 95 93 91 L87 111 Q73 115 59 111 Z" fill="url(#bar-pour-ink)" stroke="none" opacity=".7"/><path d="M73 116 V134 M59 137 Q73 134 87 137"/><ellipse cx="73" cy="56" rx="22" ry="3"/><path d="M58 65 Q54 80 61 97" stroke="#e2dbc455"/><path d="M41 91 H105" stroke="#dfc590" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/><path d="M34 87 L39 91 L34 95 M112 87 L107 91 L112 95" stroke="#d9bf8b"/><g transform="translate(103 20) rotate(42)"><path d="M-9 2 H9 V27 L5 34 V47 H-5 V34 L-9 27 Z" fill="#513924"/><path d="M-7 10 H7 V23 H-7 Z" fill="#a58a5a55"/><path d="M-4 47 H4" stroke="#e1c690"/></g><path d="M72 56 Q76 73 73 90" stroke="#dab47b" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M73 59 Q75 74 72 85" stroke="#e8d9b4" stroke-width=".6"/><path d="M70 90 Q73 87 77 91" stroke="#e0c99f"/></g></svg><div><p><strong>Hold to pour.</strong><br>Release to stop.</p><p class="bar-rule-detail">One drink for each musician.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="bar-rule-step"><div class="bar-rule-heading"><span class="bar-rule-number">II</span><h3>Carry the tray to the stage</h3></div><div class="bar-rule-body"><div class="bar-rules-desktop"><p><kbd>↑</kbd> Jump <span class="bar-rule-detail">— hold for height</span></p><p><kbd>↓</kbd> Duck</p><p><kbd>→</kbd> Hurry &nbsp; <kbd>←</kbd> Hang back</p></div><div class="bar-rules-touch"><p>Touch the <strong>upper area</strong> to jump.<br>Hold for a higher jump.</p><p>Hold the <strong>lower area</strong> to duck.</p></div></div><p class="bar-rule-detail bar-rule-warning">Mind the gaps. Keep the drinks on the tray.</p></section>
</div><div style="text-align:center;padding:0.1em 0 1.2em;"><button id="bar-start-btn" class="bar-rules-start" onclick="window.startBarGame()" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#241a0a,#130d05);color:#d4b878;border:1px solid rgba(184,154,96,0.55);outline:2px solid rgba(184,154,96,0.1);outline-offset:4px;padding:13px 52px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:0.95em;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(184,154,96,0.12),0 0 6px rgba(184,154,96,0.06),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.06);transition:all 0.2s;">Start</button></div></div><div id="bar-narrative" style="text-align:center;padding:0;min-height:0;font-style:italic;"></div><div id="bar-end" style="text-align:center;padding:0;"></div></div>\
<span id="bar-win-link" style="display:none;">[[Bar Canvas Win]]</span>\
<span id="bar-lose-link" style="display:none;">[[Bar Canvas Lose]]</span>
](else:)[(go-to: "Ronnie Scott's")]


:: Stand your ground [venue-cellar char-salvu] {"position":"1800,850","size":"100,100"}
<!-- Swinging bulb -->
<div class="cellar-bulb-wrap">
<svg width="48" height="90" viewBox="0 0 48 90"><!-- Wire from ceiling --><line x1="24" y1="0" x2="24" y2="30" stroke="#888878" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.75"/><!-- Socket cap --><rect x="17" y="28" width="14" height="10" rx="2.5"fill="rgba(80,78,65,0.9)" stroke="rgba(160,155,120,0.7)" stroke-width="1"/><!-- Socket ring detail --><rect x="19" y="36" width="10" height="3" rx="1"fill="none" stroke="rgba(150,145,110,0.55)" stroke-width="0.8"/><!-- Outer glow halo --><ellipse cx="24" cy="60" rx="20" ry="22"fill="rgba(255,245,160,0.12)"/><!-- Bulb body — pear shape, bright and solid --><path d="M24,38 C16,38 10,45 10,55 C10,67 16,78 24,78 C32,78 38,67 38,55 C38,45 32,38 24,38 Z"fill="rgba(255,252,210,0.95)" stroke="rgba(220,210,160,0.6)" stroke-width="0.8"/><!-- Inner warm core --><ellipse cx="24" cy="57" rx="9" ry="11"fill="rgba(255,240,120,0.55)"/><!-- Filament — W-shape --><path d="M18,60 L20,53 L24,58 L28,53 L30,60"fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,200,40,0.95)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><!-- Neck base ring --><rect x="20" y="75" width="8" height="3" rx="1"fill="rgba(200,195,155,0.65)" stroke="none"/></svg>
</div>
<div class="cellar-scene">
<div class="cellar-light"></div>
You don’t move.

‘Silly bugger.’

(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 6))

For a moment you think he might let you off. Then his eyes melt again in his rage.

[[All right, then.|Fight starts]]
</div>

