<svg class="colony-fan" viewBox="0 0 300 52" width="100%" height="52" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><clipPath id="cf1"><rect x="0" y="0" width="300" height="50"/></clipPath><linearGradient id="cfL" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#7aaa60" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset="30%" stop-color="#9a8a30" stop-opacity="0.65"/><stop offset="50%" stop-color="#c8b860" stop-opacity="0.8"/><stop offset="70%" stop-color="#9a8a30" stop-opacity="0.65"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#7aaa60" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient><radialGradient id="cfG" cx="50%" cy="100%" r="55%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#7aaa60" stop-opacity="0.08"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#7aaa60" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs><g filter="url(#dss-ink-fine)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="300" height="52" fill="url(#cfG)"/><g clip-path="url(#cf1)" opacity="0.3"><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="0"   y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="20"  y2="0" stroke="#6a8a48" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.5"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="43"  y2="0" stroke="#8a9a50" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="67"  y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="86"  y2="0" stroke="#6a8a48" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.5"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="108" y2="0" stroke="#9a8a30" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="130" y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="150" y2="0" stroke="#c8b860" stroke-width="1.0"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="170" y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="192" y2="0" stroke="#9a8a30" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="214" y2="0" stroke="#6a8a48" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.5"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="233" y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="257" y2="0" stroke="#8a9a50" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="280" y2="0" stroke="#6a8a48" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.5"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="300" y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/></g><path d="M60,20 Q105,12 150,10 Q195,12 240,20" fill="none" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.18"/><path d="M30,30 Q90,22 150,20 Q210,22 270,30" fill="none" stroke="#8a9a50" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.15"/><line x1="0" y1="43" x2="300" y2="43" stroke="url(#cfL)" stroke-width="0.5"/><line x1="0" y1="47" x2="300" y2="47" stroke="url(#cfL)" stroke-width="1.8"/><line x1="0" y1="50" x2="300" y2="50" stroke="url(#cfL)" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.3"/><polygon points="150,40 155.5,45 150,50 144.5,45" fill="#c8b860" opacity="0.6"/><polygon points="150,42 153,45 150,48 147,45" fill="#e0d080" opacity="0.2"/><polygon points="120,44 123,47 120,50 117,47" fill="none" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7" opacity="0.4"/><polygon points="180,44 183,47 180,50 177,47" fill="none" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7" opacity="0.4"/><circle cx="95" cy="47" r="0.8" fill="#8a9a50" opacity="0.35"/><circle cx="205" cy="47" r="0.8" fill="#8a9a50" opacity="0.35"/></g></svg>
(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 12))\
(set: $sobriety to ($statGain: $sobriety, 12))
(display: "Colony Reentry")
‘You write, too?’ she says, oddly.
<!-- 2026-10-14 (Sam: pitch the book): a choice to show it; her own words go on the slip -->(if: ($pitchedAgent is not true) and _bagBook)[|agentpitch>[(link: "Show her the book")[(set: $pitchedAgent to true)(replace: ?agentpitch)[<span class="dss-refusal" data-k="agent" data-who="THE AGENT" hidden>‘You write, too?’</span><span class="dss-refusal-after" data-k="agent" hidden>‘Too?’ you think to yourself; then, generously: ‘I’d no idea she did.’</span>]]]]

Tonight she’s not working. So you leave, via the gents, because of which detour things sharpen.

As you go, you remember, wholly and as a lone, remarkable thought: Ronnie Scott’s. You’d forgotten it was there.
(if: $knowsRonnies is false)[<div class="haunt-opens">Ronnie Scott’s opens.</div>]
(set: $knowsRonnies to true)
<!-- No teleport (2026-09-14, Sam: "atm it teleports you straight there"). You
     leave the Colony and the street lights a path to Ronnie's, the way it does
     for Cecil Court — see THREADS in the map engine and thread-ronnies above. -->
[[Back to the street|Dean Street]]
<svg class="colony-fan-bottom" viewBox="0 0 300 52" width="100%" height="52" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><clipPath id="cf2"><rect x="0" y="0" width="300" height="50"/></clipPath><linearGradient id="cfL2" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#7aaa60" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset="30%" stop-color="#9a8a30" stop-opacity="0.65"/><stop offset="50%" stop-color="#c8b860" stop-opacity="0.8"/><stop offset="70%" stop-color="#9a8a30" stop-opacity="0.65"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#7aaa60" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient><radialGradient id="cfG2" cx="50%" cy="100%" r="55%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#7aaa60" stop-opacity="0.08"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#7aaa60" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs><g filter="url(#dss-ink-fine)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="300" height="52" fill="url(#cfG2)"/><g clip-path="url(#cf2)" opacity="0.3"><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="0"   y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="20"  y2="0" stroke="#6a8a48" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.5"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="43"  y2="0" stroke="#8a9a50" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="67"  y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="86"  y2="0" stroke="#6a8a48" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.5"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="108" y2="0" stroke="#9a8a30" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="130" y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="150" y2="0" stroke="#c8b860" stroke-width="1.0"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="170" y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="192" y2="0" stroke="#9a8a30" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="214" y2="0" stroke="#6a8a48" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.5"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="233" y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="257" y2="0" stroke="#8a9a50" stroke-width="0.7"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="280" y2="0" stroke="#6a8a48" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.5"/><line x1="150" y1="54" x2="300" y2="0" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7"/></g><path d="M60,20 Q105,12 150,10 Q195,12 240,20" fill="none" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.18"/><path d="M30,30 Q90,22 150,20 Q210,22 270,30" fill="none" stroke="#8a9a50" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.15"/><line x1="0" y1="43" x2="300" y2="43" stroke="url(#cfL2)" stroke-width="0.5"/><line x1="0" y1="47" x2="300" y2="47" stroke="url(#cfL2)" stroke-width="1.8"/><line x1="0" y1="50" x2="300" y2="50" stroke="url(#cfL2)" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.3"/><polygon points="150,40 155.5,45 150,50 144.5,45" fill="#c8b860" opacity="0.6"/><polygon points="150,42 153,45 150,48 147,45" fill="#e0d080" opacity="0.2"/><polygon points="120,44 123,47 120,50 117,47" fill="none" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7" opacity="0.4"/><polygon points="180,44 183,47 180,50 177,47" fill="none" stroke="#7aaa60" stroke-width="0.7" opacity="0.4"/><circle cx="95" cy="47" r="0.8" fill="#8a9a50" opacity="0.35"/><circle cx="205" cy="47" r="0.8" fill="#8a9a50" opacity="0.35"/></g></svg>
</div>

:: The Colony Room [venue-colony] {"position":"1200,700","size":"100,100"}
(set: _lilyRing to (($ringSnoozed is not true) and ($lilyNamed is true) and ($lilyCount >= 2) and ($hadLilyCall1 is false) and ($hadPhoneCall is true) and (($returns - $phoneCallReturnsAt) >= 3) and ($visited contains "Colony") and ($visited's Colony is true)))<!-- 2026-10-24 sweep: every comparison bracketed; Harlowe read the long unbracketed chain as true with $ringSnoozed true (tested in a scratch build), so a refused ring came straight back on "Back to the bar" -->\
(set: _dualRing to (($refusedDualRing is not true) and ($lilyCount >= 2) and ($hadLilyCall1 is true) and ($hadDualRing is false) and ($crossedThreshold is true) and (($returns - $lilyCall1ReturnsAt) >= 2) and ($visited contains "Colony") and ($visited's Colony is true)))\
<div id="ci-container"></div><span class="dss-hub-flag" data-k="rest" style="display:none">(print: $venueRest)</span><!-- 2026-10-24 (Sam, Q3): the room reads this to put the street's line on a resting figure's card -->\
<div class="colony-scene">
(set: _firstColony to not ($visited is a datamap and $visited contains "Colony" and $visited's Colony is true))\
(if: $resumingFromCall is true)[(set: $resumingFromCall to false)](else:)[(set: $sobriety to ($statLoss: $sobriety, 9))]\
(unless: $visited is a datamap)[(set: $visited to (dm:))]\
(unless: $visited contains "Colony")[(set: $visited's Colony to false)]\
(if: $visited's Colony is false)[(set: $visited's Colony to true)\
(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 12))]

(if: _lilyRing)[(set: $lilyCallReturn to "The Colony Room")<div class="phone-ringing">A phone rings, the barman answers it, then looks you in the eye and mouths, ‘LILY’.

|lilyring>[(link: "Accept the call")[(set: $confidence to ($statLoss: $confidence, 6))(go-to: "Lily phone call 1")]
(link: "I’m not here")[(set: $confidence to ($statLoss: $confidence, 3))(display: "Bars Now")(unless: $refusedCalls is a num)[(set: $refusedCalls to 0)](set: $refusedCalls to $refusedCalls + 1)(set: $ringSnoozed to true)(set: $resumingFromCall to true)(set: $refusedLily1 to true)(replace: ?lilyring)[What would LILY want with you? You couldn’t speak to her now, you are not ready.
(if: $refusedCalls is 2)[<div class="glass-pane">(display: "Fetch Window SVG")</div>]
[[Back to the bar|The Colony Room]]]]]</div>]
(else-if: _dualRing)[(set: $lilyCallReturn to "The Colony Room")<div class="phone-ringing">The phone behind the bar rings.

|dualring>[(link: "Accept the call")[(set: $confidence to ($statLoss: $confidence, 7))(go-to: "The dual ring")]
(link: "Turn and leave")[(set: $refusedDualRing to true)(unless: $refusedCalls is a num)[(set: $refusedCalls to 0)](set: $refusedCalls to $refusedCalls + 1)(set: $resumingFromCall to true)(replace: ?dualring)[<!-- 2026-10-11 (Sam, option C part B): turning LILY away is a glimpse of the Fetch, not a meeting. PARKED (Sam): a musical intervention here, so the sound tells you something important has happened. --><div class="glass-pane">(display: "Fetch Window SVG")</div>
[[Back to the bar|The Colony Room]]]]]</div>]
(else:)[(if: $knowsRonnies is true and $knowsCopperSecret is true and $tookLily4 is false)[<span class="dss-flower-only-marker"></span>](if: _firstColony)[The room is greener than you remember it being but less salad than submarine.

It has crepuscular gravity, of the kind a public house could never muster.

(if: $metRed is true and $crossed is not "red")[As you walk in, RED is leaving; you hold each other’s eyes, like dutchy pearls and then he’s gone.]]<!-- 2026-10-07 (Sam: "fold other reentry lines appropriately. Maybe there are some colony ones too?"): the return-visit line that stood here now comes up from "Colony Reentry", once a visit, when the first figure is clicked. -->

(if: $tookLily4 is false)[|lily4>[(display: "Lily SVG")]\
(click-replace: ?lily4)[(if: $sobriety < 30)[(display: "Lily SVG")(unless: $lostToDrink contains "lily4")[(set: $lostToDrink to $lostToDrink + (a: "lily4"))]<span class="lily-glimpse lily-fade">She was leaving town the day after PIERS GAV. She found you and your mates in a pub garden; you hadn’t slept and the acid was still funny. This is the flower you tried to give her. The one you picked in the ha-ha of some big house and kept in your buttonhole all night, and which she wouldn’t take.</span>](else:)[(set: $lostToDrink to $lostToDrink - (a: "lily4"))(set: $lilyCount to $lilyCount + 1)(set: $tookLily4 to true)(display: "Next Redraw")<span class="dss-lily-count" style="display:none">(print: $lilyCount)</span>(display: "Lily SVG")<span class="lily-glimpse lily-fade">Someone in this crowd wears her perfume. You’ve looked and looked again, she is not here. You know though, that the scent perfume makes is not generic, it is particular to the flesh and blood of she who wears it, born of their live admixture.</span>(if: $lilyHintShown is false)[(set: $lilyHintShown to true)<div class="lily-glimpse-hint">Gather flowers. There are five to find.</div>](if: $lilyCount is 5)[(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 25))(set: $sobriety to ($statGain: $sobriety, 15))<div class="pent-reveal-note"><div class="pent-reveal-title">⛤ THE PENTACLE ⛤</div><div class="pent-reveal-body">Five flowers, five points; the city draws its star around you.</div><span class="inventory-note">MORALE +25 | SOBRIETY +15</span></div><script>setTimeout(function(){if(window.dssRevealPentangleOnMap)window.dssRevealPentangleOnMap();},900);</script>]]]](else:)[<div class="lily-taken">(display: "Lily SVG")</div>]

<!-- 2026-10-16 (Sam, from Astra's playtest: the Colony still described the agent after she had gone): her paragraph shows on the same gate as her link; words unchanged -->(if: $knowsRonnies is false)[At a table is an agent.

There is an impulse among those who work in the book trade, at the business-end of things, to elevate some from their ranks to celebrity. This would not be remarkable (it is done, after all, in most lines of work) were it not for the fact that they deal, in their daily employment, when the job is well done, with remarkable things, deserving of fame.

The talented agent, that magus of retail and the markets, is sometimes encouraged, therefore, into a kind of absurd grandeur, which, in the way that prophecies can, will sometimes fulfil itself and serve, valet-like, as its own justification.

Such was the agent who sat at the table.

](unless: $metDavy is a boolean)[(set: $metDavy to false)](unless: $venueRest is a string)[(set: $venueRest to "")](if: $metDavy is false and ($venueRest is not "colony"))[
(link: "Get a drink with the man at the bar")[(set: $sobriety to ($statLoss: $sobriety, 9))(go-to: "Davy Merkin")]](else-if: $metDavy is true)[
