1 54,38 L54,110 Z' fill='#17120f' stroke='#8a7048' stroke-width='0.6'/><path d='M8,38 A22,22 0 0 1 52,38 L52,44 L8,44 Z' fill='#2a2418' stroke='#c8a86a' stroke-width='0.5' opacity='0.9'/><path d='M30,42 L30,20 M14,42 L20,24 M46,42 L40,24' stroke='#c8a86a' stroke-width='0.45' opacity='0.7'/><ellipse class='td-fan' cx='30' cy='31' rx='16' ry='8' fill='rgba(232,196,110,0.10)'/><g fill='none' stroke='#8a7048' stroke-width='0.5' opacity='0.8'><rect x='12' y='50' width='15' height='22' rx='1'/><rect x='33' y='50' width='15' height='22' rx='1'/><rect x='12' y='78' width='15' height='24' rx='1'/><rect x='33' y='78' width='15' height='24' rx='1'/></g><circle cx='30' cy='72' r='2.2' fill='none' stroke='#c8a86a' stroke-width='0.7'/><path d='M27.8,72 A2.2,2.2 0 0 0 32.2,72' fill='none' stroke='#c8a86a' stroke-width='0.7'/><rect x='-4' y='110' width='68' height='4' rx='0.8' fill='#3a3028' stroke='#c8a86a' stroke-width='0.4' opacity='0.9'/></g><path d='M0,114 H300' stroke='#c8a86a' stroke-width='0.8' opacity='0.8'/><path d='M0,120 H300' stroke='#c8a86a' stroke-width='0.35' opacity='0.4'/></g></svg></div>
You think you know where The Colony Room is. You’re not a member, but a friend brought you there once before.

You find yourself with a choice of two doors.

On which do you knock?

(if: $metSalvu is true)[[[Left|Wrong door]]](else:)[[[Left|Maltese Gangsters]]]
(if: ($metSalvu is true) and (not _colonyIn))[[[Right|Colony Member]]](else:)[[[Right|The Colony Room]]]

<span class="dss-coin-flag" style="display:none">(if: $hasCoin is true)[1](else:)[0]</span>\
<script>if(window.coinGate)window.coinGate("Left","Right",true);</script>
<script>(function(){ /* the door you're about to knock on lights its fanlight (2026-09-11 overnight run) */
var plate=document.querySelector('.two-doors-plate'); if(!plate) return;
document.querySelectorAll('tw-link, .enchantment-link').forEach(function(l){ var t=l.textContent.trim(); if(t!=='Left'&&t!=='Right') return; var cls='lit-'+t.toLowerCase();
  l.addEventListener('mouseenter',function(){ plate.classList.add(cls); }); l.addEventListener('mouseleave',function(){ plate.classList.remove(cls); });
  l.addEventListener('focus',function(){ plate.classList.add(cls); }); l.addEventListener('blur',function(){ plate.classList.remove(cls); }); });
})();</script>

