<!-- 2026-10-28 (Sam: LILY named too late, long after the first lily-of-the-valley; "split it"): his first two paragraphs moved, unchanged, to Night Ahead: LILY, which follows RED. The cover story stays here, with its timing. -->\
So try to sell the book. It’s both your get out and your cover story. Someone here will take it, eventually. But that’s not all you’re here for. No, you’ve come to lay some ghosts to rest.

Soho’s rain churns up your silted bloodstream; even in the years that you aren’t here.
<!-- 2026-10-28 (notes 26/31): the morning-song sentences moved to LINE 1 -->

<div class="tna-booktitle">(print: $bookTitle)</div>

[[On.|Dean Street]]
</div>

:: Name Your Book {"position":"100,350","size":"100,100"}
<div class="typewriter-page typewriter-static book-naming">
<svg style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;overflow:visible;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><radialGradient id="nbStain1" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#120802" stop-opacity="0.85"/><stop offset="40%" stop-color="#3f1c08" stop-opacity="0.55"/><stop offset="78%" stop-color="#7a3c0c" stop-opacity="0.22"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#a86014" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient><radialGradient id="nbStain2" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#150902" stop-opacity="0.78"/><stop offset="45%" stop-color="#44200a" stop-opacity="0.50"/><stop offset="80%" stop-color="#80400e" stop-opacity="0.18"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ae6416" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient><radialGradient id="nbWine" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#701020" stop-opacity="0.30"/><stop offset="60%" stop-color="#701020" stop-opacity="0.10"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#701020" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs><circle cx="-12" cy="40" r="22" fill="url(#nbStain1)"/><circle cx="-4" cy="80" r="14" fill="url(#nbStain2)"/><ellipse cx="540" cy="60" rx="9" ry="20" transform="rotate(-12,540,60)" fill="rgba(68,32,7,0.40)"/><circle cx="528" cy="280" r="11" fill="url(#nbStain2)"/><ellipse cx="62" cy="320" rx="14" ry="20" transform="rotate(8,62,320)" fill="url(#nbWine)"/><circle cx="48" cy="180" r="3" fill="rgba(125,72,24,0.28)"/><circle cx="486" cy="200" r="2.5" fill="rgba(140,85,30,0.22)"/><circle cx="38" cy="270" r="2" fill="rgba(132,80,28,0.20)"/><circle cx="500" cy="120" r="2" fill="rgba(132,80,28,0.20)"/></svg>
