<div class="nb-input">(input-box: bind $bookTitle, 1)</div>
<!-- 2026-10-15 (Sam: the cover story revealed later): the ": A Cover Story" subtitle no longer shows here or joins the title now; Night Ahead Part Two stamps it when the confession comes -->
<div class="nb-link-row">(link: "On.")[(if: $bookTitle is "")[(set: $bookTitle to "Untitled Manuscript")](go-to: "Dedicate Your Book")]<!-- 2026-10-22: On. to Dedicate Your Book (the book's first page), which goes back to Dean Street --></div>
