<!-- 2026-10-24: a call that rang as you left the Ham ($callThenOut) hangs up onto the street -->(set: _callOut to $callThenOut is true)(set: $callThenOut to false)<div class="phone-type" style="--d:8.5s;--t:1.0s">(if: _callOut)[[[Hang up|Dean Street]]](else:)[[[Hang up|Entering The Pillars of Hercules]]]</div>

