2,-8' fill='none' stroke='rgba(255,230,210,0.22)' stroke-width='1' stroke-linecap='round'/><ellipse cx='-25' cy='1' rx='5' ry='4' fill='#2a1a34' opacity='0.8'/><ellipse cx='25' cy='1' rx='5' ry='4' fill='#2a1a34' opacity='0.8'/><circle cx='-27' cy='0' r='0.7' fill='rgba(255,230,210,0.35)'/><circle cx='-25' cy='-1.5' r='0.7' fill='rgba(255,230,210,0.35)'/><circle cx='-23' cy='0' r='0.7' fill='rgba(255,230,210,0.35)'/><circle cx='-25' cy='2.5' r='0.7' fill='rgba(255,230,210,0.35)'/><circle cx='23' cy='0' r='0.7' fill='rgba(255,230,210,0.35)'/><circle cx='25' cy='-1.5' r='0.7' fill='rgba(255,230,210,0.35)'/><circle cx='27' cy='0' r='0.7' fill='rgba(255,230,210,0.35)'/><circle cx='25' cy='2.5' r='0.7' fill='rgba(255,230,210,0.35)'/></g></g></svg>

<div class="phone-type lily-phone-narrate" style="--d:7.8s;--t:1.2s">It rings again, immediately. It’s LILY.</div>\
<div class="phone-type lily-phone-her" style="--d:10.2s;--t:1.6s">‘What was her name? I think she was next to me in my yoga class.’</div>\
<div class="phone-type lily-phone-you" style="--d:12.2s;--t:0.8s">‘Isadora. And yes I was young and…’</div>\
<div class="phone-type lily-phone-her" style="--d:13.4s;--t:1.8s">‘How different things might have been.’</div>\
<div class="phone-type lily-phone-you" style="--d:15.6s;--t:1.2s">‘How changed they are.’</div>\
<div class="phone-type lily-phone-her" style="--d:17.2s;--t:0.8s">‘Goodnight, take it easy.’</div>\
<div class="phone-type lily-phone-you" style="--d:18.4s;--t:1.0s">‘… as the grass grows on the weirs,’</div>\
<div class="phone-type lily-phone-her" style="--d:19.8s;--t:1.0s">‘But I was young and foolish.’</div>

