</div>
<div class="cellar-scene">
<div class="cellar-light"></div>
‘JOHN ST. JOHN,’ you say (which is pronounced JON SIN-JIN). JOHN’S face is now stamped on the debt’s coin. ASHTON hears it fall, as loud as distant glass, breaking.

[[Brace yourself|Fight starts]]
</div>

:: Watch the decider [venue-lackland-back] {"position":"1200,1300","size":"100,100"}
<div class="dec-rally"><div class="dec-table"></div><div class="dec-net"></div><div class="dec-leg l"></div><div class="dec-leg r"></div><div class="dec-paddle l"></div><div class="dec-paddle r"></div><div class="dec-ball"></div><div class="dec-flash"></div></div>

<div class="dec-reveal">JACK CURTIS wins it. Smash to the corner.

‘Fancy the game?’ says JACK CURTIS.

‘House rules,’ says PERCY RITSON, ‘winner plays the stranger.’ He turns to you. ‘Unless the stranger fancies an easier task, in which case I’ll take you off JACK’S hands.’

(unless: $pongStake is a boolean)[(set: $pongStake to false)]\
|pstake>[(link: "Put a score on it")[(set: $pongStake to true)(replace: ?pstake)[<span class="inventory-note">&#163;20 DOWN</span><br>PERCY RITSON looks at the note, then at JACK. ‘Now it’s sport.’]]]

