:: Nazca Return [outdoor street-night] {"position":"2300,2400","size":"100,100"}
<script>setTimeout(function(){if(window.dssAudio&&window.dssAudio.passageWhoosh)window.dssAudio.passageWhoosh();},200);</script>
<div>
You’re back on Dean Street. There’s a scrap in your pocket that wasn’t there when you left; it’s dry with the gilded heat of smaller latitudes. The sunburn on your neck smarts in the fog.
</div>

[[Dean Street|Dean Street]]

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     v2-EXPANSION — EASTER ISLAND / RAPA NUI (Pillar of Severity / upper left)
     5 passages: Easter Island Shore → Among the Moai → The Listening Moai
     → The Glyph → Easter Island Return. Gift: a Rongorongo glyph.
     Soho-responds: Red (the poet).
