:: Nazca Turn-Back [outdoor] {"position":"1900,2400","size":"100,100"}
(set: $tonightsWorld to "")\
<div>
You wake on Dean Street with grit against your gums and as pale as the Pampa de Jumana.

The bird is still in the desert.
</div>

[[Dean Street|Dean Street]]

:: Easter Island Shore [dream easter] {"position":"1700,2600","size":"100,100"}
<div id="ei-container"></div>
<div>
A fishing boat puts you ashore at night, its orange sail like a claggy paperback.

The beach is of basalt and the island above it has no trees.

Somebody has been down here recently: a spent cartridge litters the scree. Further inland there are forms; planked edifices, pivoted about the earth so they stand skywards; bald and spaced like the tines on a thumb piano.
</div>

<div>[[Walk up the beach|Among the Moai]]</div>

:: Among the Moai [dream easter] {"position":"1900,2600","size":"100,100"}
<div>
These are the moai of Easter Island.

Between the fifth and the sixth a man with a rifle slung round his heft rides out of the dark on a squat, grey horse. The pipe he is smoking lolls from his lips, through the hole in his balaclava.

‘We took the beach at moonrise,’ he says. ‘For the governing council of the ancestors.’

<!-- 2026-10-18 (Sam: the revolutionary has a name). His line. -->‘Call me Subcomandante Fortuna.’

A thin sound needles into the edge of your hearing. It drones in till it swells and bevvies like a carnyx with its terrible harmonics.
</div>

(if: $davyTicketFragment is true)[(link: "Recognise the sixth moai")[(set: $easterViaDavy to true)(go-to: "The Listening Moai")]]

<div class="reclamation-invite">[[Fight|The Reclamation]]</div>

<div>[[Flee|Easter Island Turn-Back]]</div>

:: The Reclamation [dream easter reclamation] {"position":"2100,2700","size":"100,100"}
(set: $easterReclaim to true)\
(if: $easterHomeFight is true)[<span id="rc-homeward" hidden></span>]\
<!-- THE RECLAMATION, 3D (2026-09-17, Sam: "the game itself is rubbish. I bet
     you can make a much better version of it that matches the level of the
     other minigames"). A first-person night shoot from the ahu on the shore:
     you stand at the wall between two moai with their backs to the sea, the
     moon rising over the water on your right, and the occupation's machines
     coming down the quarry road toward the platform. Aim with the pointer
     (the camera breathes and leans with your aim), fire with click, tap or
     Space, five rounds to a clip, R or an empty clip reloads with a bolt
     cycle. Three waves: drones, then the floodlight rigs (a lit rig glares
     and gently increases sway until you shoot the lamp out), then the crawler
     that takes three rounds. Turquoise spirits drift the field and attend
     the machines; shoot one and it flares and you are told. Ten silenced
     wins; three spirits or three machines at the wall and Subcomandante Fortuna lowers the
     rifle. Same scaffold as The Climb: cover, pause, expand, touch pad,
     bloom + film grade, procedural sea/shots/bolt audio, teardown on leave.
     Dev only: window._rcDev.snapshot()/win()/lose()/spawn(kind); E silences
     every live machine. -->
<div class="rc-stage"><div class="rc-toolbar"><span>RAPA NUI · THE RECLAMATION</span><span><button id="rc-pause" type="button">Pause</button> <button id="rc-expand" type="button">Expand</button></span></div><div class="rc-scoreboard" role="group" aria-label="Rifle scoreboard"><div class="rc-score-key"><span>ENEMIES · SHOOT</span><span>DO NOT SHOOT</span></div><div class="rc-score-types"><div><span>DRONES</span><strong data-rc-score="drone">0</strong></div><div><span>RIGS</span><strong data-rc-score="rig">0</strong></div><div><span>CRAWLERS</span><strong data-rc-score="crawler">0</strong></div><div class="rc-score-spirits"><span>SPIRITS HIT</span><strong data-rc-score="spirit">0</strong></div></div><div class="rc-score-strip"><span>SILENCED <b data-rc-score="total">0 / 10</b></span><span>AT WALL <b data-rc-score="wall">0 / 3</b></span><span data-rc-score="ammo">ROUNDS 5 / 5</span></div></div><div id="rc-hud">He hands it over stock first. Wait for the eyes.</div><div class="rc-frame"><canvas id="rc-canvas" width="720" height="540" tabindex="0" aria-label="3D night shoot from the moai platform. Move the pointer or arrow keys to aim, click, tap or Space to fire, R to reload, P to pause." aria-describedby="rc-hud"></canvas><div id="rc-reticle" aria-hidden="true"></div><div id="rc-glare" aria-hidden="true"></div><div id="rc-banner" role="status"></div><div class="rc-cover" id="rc-cover"><p class="rc-kicker">HOLD THE LINE</p><h2>The Reclamation</h2><p id="rc-instructions">Move the mouse or drag to aim · click, tap or Space fires<br>Dragging aims without firing. Use Fire while holding your aim.<br>Five rounds to a clip · R reloads<br>Silence the machines on the quarry road.<br>Never the turquoise ones. They are the old ones.<br>Drones: one hit · rigs: lamp, then head · crawler: three hits.<br>Amber lights are targets. Turquoise spirits are not.</p><p>Ten machines and the road is dark.<br>Three spirits, or three at the wall, and Subcomandante Fortuna lowers the rifle.<br>(if: $easterHomeFight is true)[The boat waits either way.](else:)[The sixth moai waits either way.]</p><button type="button" id="rc-begin">Take the rifle</button></div></div><div class="rc-pad" aria-label="Rifle controls"><button type="button" data-rc-key="ArrowLeft" aria-label="Aim left">←</button><button type="button" data-rc-key="ArrowUp" aria-label="Aim up">↑</button><button type="button" data-rc-key="ArrowDown" aria-label="Aim down">↓</button><button type="button" data-rc-key="ArrowRight" aria-label="Aim right">→</button><button type="button" data-rc-key=" " aria-label="Fire">Fire</button><button type="button" data-rc-key="r" aria-label="Reload">Reload</button></div></div>

<span id="rc-win" style="display:none;">(if: $easterHomeFight is true)[(link: "Down to the boat")[(set: $easterReclaimWon to true)(go-to: "Easter Island Return")]](else:)[(link: "Stand before the sixth")[(set: $easterReclaimWon to true)(go-to: "The Listening Moai")]]</span>
<span id="rc-lose" style="display:none;">(if: $easterHomeFight is true)[[[Down to the boat|Easter Island Return]]](else:)[[[Stand before the sixth|The Listening Moai]]]</span><span class="rc-again" style="display:none;">[[Again|The Reclamation]]</span>

<span id="rc-skip" style="display:none;"><div class="claude-draft" style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.4em;font-size:0.78em;opacity:0.45;letter-spacing:0.08em;">(if: $easterHomeFight is true)[[[(skip reclamation — testing)|Easter Island Return]]](else:)[[[(skip reclamation — testing)|The Listening Moai]]]</div></span>
<script>if (window.DSS_DEV) { var _rk = document.getElementById('rc-skip'); if (_rk) _rk.style.display = 'block'; }</script>

<script>
(function(){
  'use strict';
  var canvas=document.getElementById('rc-canvas');
  if(!canvas || canvas.dataset.rcInit) return;
  if(window._rcCleanup) window._rcCleanup();
  canvas.dataset.rcInit='3d';
  var stage=canvas.closest('.rc-stage'), frame=canvas.parentElement, cover=document.getElementById('rc-cover');
  var beginButton=document.getElementById('rc-begin'), pauseButton=document.getElementById('rc-pause'), expandButton=document.getElementById('rc-expand');
  var hud=document.getElementById('rc-hud'), banner=document.getElementById('rc-banner'), reticle=document.getElementById('rc-reticle'), glareEl=document.getElementById('rc-glare');
  var reducedMotion=window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  var disposed=false, renderer=null, scene=null, camera=null, animId=0, observer=null, resizeObserver=null;
  var removers=[], loader=null, eng=null, feedbackTimer=null, lastNow=null, accumulator=0;
  var started=false, paused=false, finished=false, ending=-1, endKind='';
  var keys={}, pointerKeys={}, time=0, lastHUD='';
  var composer=null, bloomPass=null, gradeEls=[], shoreMist=[], moaiWisps=[], moaiStone=null, nebulaSky=null, skyClock={value:0};
  // Aim in normalised device coords (-1..1). The pointer owns it; arrows nudge it.
  var aim={x:0,y:.05}, aimVec=null, raycaster=null, sway={x:0,y:0}, recoil=0, breathe=0;
  var rounds=5, CLIP=5, reloadT=0, RELOAD=1.5, shotT=0, BOLT=.42, fireQueued=false;
  var shotBuffer=0, touchAim=null, seaTick=0, aimTarget='';
  var silenced=0, disturbed=0, atWall=0, WIN=10, LOSE=3 + (window.dssEase ? window.dssEase.level('reclaim') : 0), spawned=0; /* 2026-10-28 (dssEase): each lost night lets one more reach the wall */
  var shotCounts={drone:0,rig:0,crawler:0}, scoreEls={}, lastScore='';
  stage.querySelectorAll('[data-rc-score]').forEach(function(el){scoreEls[el.getAttribute('data-rc-score')]=el;});
  function updateScoreboard(){var ammo=reloadT>0?'RELOADING':'ROUNDS '+rounds+' / '+CLIP;var key=[shotCounts.drone,shotCounts.rig,shotCounts.crawler,disturbed,silenced,atWall,ammo].join('|');if(key===lastScore)return;lastScore=key;['drone','rig','crawler'].forEach(function(k){scoreEls[k].textContent=shotCounts[k];});scoreEls.spirit.textContent=disturbed;scoreEls.total.textContent=silenced+' / '+WIN;scoreEls.wall.textContent=atWall+' / '+LOSE;scoreEls.ammo.textContent=ammo;}
  var machines=[], spirits=[], hitMeshes=[], bursts=[], tracer=null, tracerT=0, flash=null;
  var wave=0, waveT=0, queue=[], moon=null, shine=null, moonLight=null, hemi=null, sea=null, seaPos=null, seaBase=null, lampSprites=[], stars=null, moonRise=0, glare=0;
  var WALL_Z=-9, texGlow=null, texSpark=null, texSpirit=null, texMachineLamp=null, spiritMat=null, geoSphere=null, geoBox=null, geoCyl=null;
  function listen(el,event,fn){el.addEventListener(event,fn);removers.push(function(){el.removeEventListener(event,fn);});}
  function held(k){return !!keys[k] || Object.keys(pointerKeys).some(function(id){return pointerKeys[id]===k;});}
  function clearInput(){keys={};pointerKeys={};fireQueued=false;shotBuffer=0;touchAim=null;stage.querySelectorAll('[data-held]').forEach(function(b){b.removeAttribute('data-held');});}
  function announce(message,hold){clearTimeout(feedbackTimer);banner.textContent=message;banner.style.opacity='1';feedbackTimer=setTimeout(function(){banner.style.opacity='0';},hold||1700);}
  function cleanup(){
    if(disposed)return;disposed=true;cancelAnimationFrame(animId);clearTimeout(feedbackTimer);
    if(observer)observer.disconnect();if(resizeObserver)resizeObserver.disconnect();
    removers.forEach(function(remove){remove();});clearInput();
    if(loader){loader.onload=null;loader.onerror=null;}
    if(eng){eng.kill();eng=null;}
    if(scene){var geometries=new Set(),materials=new Set();scene.traverse(function(o){if(o.geometry)geometries.add(o.geometry);if(o.material)(Array.isArray(o.material)?o.material:[o.material]).forEach(function(m){materials.add(m);if(m.map)m.map.dispose();});});geometries.forEach(function(g){g.dispose();});materials.forEach(function(m){m.dispose();});}
    if(bloomPass && bloomPass.dispose){try{bloomPass.dispose();}catch(e){}}
    if(composer){try{composer.renderTarget1.dispose();composer.renderTarget2.dispose();}catch(e){}}
    gradeEls.forEach(function(el){if(el.parentNode)el.parentNode.removeChild(el);});gradeEls=[];
    if(renderer){renderer.dispose();renderer.forceContextLoss();}
    if(document.fullscreenElement===stage && document.exitFullscreen)document.exitFullscreen().catch(function(){});
    if(window._rcCleanup===cleanup)window._rcCleanup=null;
    if(window._rcDev && window._rcDev.canvas===canvas)delete window._rcDev;
  }
  window._rcCleanup=cleanup;
  observer=new MutationObserver(function(){if(!canvas.isConnected)cleanup();});
  observer.observe(document.querySelector('tw-story') || document.body,{childList:true,subtree:true});
  function startGame(){if(!renderer || disposed || finished)return;started=true;paused=false;lastNow=null;accumulator=0;clearInput();cover.hidden=true;reticle.style.opacity='1';pauseButton.textContent='Pause';canvas.focus({preventScroll:true});if(!eng)makeAudio();if(eng)eng.resume();if(wave===0)startWave(1);}
  function setPaused(value){if(!started || finished)return;paused=value;clearInput();lastNow=null;accumulator=0;cover.hidden=!value;beginButton.textContent='Back to the wall';pauseButton.textContent=value?'Resume':'Pause';if(eng)eng.silence();if(!value){canvas.focus({preventScroll:true});if(eng)eng.resume();}}
  // ---- input: pointer aims, tap aims then fires, keys nudge ----
  function setAimFromClient(cx,cy){var r=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();aim.x=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,((cx-r.left)/r.width)*2-1));aim.y=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,-(((cy-r.top)/r.height)*2-1)));}
  listen(canvas,'pointermove',function(e){if(e.pointerType==='touch' && !touchAim)return;if(touchAim && Math.hypot(e.clientX-touchAim.x,e.clientY-touchAim.y)>9)touchAim.dragged=true;setAimFromClient(e.clientX,e.clientY);});
  function queueFire(){if(reloadT>0 || paused || finished || ending>=0)return;fireQueued=true;shotBuffer=.18;}
  listen(canvas,'pointerdown',function(e){if(e.pointerType==='mouse' && e.button!==0)return;e.preventDefault();if(paused||finished||ending>=0)return;setAimFromClient(e.clientX,e.clientY);if(!started){startGame();return;}if(e.pointerType==='touch'){touchAim={id:e.pointerId,x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY,dragged:false};canvas.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);}else queueFire();canvas.focus({preventScroll:true});});
  listen(canvas,'pointerup',function(e){if(touchAim && touchAim.id===e.pointerId){if(!touchAim.dragged)queueFire();touchAim=null;}});
  listen(canvas,'pointercancel',function(){touchAim=null;});
  listen(canvas,'lostpointercapture',function(){touchAim=null;});
  listen(canvas,'contextmenu',function(e){e.preventDefault();});
  function kd(e){
    if(e.target && /INPUT|TEXTAREA|SELECT|BUTTON/.test(e.target.tagName))return;
    var k=e.key.length===1?e.key.toLowerCase():e.key;
    if(k==='p'||k==='Escape'){if(started){e.preventDefault();setPaused(!paused);}return;}
    if(window.DSS_DEV && k==='e' && started && !paused && ending<0){machines.slice().forEach(function(m){if(m.alive)kill(m);});return;}
    if(['ArrowUp','ArrowDown','ArrowLeft','ArrowRight',' ','r'].indexOf(k)<0)return;
    e.preventDefault();if(paused||finished||ending>=0)return;if(!started)startGame();keys[k]=true;if(k===' '&&!e.repeat)queueFire();if(k==='r')reload();
  }
  listen(window,'keydown',kd);
  listen(window,'keyup',function(e){var k=e.key.length===1?e.key.toLowerCase():e.key;keys[k]=false;});
  listen(window,'blur',function(){if(started&&!finished)setPaused(true);else clearInput();});
  listen(document,'visibilitychange',function(){if(document.hidden && started)setPaused(true);});
  listen(beginButton,'click',startGame);listen(pauseButton,'click',function(){setPaused(!paused);});
  listen(expandButton,'click',function(){
    if(document.fullscreenElement===stage){document.exitFullscreen().catch(function(){});return;}
    if(stage.requestFullscreen)stage.requestFullscreen().catch(function(){stage.classList.toggle('rc-expanded');resize();});
    else{stage.classList.toggle('rc-expanded');resize();}
  });
  listen(document,'fullscreenchange',function(){expandButton.textContent=document.fullscreenElement===stage?'Shrink':'Expand';resize();});
  stage.querySelectorAll('[data-rc-key]').forEach(function(button){
    var k=button.getAttribute('data-rc-key');
    listen(button,'pointerdown',function(e){e.preventDefault();if(paused||finished||ending>=0)return;if(!started)startGame();pointerKeys[e.pointerId]=k;button.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);button.setAttribute('data-held','');if(k===' ')queueFire();if(k==='r')reload();});
    function release(e){delete pointerKeys[e.pointerId];if(!held(k))button.removeAttribute('data-held');}
    listen(button,'pointerup',release);listen(button,'pointercancel',release);listen(button,'lostpointercapture',release);
    listen(button,'keydown',function(e){if(e.key!==' '&&e.key!=='Enter')return;e.preventDefault();if(paused||finished)return;if(!started)startGame();keys[k]=true;if(k===' '&&!e.repeat)queueFire();if(k==='r')reload();});
    listen(button,'keyup',function(e){if(e.key!==' '&&e.key!=='Enter')return;e.preventDefault();keys[k]=false;});
  });
  // ---- audio: sea wash bed, shots, bolt, spirit chime, machine death ----
  function makeAudio(){
  try {
    var actx=new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();
    var nbuf=actx.createBuffer(1,actx.sampleRate*2,actx.sampleRate), nd=nbuf.getChannelData(0);
    for(var ni=0;ni<nd.length;ni++)nd[ni]=Math.random()*2-1;
    var sea=actx.createBufferSource();sea.buffer=nbuf;sea.loop=true;
    var seaF=actx.createBiquadFilter();seaF.type='lowpass';seaF.frequency.value=420;
    var seaG=actx.createGain();seaG.gain.value=0;sea.connect(seaF);seaF.connect(seaG);seaG.connect(actx.destination);sea.start();
    var lfo=actx.createOscillator();lfo.frequency.value=.11;var lfoG=actx.createGain();lfoG.gain.value=160;lfo.connect(lfoG);lfoG.connect(seaF.frequency);lfo.start();
    function muted(){return !!(window.dssAudio && window.dssAudio.isMuted && window.dssAudio.isMuted());}
    function burst(freq,q,peak,dur,type){var src=actx.createBufferSource();src.buffer=nbuf;var f=actx.createBiquadFilter();f.type=type||'bandpass';f.frequency.value=freq;f.Q.value=q;var g=actx.createGain();var t=actx.currentTime;g.gain.setValueAtTime(0,t);g.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(peak,t+.006);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0005,t+dur);src.connect(f);f.connect(g);g.connect(actx.destination);src.start(t);src.stop(t+dur+.05);}
    function tone(f0,f1,peak,dur,type){var o=actx.createOscillator(),g=actx.createGain(),t=actx.currentTime;o.type=type||'sine';o.frequency.setValueAtTime(f0,t);o.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(f1,t+dur);g.gain.setValueAtTime(0,t);g.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(peak,t+.01);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0005,t+dur);o.connect(g);g.connect(actx.destination);o.start(t);o.stop(t+dur+.05);}
    eng={
      resume:function(){try{actx.resume();}catch(e){}},
      update:function(tense){seaG.gain.setTargetAtTime(muted()?0:(tense?.03:.02),actx.currentTime,.5);},
      silence:function(){seaG.gain.setTargetAtTime(0,actx.currentTime,.05);},
      shot:function(){if(muted())return;burst(1200,.7,.22,.22);tone(120,42,.16,.28);},
      bolt:function(){if(muted())return;burst(2600,4,.07,.05);setTimeout(function(){if(!disposed)burst(1900,4,.07,.06);},170);},
      empty:function(){if(muted())return;burst(3000,6,.05,.04);},
      spirit:function(){if(muted())return;tone(660,990,.07,.7);tone(330,495,.04,.9,'triangle');},
      hit:function(){if(muted())return;burst(700,1.2,.12,.14);},
      die:function(){if(muted())return;burst(240,.8,.2,.55,'lowpass');tone(70,28,.14,.6);},
      wall:function(){if(muted())return;tone(160,80,.12,.9,'sawtooth');},
      end:function(win){if(muted())return;if(win){tone(392,392,.06,1.6);tone(587,587,.05,2.2);tone(784,784,.04,2.8);}else tone(196,98,.08,2.4,'triangle');},
      kill:function(){try{sea.stop();lfo.stop();actx.close();}catch(e){}}
    };
  } catch(e){ eng=null; }
  }
  function resize(){if(!renderer||disposed)return;var w=frame.clientWidth;var h=Math.round(w*(window.innerWidth<500?.96:.75));if(document.fullscreenElement===stage || stage.classList.contains('rc-expanded'))h=Math.min(h,window.innerHeight-160);h=Math.max(200,h);renderer.setSize(w,h,false);canvas.style.height=h+'px';camera.aspect=w/h;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();if(composer){composer.setSize(w,h);if(bloomPass)bloomPass.setSize(w,h);}}
  function boot(){
    if(disposed||!canvas.isConnected)return;
    if(typeof THREE==='undefined'){loader=document.createElement('script');loader.src='vendor/three/three.min.js';loader.onload=function(){withPost(start);};loader.onerror=loadFailure;document.head.appendChild(loader);}
    else withPost(start);
  }
  function withPost(fn){if(window.dssLoadPost){window.dssLoadPost(function(){if(!disposed)fn();});}else fn();}
  function loadFailure(){if(disposed)return;beginButton.disabled=true;cover.querySelector('#rc-instructions').textContent='The night could not load. Reload to try again, or go on to the sixth.';document.getElementById('rc-lose').style.display='block';}
  // ---- textures ----
  function radialTex(inner,outer,size){var c=document.createElement('canvas');c.width=c.height=size||64;var x=c.getContext('2d');var g=x.createRadialGradient(c.width/2,c.height/2,0,c.width/2,c.height/2,c.width/2);g.addColorStop(0,inner);g.addColorStop(.35,inner);g.addColorStop(1,outer);x.fillStyle=g;x.fillRect(0,0,c.width,c.height);var t=new THREE.CanvasTexture(c);t.minFilter=THREE.LinearFilter;return t;}
  function sprite(tex,color,size,additive){var m=new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map:tex,color:color,transparent:true,depthWrite:false,blending:additive?THREE.AdditiveBlending:THREE.NormalBlending});var s=new THREE.Sprite(m);s.scale.set(size,size,1);return s;}
  // ---- world ----
  function noise(x,z){return Math.sin(x*.11)*Math.cos(z*.07)*1.6+Math.sin(x*.31+z*.17)*.5+Math.cos(x*.05-z*.13)*2.2;}
  function buildWorld(){
    texGlow=radialTex('rgba(255,255,255,1)','rgba(255,255,255,0)',64);texSpark=radialTex('rgba(255,240,200,1)','rgba(255,200,120,0)',32);
    geoSphere=new THREE.SphereGeometry(1,10,8);geoBox=new THREE.BoxGeometry(1,1,1);geoCyl=new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1,1,1,8);
    // Layered coastal soil: mossy earth, sand, fine grit and porous pebbles.
    var soilC=document.createElement('canvas');soilC.width=soilC.height=512;var soil=soilC.getContext('2d');
    var soilImg=soil.createImageData(512,512);
    var terrainSeed=91827;function terrainRand(){terrainSeed=(Math.imul(terrainSeed,1664525)+1013904223)>>>0;return terrainSeed/4294967296;}
    for(var ty=0;ty<512;ty++)for(var tx=0;tx<512;tx++){
      var patch=Math.sin(tx*.026+Math.sin(ty*.023)*2)*Math.cos(ty*.037)+Math.sin((tx+ty)*.073)*.22;
      var grit=(terrainRand()-.5)*30,at=(ty*512+tx)*4;
      soilImg.data[at]=85+patch*13+grit;soilImg.data[at+1]=83+patch*18+grit;soilImg.data[at+2]=61+patch*7+grit;soilImg.data[at+3]=255;
    }
    soil.putImageData(soilImg,0,0);
    for(var peb=0;peb<1800;peb++){
      var x=terrainRand()*512,y=terrainRand()*512,r=.6+terrainRand()*2.5;
      soil.fillStyle='rgba(29,28,25,.3)';soil.beginPath();soil.ellipse(x+.7,y+.9,r*1.3,r*.7,.5,0,Math.PI*2);soil.fill();
      soil.fillStyle=peb%3?'rgba(145,139,117,.38)':'rgba(59,58,53,.5)';soil.beginPath();soil.ellipse(x,y,r,r*.65,.5,0,Math.PI*2);soil.fill();
    }
    var soilTex=new THREE.CanvasTexture(soilC);soilTex.encoding=THREE.sRGBEncoding;soilTex.wrapS=soilTex.wrapT=THREE.RepeatWrapping;soilTex.repeat.set(18,20);
    var sandC=document.createElement('canvas');sandC.width=sandC.height=512;var sand=sandC.getContext('2d');sand.drawImage(soilC,0,0);sand.globalCompositeOperation='color';sand.fillStyle='#b6a084';sand.fillRect(0,0,512,512);sand.globalCompositeOperation='screen';sand.globalAlpha=.22;sand.fillStyle='#9f8154';sand.fillRect(0,0,512,512);
    var sandTex=new THREE.CanvasTexture(sandC);sandTex.encoding=THREE.sRGBEncoding;sandTex.wrapS=sandTex.wrapT=THREE.RepeatWrapping;sandTex.repeat.set(2,25);
    // the slope: lumpy volcanic ground rising inland
    var g=new THREE.PlaneGeometry(260,300,52,60);g.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);var p=g.attributes.position;
    for(var i=0;i<p.count;i++){var x=p.getX(i),z=p.getZ(i);p.setY(i,groundAt(x,z-120));}
    g.computeVertexNormals();var ground=new THREE.Mesh(g,new THREE.MeshPhongMaterial({color:0xa6a58d,map:soilTex,bumpMap:soilTex,bumpScale:.16,specular:0x111311,shininess:3}));ground.position.z=-120;scene.add(ground);
    // the quarry road, a paler worn strip the machines come down
    var rg=new THREE.PlaneGeometry(14,190,4,48);rg.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);var rp=rg.attributes.position;for(var ri=0;ri<rp.count;ri++){var rx=rp.getX(ri),rz=rp.getZ(ri)-110;rp.setX(ri,rx+Math.sin(rz*.03)*-6);rp.setY(ri,groundAt(rx+Math.sin(rz*.03)*-6,rz)+.08);}rg.computeVertexNormals();var road=new THREE.Mesh(rg,new THREE.MeshPhongMaterial({color:0xd4bea0,map:sandTex,bumpMap:sandTex,bumpScale:.065,specular:0x171615,shininess:3}));road.position.z=-110;scene.add(road);
    // boulders for depth
    var rock=new THREE.MeshLambertMaterial({color:0x17131a});for(var bi=0;bi<46;bi++){var bx=(Math.random()-.5)*110,bz=-18-Math.random()*130;if(Math.abs(bx+Math.sin(bz*.03)*6)<9||bx>24)continue;var rb=new THREE.Mesh(geoSphere,rock);var rs=.8+Math.random()*2.6;rb.scale.set(rs*(1+Math.random()),rs*.7,rs);rb.position.set(bx,groundAt(bx,bz)+rs*.2,bz);rb.rotation.y=Math.random()*3;scene.add(rb);}
    // Sparse tussocks and low scrub, batched so the shoreline stays light to draw.
    var grassVerts=[];for(var blade=0;blade<3;blade++){var angle=blade*Math.PI/3,dx=Math.cos(angle)*.16,dz=Math.sin(angle)*.16;grassVerts.push(-dx,0,-dz,dx,0,dz,dx*.6,1-blade*.13,dz*.6);}
    var grassGeo=new THREE.BufferGeometry();grassGeo.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(grassVerts,3));grassGeo.computeVertexNormals();
    var tuftN=window.innerWidth<600?650:1250;
    var grassMat=new THREE.MeshPhongMaterial({color:0xa0a77b,specular:0x344b60,shininess:18,side:THREE.DoubleSide});
    // Bend the tips, leave roots planted; each patch meets the wind at a different phase.
    grassMat.onBeforeCompile=function(shader){
      shader.uniforms.rcGrassTime=skyClock;shader.uniforms.rcGrassMotion={value:reducedMotion?0:1};
      var common='uniform float rcGrassTime; uniform float rcGrassMotion; varying float rcGrassGlint;\n';
      shader.vertexShader=common+shader.vertexShader;
      shader.vertexShader=shader.vertexShader.replace('#include <beginnormal_vertex>','#include <beginnormal_vertex>\nfloat wn=rcGrassTime*1.7+instanceMatrix[3].x*.14+instanceMatrix[3].z*.09;\nfloat wg=(.7+.3*sin(rcGrassTime*.43+instanceMatrix[3].z*.04))*rcGrassMotion;\nobjectNormal=normalize(objectNormal+vec3(-sin(wn)*position.y*.45*wg,.025,cos(wn*.83)*position.y*.24*wg));');
      shader.vertexShader=shader.vertexShader.replace('#include <begin_vertex>','#include <begin_vertex>\nfloat phase=rcGrassTime*1.7+instanceMatrix[3].x*.14+instanceMatrix[3].z*.09;\nfloat gust=(.7+.3*sin(rcGrassTime*.43+instanceMatrix[3].z*.04))*rcGrassMotion;\nfloat tip=position.y*position.y;\ntransformed.x+=tip*(sin(phase)*.28+sin(phase*1.9)*.065)*gust;\ntransformed.z+=tip*cos(phase*.83)*.16*gust;\nrcGrassGlint=position.y*(.5+.5*sin(phase+.8))*gust;');
      shader.fragmentShader=common+shader.fragmentShader;
      shader.fragmentShader=shader.fragmentShader.replace('#include <color_fragment>','#include <color_fragment>\ndiffuseColor.rgb*=.94+rcGrassGlint*.18;');
    };
    var tufts=new THREE.InstancedMesh(grassGeo,grassMat,tuftN),dummy=new THREE.Object3D(),tint=new THREE.Color();
    var placed=0;while(placed<tuftN){var gx=(terrainRand()-.5)*105,gz=-10-terrainRand()*145;if(gx>25||Math.abs(gx+Math.sin(gz*.03)*6)<9)continue;
      dummy.position.set(gx,groundAt(gx,gz)+.03,gz);dummy.rotation.set(0,terrainRand()*Math.PI,0);var size=.3+terrainRand()*.8;dummy.scale.set(size,size*(.65+terrainRand()*.65),size);dummy.updateMatrix();tufts.setMatrixAt(placed,dummy.matrix);tufts.setColorAt(placed,tint.setRGB(.5+terrainRand()*.3,.52+terrainRand()*.3,.35+terrainRand()*.2));placed++;}
    scene.add(tufts);
    var pebbles=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.DodecahedronGeometry(1,0),new THREE.MeshLambertMaterial({color:0x66635d}),180);
    for(var pi=0;pi<180;pi++){var px=(terrainRand()-.5)*100,pz=-12-terrainRand()*130;var ps=.12+terrainRand()*.48;dummy.position.set(px,groundAt(px,pz)+ps*.25,pz);dummy.rotation.set(terrainRand(),terrainRand()*4,terrainRand());dummy.scale.set(ps*1.4,ps*.65,ps);dummy.updateMatrix();pebbles.setMatrixAt(pi,dummy.matrix);}scene.add(pebbles);
    // the sea, to the right, with a slow swell
    var waterMat=new THREE.MeshPhongMaterial({color:0x122d48,specular:0xb2d5f4,shininess:85});
    // Broken lace of foam follows the raised crests rather than a flat overlay.
    waterMat.onBeforeCompile=function(shader){
      shader.uniforms.rcWaterTime=skyClock;
      shader.vertexShader='varying vec3 rcWater;\n'+shader.vertexShader.replace('#include <begin_vertex>','#include <begin_vertex>\nrcWater=position;');
      shader.fragmentShader='uniform float rcWaterTime; varying vec3 rcWater;\n'+shader.fragmentShader.replace('#include <color_fragment>','#include <color_fragment>\nfloat crest=smoothstep(0.8,1.4,rcWater.y);\nfloat lace=0.45+0.55*smoothstep(-0.2,0.65,sin(rcWater.x*.9+rcWater.z*1.6+rcWaterTime*.3)*sin(rcWater.z*2.0-rcWater.x*.6));\nfloat foam=crest*lace;\ndiffuseColor.rgb=mix(diffuseColor.rgb,vec3(.65,.81,.9),foam*.85);');
    };
    var sg=new THREE.PlaneGeometry(240,260,window.innerWidth<600?40:56,window.innerWidth<600?44:60);sg.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);sea=new THREE.Mesh(sg,waterMat);sea.position.set(150,-2.4,-70);scene.add(sea);seaPos=sg.attributes.position;seaBase=new Float32Array(seaPos.count*2);for(var si=0;si<seaPos.count;si++){seaBase[si*2]=seaPos.getX(si);seaBase[si*2+1]=seaPos.getZ(si);}
    // A broken reflection lies on the water, rather than standing upright like a beam.
    var rc=document.createElement('canvas');rc.width=64;rc.height=256;var rx=rc.getContext('2d');
    for(var stripe=0;stripe<75;stripe++){var sy=stripe/75,sw=(.15+.85*Math.sin(sy*Math.PI))*(12+Math.random()*44);rx.fillStyle='rgba(213,232,255,'+(.08+Math.random()*.4)*Math.sin(sy*Math.PI)+')';rx.fillRect((64-sw)/2+(Math.random()-.5)*5,sy*256,sw,1+Math.random()*2);}
    shine=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(28,125,6,32),new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({map:new THREE.CanvasTexture(rc),color:0xcfe0ff,transparent:true,opacity:.3,blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending,depthWrite:false,side:THREE.DoubleSide}));shine.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;shine.position.set(72,0,-105);scene.add(shine);updateSea(0);
    // the moon, low over the water, rising through the game
    moon=sprite(texGlow,0xf6f1e2,17,true);moon.position.set(72,10,-190);scene.add(moon);
    var halo=sprite(texGlow,0xb9c8ee,44,true);halo.material.opacity=.14;moon.add(halo);halo.scale.set(3.2,3.2,1);
    // A baked celestial panorama: layered nebula arms, dark dust lanes and star clusters.
    // One texture/draw keeps the richer sky inexpensive on phones.
    var skyC=document.createElement('canvas');skyC.width=2048;skyC.height=1024;
    var skyCtx=skyC.getContext('2d');var skyWash=skyCtx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,1024);
    skyWash.addColorStop(0,'#030605');skyWash.addColorStop(.35,'#0a1210');skyWash.addColorStop(.52,'#0e1814');skyWash.addColorStop(1,'#040806');skyCtx.fillStyle=skyWash;skyCtx.fillRect(0,0,2048,1024);
    var skySeed=27183;function skyRand(){skySeed=(Math.imul(skySeed,1664525)+1013904223)>>>0;return skySeed/4294967296;}
    function cloudPuff(x,y,r,rgb,alpha){var glow=skyCtx.createRadialGradient(x,y,0,x,y,r);glow.addColorStop(0,'rgba('+rgb+','+alpha+')');glow.addColorStop(.45,'rgba('+rgb+','+(alpha*.4)+')');glow.addColorStop(1,'rgba('+rgb+',0)');skyCtx.fillStyle=glow;skyCtx.fillRect(x-r,y-r,r*2,r*2);}
    skyCtx.globalCompositeOperation='screen';
    var nebulaColors=['60,90,80','90,100,96','40,80,70','120,128,124','70,96,88']; /* 2026-10-23 (Sam): bottle-green and silver; the turquoise spirits and amber targets are gameplay and untouched */
    for(var arm=0;arm<3;arm++){
      for(var puff=0;puff<540;puff++){
        var u=puff/539*Math.PI*2,x=u/Math.PI/2*2048;
        var curl=u*4+arm*2.1,band=345+Math.sin(u*2+arm*.8)*95+Math.cos(u*3)*35;
        var spread=(skyRand()-.5)*85;
        var py=band+Math.sin(curl)*26+spread-arm*45;
        cloudPuff(x+Math.cos(curl)*22,py,18+skyRand()*57,nebulaColors[(puff%2+arm)%nebulaColors.length],.05+skyRand()*.075);
      }
    }
    // Broken inky filaments cut through the luminous clouds.
    skyCtx.globalCompositeOperation='source-over';
    for(var lane=0;lane<3;lane++){
      skyCtx.beginPath();for(var lx=0;lx<=2048;lx+=8){var lu=lx/2048*Math.PI*2,ly=325+Math.sin(lu*2+lane*.12)*93+Math.cos(lu*3)*35+lane*18+Math.sin(lu*13)*5;if(lx===0)skyCtx.moveTo(lx,ly);else skyCtx.lineTo(lx,ly);}
      skyCtx.strokeStyle='rgba(4,7,19,.23)';skyCtx.lineWidth=5+lane*4;skyCtx.stroke();
    }
    // Separate the clouds from the stars so only the gas slowly curls.
    var nebulaC=document.createElement('canvas');nebulaC.width=2048;nebulaC.height=1024;nebulaC.getContext('2d').drawImage(skyC,0,0);
    skyCtx.clearRect(0,0,2048,1024);
    var starTints=['190,213,255','255,233,191','222,218,255','255,180,143','179,226,238'];
    function paintStar(x,y,r,tint,bright){
      if(bright)cloudPuff(x,y,5+r*4,tint,.17);
      skyCtx.fillStyle='rgba('+tint+','+(bright?.94:.2+skyRand()*.55)+')';skyCtx.beginPath();skyCtx.arc(x,y,r,0,Math.PI*2);skyCtx.fill();
      if(bright && r>1.5){skyCtx.strokeStyle='rgba('+tint+',.36)';skyCtx.lineWidth=.55;skyCtx.beginPath();skyCtx.moveTo(x-r*3.5,y);skyCtx.lineTo(x+r*3.5,y);skyCtx.moveTo(x,y-r*3.5);skyCtx.lineTo(x,y+r*3.5);skyCtx.stroke();}
    }
    for(var star=0;star<6200;star++){
      var sx=skyRand()*2048,sy=skyRand()*535,roll=skyRand(),sr=roll>.993?1.4+skyRand():roll>.92?.7+skyRand()*.4:.2+skyRand()*.45;
      paintStar(sx,sy,sr,starTints[Math.floor(skyRand()*starTints.length)],roll>.993);
    }
    // Tight clusters have many fine stars and a few warm/red or blue giants.
    for(var cluster=0;cluster<12;cluster++){
      var cx=skyRand()*2048,cy=90+skyRand()*330;
      for(var cs=0;cs<100;cs++){var angle=skyRand()*Math.PI*2,rr=Math.pow(skyRand(),2)*34;paintStar(cx+Math.cos(angle)*rr,cy+Math.sin(angle)*rr*.65,.2+skyRand()*.55,starTints[cluster%5],false);}
    }
    var skyTex=new THREE.CanvasTexture(skyC);skyTex.encoding=THREE.sRGBEncoding;skyTex.wrapS=THREE.RepeatWrapping;
    var nebulaTex=new THREE.CanvasTexture(nebulaC);nebulaTex.encoding=THREE.sRGBEncoding;nebulaTex.wrapS=THREE.RepeatWrapping;
    var nebulaMat=new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({map:nebulaTex,side:THREE.BackSide,fog:false,toneMapped:false,depthWrite:false});
    nebulaMat.onBeforeCompile=function(shader){
      shader.uniforms.rcSkyTime=skyClock;
      shader.fragmentShader='uniform float rcSkyTime;\n'+shader.fragmentShader.replace('#include <map_fragment>','#ifdef USE_MAP\nvec2 gasUV=vUv;\nfloat flow=rcSkyTime*0.035;\ngasUV.x+=0.007*sin(vUv.y*21.0+flow)+0.004*sin(vUv.x*18.0-flow*.7);\ngasUV.y+=0.009*cos(vUv.x*16.0+flow*.8)*sin(vUv.y*3.14159);\nvec4 gas=mapTexelToLinear(texture2D(map,gasUV));\ndiffuseColor*=gas;\n#endif');
    };
    nebulaSky=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(310,48,24),nebulaMat);nebulaSky.rotation.y=.35;nebulaSky.renderOrder=-3;scene.add(nebulaSky);
    var starMat=new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({map:skyTex,side:THREE.BackSide,fog:false,toneMapped:false,transparent:true,depthWrite:false});
    starMat.onBeforeCompile=function(shader){
      shader.uniforms.rcSkyTime=skyClock;
      shader.fragmentShader='uniform float rcSkyTime;\n'+shader.fragmentShader.replace('#include <map_fragment>','#include <map_fragment>\nfloat phase=fract(sin(dot(floor(vUv*vec2(900.0,450.0)),vec2(127.1,311.7)))*43758.5453);\nfloat shimmer=0.88+0.12*sin(rcSkyTime*(0.65+phase*.85)+phase*62.8);\ndiffuseColor.rgb*=shimmer;');
    };
    stars=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(309,48,24),starMat);stars.rotation.y=.35;stars.renderOrder=-2;scene.add(stars);
    // Porous volcanic tuff: mineral mottling, pits and fine weather cracks.
    var sc=document.createElement('canvas');sc.width=sc.height=128;var cx=sc.getContext('2d');cx.fillStyle='#938879';cx.fillRect(0,0,128,128);
    for(var grain=0;grain<4200;grain++){
      var gx=Math.sin(grain*127.1+5)*43758.5453,gz=Math.sin(grain*311.7+2)*21742.4;
      cx.fillStyle=grain%3?'rgba(45,39,34,.22)':'rgba(212,195,162,.3)';cx.fillRect((gx-Math.floor(gx))*128,(gz-Math.floor(gz))*128,1+grain%3,1+grain%2);
    }
    for(var pit=0;pit<90;pit++){
      var px=(Math.sin(pit*13.7+2)*.5+.5)*128,py=(Math.sin(pit*47.3)*.5+.5)*128;
      cx.fillStyle='rgba(32,29,28,.35)';cx.beginPath();cx.ellipse(px,py,.7+pit%3,.5+pit%2,.4*pit,0,Math.PI*2);cx.fill();
    }
    cx.strokeStyle='rgba(40,35,31,.35)';cx.lineWidth=.6;
    for(var crack=0;crack<5;crack++){cx.beginPath();cx.moveTo(15+crack*25,0);for(var c=1;c<7;c++)cx.lineTo(15+crack*25+Math.sin(c*3+crack)*4,c*13);cx.stroke();}
    var stoneTex=new THREE.CanvasTexture(sc);stoneTex.wrapS=stoneTex.wrapT=THREE.RepeatWrapping;stoneTex.repeat.set(2,2);
    moaiStone=new THREE.MeshPhongMaterial({color:0x8b8177,map:stoneTex,bumpMap:stoneTex,bumpScale:.045,specular:0x16151a,shininess:4});
    // the wall you stand behind, and the moai beside you, backs to the sea
    var stone=new THREE.MeshLambertMaterial({color:0x2a2426});
    for(var wx=-24;wx<=24;wx+=3.2){var b=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,stone);b.scale.set(3,.8+Math.random()*.35,1.4);b.position.set(wx+Math.random()*.4,-.2,WALL_Z+2.6+Math.random()*.3);b.rotation.y=(Math.random()-.5)*.1;scene.add(b);}
    [[-7.2,-11,8.2,0],[7.8,-12.5,8.8,0],[-15.5,-15,7.6,0],[16.5,-17,7.9,0],[-24,-19,7,0],[25,-21,7.2,0]].forEach(function(m,mi){
      scene.add(makeMoai(m[0],m[1],m[2]));
      for(var coil=0;coil<3;coil++){
        var wisp=sprite(texGlow,0xa7c7ed,1,false);wisp.scale.set(5.5+coil*1.5,1.3+coil*.3,1);wisp.material.opacity=.13;
        wisp.userData={x:m[0],z:m[1],h:m[2],phase:mi*2.399+coil*2.094,coil:coil};scene.add(wisp);moaiWisps.push(wisp);
      }
    });
    // the quarry rim and its red lamps on poles
    for(var l=0;l<9;l++){var lx=-70+l*17+Math.random()*6,lz=-120-Math.random()*40;var pole=new THREE.Mesh(geoCyl,stone);pole.scale.set(.25,7,.25);pole.position.set(lx,3+noise(lx,lz),lz);scene.add(pole);var lamp=sprite(texGlow,0xff4a2e,3.2,true);lamp.position.set(lx,7+noise(lx,lz),lz);scene.add(lamp);lampSprites.push(lamp);}
    // lights: the moon, and a cold hemisphere
    hemi=new THREE.HemisphereLight(0x5e6e68,0x211820,.42);scene.add(hemi);
    moonLight=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xc8ccd4,.95);moonLight.position.set(60,48,-120);scene.add(moonLight);
    var quarryLight=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xa86a50,.3);quarryLight.position.set(-60,12,-120);scene.add(quarryLight);
    var shoreFill=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0x6a7e78,.28);shoreFill.position.set(-12,16,20);scene.add(shoreFill);
    flash=new THREE.PointLight(0xffd9a0,0,26,2);flash.position.set(.6,2.4,-1.2);scene.add(flash);
    // Low sea-fog drifts around the rocks while leaving the target lamps clear.
    for(var fm=0;fm<(window.innerWidth<600?10:16);fm++){
      var fogBank=sprite(texGlow,0x8193ac,1,false);fogBank.material.opacity=.075;
      fogBank.scale.set(32+fm%4*7,4+fm%3*2,1);scene.add(fogBank);shoreMist.push(fogBank);
    }
    // The old ones: intersecting veils, living eyelets and a hollow, luminous centre.
    var spiritC=document.createElement('canvas');spiritC.width=256;spiritC.height=384;
    var spx=spiritC.getContext('2d');
    var veil=spx.createRadialGradient(128,190,12,128,190,155);veil.addColorStop(0,'rgba(18,179,143,.03)');veil.addColorStop(.55,'rgba(72,236,181,.13)');veil.addColorStop(1,'rgba(56,220,180,0)');spx.fillStyle=veil;spx.fillRect(0,0,256,384);
    spx.translate(128,192);spx.scale(.72,1);spx.translate(-128,-192);
    // Six folded, feather-like veils, without a head, face or human body.
    for(var wing=0;wing<6;wing++){
      spx.save();spx.translate(128,192);spx.rotate(wing*Math.PI/3+.23);
      var wg=spx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,-162);wg.addColorStop(0,'rgba(18,168,135,.03)');wg.addColorStop(.65,'rgba(74,240,182,.25)');wg.addColorStop(1,'rgba(194,255,222,.65)');
      spx.beginPath();spx.moveTo(0,-10);spx.bezierCurveTo(-48,-58,-30,-122,0,-170);spx.bezierCurveTo(14,-126,47,-83,0,-10);spx.fillStyle=wg;spx.fill();spx.strokeStyle='rgba(155,255,214,.42)';spx.lineWidth=1.2;spx.stroke();
      for(var feather=0;feather<9;feather++){var yy=-34-feather*13;spx.beginPath();spx.moveTo(0,yy+12);spx.quadraticCurveTo(-15,yy+3,-19+feather*1.3,yy-14);spx.strokeStyle='rgba(125,255,204,.22)';spx.stroke();}
      spx.restore();
    }
    // Wavy intersecting wheels carry many eyes, rather than a pair of cartoon eyes.
    for(var wheel=0;wheel<3;wheel++){
      spx.save();spx.translate(128,192);spx.rotate((wheel-1)*.6);
      spx.beginPath();for(var step=0;step<=120;step++){var t=step/120*Math.PI*2,rr=1+.035*Math.sin(t*9+wheel),xx=Math.cos(t)*(49+wheel*9)*rr,yy=Math.sin(t)*145*rr;if(!step)spx.moveTo(xx,yy);else spx.lineTo(xx,yy);}spx.strokeStyle='rgba(116,255,201,.62)';spx.lineWidth=1.7;spx.stroke();spx.restore();
    }
    function oldEye(x,y,angle,size){spx.save();spx.translate(x,y);spx.rotate(angle);spx.beginPath();spx.moveTo(-size,0);spx.quadraticCurveTo(0,-size*.8,size,0);spx.quadraticCurveTo(0,size*.8,-size,0);spx.fillStyle='rgba(173,255,215,.85)';spx.fill();spx.fillStyle='#075d4d';spx.beginPath();spx.ellipse(0,0,size*.25,size*.36,0,0,Math.PI*2);spx.fill();spx.restore();}
    for(var eye=0;eye<13;eye++){var angle=eye/13*Math.PI*2+.17;oldEye(128+Math.cos(angle)*64,192+Math.sin(angle)*137,angle+Math.PI/2,5.5+eye%3);}
    oldEye(128,192,0,22);
    texSpirit=new THREE.CanvasTexture(spiritC);texSpirit.encoding=THREE.sRGBEncoding;
    var lampC=document.createElement('canvas');lampC.width=lampC.height=64;var lcx=lampC.getContext('2d');
    var lampGlow=lcx.createRadialGradient(32,32,4,32,32,31);lampGlow.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,75,5,.5)');lampGlow.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,75,5,0)');lcx.fillStyle=lampGlow;lcx.fillRect(0,0,64,64);
    lcx.beginPath();lcx.moveTo(32,12);lcx.lineTo(53,32);lcx.lineTo(32,52);lcx.lineTo(11,32);lcx.closePath();lcx.fillStyle='#ff6819';lcx.fill();lcx.strokeStyle='#ffba52';lcx.lineWidth=2;lcx.stroke();lcx.fillStyle='#6c1907';lcx.fillRect(22,29,20,6);
    texMachineLamp=new THREE.CanvasTexture(lampC);texMachineLamp.encoding=THREE.sRGBEncoding;
    spiritMat=new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0x24cdb2,transparent:true,opacity:.08,depthWrite:false});
    for(var sI=0;sI<4;sI++)spirits.push(makeSpirit(sI));
    // tracer
    var tg=new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints([new THREE.Vector3(),new THREE.Vector3()]);tracer=new THREE.Line(tg,new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xffe6b0,transparent:true,opacity:0}));tracer.frustumCulled=false;scene.add(tracer);
  }
  function makeMoai(x,z,h){
    var grp=new THREE.Group(),mat=moaiStone;
    var body=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(h*.19,h*.27,h*.58,7),mat);body.position.y=h*.29;grp.add(body);
    var head=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,mat);head.scale.set(h*.3,h*.46,h*.28);head.position.y=h*.58+h*.22;grp.add(head);
    var brow=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,mat);brow.scale.set(h*.33,h*.06,h*.31);brow.position.y=h*.58+h*.36;grp.add(brow);
    var nose=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,mat);nose.scale.set(h*.07,h*.22,h*.09);nose.position.set(0,h*.58+h*.2,-h*.16);grp.add(nose);
    var chin=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,mat);chin.scale.set(h*.26,h*.1,h*.3);chin.position.y=h*.58+h*.02;grp.add(chin);
    grp.position.set(x,groundAt(x,z)+.2,z);grp.rotation.y=(x<0?-.22:.22);return grp;
  }
  function makeSpirit(i){
    var grp=new THREE.Group();var core=new THREE.Mesh(geoSphere,spiritMat);core.scale.set(.5,1.45,.5);grp.add(core);
    var glow=sprite(texSpirit,0xffffff,1,false);glow.scale.set(2.1,3.3,1);glow.material.opacity=.94;glow.material.toneMapped=false;grp.add(glow);
    var hit=new THREE.Mesh(geoSphere,new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({visible:false}));hit.scale.set(.7,1.65,.7);grp.add(hit);
    var s={grp:grp,hit:hit,core:core,glow:glow,phase:i*1.7,side:i%2?1:-1,x:-20+i*13,z:-38-i*9,y:3,t:0,attend:null,flare:0,gone:0};hit.userData.spirit=s;grp.position.set(s.x,s.y,s.z);scene.add(grp);hitMeshes.push(hit);return s;
  }
  // ---- machines ----
  function spawn(kind){
    var grp=new THREE.Group(),dark=new THREE.MeshPhongMaterial({color:0x373348,specular:0xb7b5dc,shininess:85,emissive:0x090510}),m={kind:kind,grp:grp,alive:true,hp:1,t:0,dead:0,x:(Math.random()-.5)*56,z:kind==='drone'?-92-Math.random()*14:kind==='rig'?-112:-104,y:0,speed:6,parts:{}};
    if(kind==='drone'){m.hp=1;m.speed=5.8+Math.random()*1.2;m.y=6+Math.random()*4;var body=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.OctahedronGeometry(1.2),dark);body.scale.set(1.25,.48,1.25);grp.add(body);
      m.parts.rotors=[];[[-.7,-.7],[.7,-.7],[-.7,.7],[.7,.7]].forEach(function(o){var arm=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,dark);arm.scale.set(.12,.1,1.1);arm.position.set(o[0],.1,o[1]);arm.rotation.y=Math.atan2(o[0],o[1]);grp.add(arm);var rot=new THREE.Mesh(geoCyl,new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0x5a5f68,transparent:true,opacity:.35}));rot.scale.set(.55,.03,.55);rot.position.set(o[0],.25,o[1]);grp.add(rot);m.parts.rotors.push(rot);});
      var lamp=sprite(texMachineLamp,0xffffff,3.1,false);lamp.position.y=-.3;grp.add(lamp);m.parts.lamp=lamp;
      var hit=new THREE.Mesh(geoSphere,new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({visible:false}));hit.scale.set(2.2,1.6,2.2);grp.add(hit);m.hit=hit;}
    else if(kind==='rig'){m.hp=2;m.speed=3.2;m.y=0;m.stopZ=-40-Math.random()*14;m.lit=0;m.parts.legs=[];var legs=[[-1,-1],[1,-1],[0,1]];legs.forEach(function(o){var leg=new THREE.Mesh(geoCyl,dark);leg.scale.set(.14,5.2,.14);leg.position.set(o[0]*.9,2.6,o[1]*.9);leg.rotation.z=-o[0]*.28;leg.rotation.x=o[1]*.28;leg.userData={rx:leg.rotation.x,rz:leg.rotation.z};grp.add(leg);m.parts.legs.push(leg);});
      var head=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(1,0),dark);head.scale.set(1.15,.8,.9);head.position.y=5.6;grp.add(head);m.parts.head=head;
      var lamp=sprite(texMachineLamp,0xffffff,2.2,false);lamp.position.set(0,5.6,.6);lamp.material.opacity=.25;grp.add(lamp);m.parts.lamp=lamp;
      var beam=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.ConeGeometry(7,70,18,1,true),new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0xff8e38,transparent:true,opacity:0,blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending,depthWrite:false,side:THREE.DoubleSide}));beam.rotation.x=Math.PI/2+.06;beam.position.set(0,5.6,35);grp.add(beam);m.parts.beam=beam;
      var hit=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({visible:false}));hit.scale.set(3.0,2.8,2.5);hit.position.y=5.4;grp.add(hit);m.hit=hit;}
    else{m.hp=3;m.speed=3.4;m.y=0;m.parts.tracks=[];var body=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.OctahedronGeometry(1),dark);body.scale.set(2.2,1.3,3.1);body.position.y=1.2;grp.add(body);var cab=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,dark);cab.scale.set(2,1.3,1.6);cab.position.set(0,2.5,.6);grp.add(cab);
      var blade=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,new THREE.MeshLambertMaterial({color:0x4a3a2e}));blade.scale.set(4.4,1.6,.4);blade.position.set(0,.9,3.1);grp.add(blade);
      [[-1.9],[1.9]].forEach(function(o){var track=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,new THREE.MeshLambertMaterial({color:0x17181c}));track.scale.set(1,1,4.6);track.position.set(o[0],.5,0);grp.add(track);m.parts.tracks.push(track);});
      m.parts.lamps=[];[-1.1,1.1].forEach(function(lx){var lamp=sprite(texMachineLamp,0xffffff,2.8,false);lamp.position.set(lx,1.9,2.4);grp.add(lamp);m.parts.lamps.push(lamp);});
      var hit=new THREE.Mesh(geoBox,new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({visible:false}));hit.scale.set(4,3.6,5);hit.position.y=1.8;grp.add(hit);m.hit=hit;}
    // The occupation has no organic curves: canted cages, floating rings, uneven fins.
    m.parts.cages=[];
    var edgeMat=new THREE.MeshPhongMaterial({color:0x9583aa,emissive:0x221127,specular:0xe8d5e9,shininess:90});
    var haloMat=kind==='rig'?null:new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0xd88739,transparent:true,opacity:.65});
    if(kind==='drone'){
      for(var ring=0;ring<2;ring++){
        var cage=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(1.5+ring*.2,.045,5,28),ring?haloMat:edgeMat);
        cage.rotation.set(.6+ring*.9,.4,ring*.7);grp.add(cage);m.parts.cages.push(cage);
      }
    }else if(kind==='rig'){
      var cage=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(1.35,.065,5,24),edgeMat);cage.position.y=5.6;cage.rotation.y=.5;grp.add(cage);m.parts.cages.push(cage);
      for(var tine=0;tine<3;tine++){
        var prong=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.ConeGeometry(.14,1.5+tine*.35,4),edgeMat);prong.position.set((tine-1)*.55,6.8+tine*.13,0);prong.rotation.z=(tine-1)*-.25;grp.add(prong);
      }
    }else{
      for(var fin=0;fin<5;fin++){
        var sail=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.ConeGeometry(.65,1.6+fin%2*.6,3),edgeMat);sail.scale.z=.25;sail.position.set(0,2.7,-1.9+fin*.75);sail.rotation.z=.22;grp.add(sail);
      }
      var cage=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(.9,.065,5,24),haloMat);cage.position.set(0,2.6,.6);cage.rotation.x=.65;grp.add(cage);m.parts.cages.push(cage);
    }
    m.armor=dark;m.hitFlash=0;m.kick=0;m.brokenLamp=0;m.hitColor=new THREE.Color(0xff9d51);
    m.fadeMaterials=[];var seenMaterials=new Set();grp.traverse(function(o){if(o.material && o.material.color && o!==m.hit && !seenMaterials.has(o.material)){seenMaterials.add(o.material);m.fadeMaterials.push({mat:o.material,color:o.material.color.clone()});}});
    m.hit.userData.machine=m;hitMeshes.push(m.hit);grp.position.set(m.x,groundAt(m.x,m.z)+m.y,m.z);scene.add(grp);machines.push(m);spawned++;return m;
  }
  function seaHeight(x,z,t){return Math.sin(x*.065+t*.7)*1.05+Math.cos(z*.095-t*.58)*.72+Math.sin(x*.14+z*.11-t*1.15)*.24;}
  function updateSea(t){
    if(!seaPos)return;
    for(var i=0;i<seaPos.count;i++){var x=seaBase[i*2],z=seaBase[i*2+1];seaPos.setY(i,seaHeight(x,z,t));}
    seaPos.needsUpdate=true;sea.geometry.computeVertexNormals();
    if(shine){var p=shine.geometry.attributes.position;for(var j=0;j<p.count;j++)p.setY(j,sea.position.y+seaHeight(p.getX(j)+shine.position.x-sea.position.x,p.getZ(j)+shine.position.z-sea.position.z,t)+.045);p.needsUpdate=true;}
  }
  function groundAt(x,z){var road=Math.max(0,1-Math.abs(x+Math.sin(z*.03)*6)/9);return Math.max(0,-z-8)*.055+noise(x,z)*(z<-14?1.4:.25)*(1-road*.7)-.6-Math.max(0,x-26)*.32;}
  function burst(pos,color,n,spread,up){var pts=new Float32Array(n*3),vel=[];for(var i=0;i<n;i++){pts[i*3]=pos.x;pts[i*3+1]=pos.y;pts[i*3+2]=pos.z;vel.push(new THREE.Vector3((Math.random()-.5)*spread,Math.random()*up,(Math.random()-.5)*spread));}
    var g=new THREE.BufferGeometry();g.setAttribute('position',new THREE.BufferAttribute(pts,3));var mat=new THREE.PointsMaterial({color:color,size:.5,map:texSpark,transparent:true,depthWrite:false,blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending});var p=new THREE.Points(g,mat);scene.add(p);bursts.push({p:p,vel:vel,t:0,life:.9+Math.random()*.5});}
  function removeMachine(m){
    var mats=new Set(),geos=new Set();m.grp.traverse(function(o){if(o.material)mats.add(o.material);if(o.geometry && o.geometry!==geoSphere && o.geometry!==geoBox && o.geometry!==geoCyl)geos.add(o.geometry);});mats.forEach(function(mat){mat.dispose();});geos.forEach(function(g){g.dispose();});var i=machines.indexOf(m);if(i>=0)machines.splice(i,1);var h=hitMeshes.indexOf(m.hit);if(h>=0)hitMeshes.splice(h,1);scene.remove(m.grp);}
  function kill(m){if(!m.alive)return;m.alive=false;m.dead=0;m.deathOrigin=m.grp.position.clone();silenced++;shotCounts[m.kind]++;var wp=new THREE.Vector3();m.hit.getWorldPosition(wp);burst(wp,0xffa24a,m.kind==='drone'?26:40,m.kind==='crawler'?5:8,m.kind==='rig'?5:7);if(m.kind==='crawler')burst(wp,0x8c8070,28,7,3);
    if(m.parts.lamp)m.parts.lamp.visible=false;if(m.parts.lamps)m.parts.lamps.forEach(function(l){l.visible=false;});if(m.parts.beam)m.parts.beam.material.opacity=0;if(m.lit)m.lit=0;
    if(eng)eng.die();if(silenced===Math.floor(WIN/2))announce('HALF THE ROAD IS DARK');if(silenced>=WIN && ending<0)endGame('win');}
  function damage(m,point){m.hp--;m.hitFlash=.24;m.kick=.22;burst(point,0xffd28a,14,5,4);if(eng)eng.hit();
    if(m.kind==='rig' && m.hp===1){m.lit=0;m.parts.beam.material.opacity=0;m.parts.lamp.visible=true;m.brokenLamp=.28;announce('LAMP OUT · ONE MORE HIT TO THE HEAD');}
    if(m.hp<=0)kill(m);else if(m.kind==='crawler')announce('CRAWLER · '+m.hp+' HIT'+(m.hp===1?'':'S')+' LEFT',1100);}
  function reachWall(m){m.alive=false;m.wall=true;m.dead=0;m.deathOrigin=m.grp.position.clone();atWall++;if(eng)eng.wall();announce(atWall>=LOSE?'THE ROAD IS THEIRS':(atWall===1?'ONE AT THE WALL':'ANOTHER AT THE WALL'));if(atWall>=LOSE && ending<0)endGame('wall');}
  var WAVES=[null,{name:'DRONES OVER THE QUARRY ROAD',list:['drone','drone','drone','drone'],gap:2.8},{name:'THEY ARE BRINGING THE LIGHTS',list:['rig','drone','drone','rig','drone'],gap:3.2},{name:'THE CRAWLER · THREE ROUNDS',list:['drone','crawler','drone','rig','drone'],gap:3.0}];
  function startWave(n){wave=n;waveT=0;queue=WAVES[n].list.slice();announce(WAVES[n].name,2200);}
  function reload(){if(reloadT>0||rounds===CLIP||finished||ending>=0)return;reloadT=RELOAD;fireQueued=false;if(eng)eng.bolt();}
  function activeTargets(){return hitMeshes.filter(function(h){var m=h.userData.machine,sp=h.userData.spirit;return m?m.alive:sp && sp.gone<=0;});}
  function fire(){
    if(reloadT>0||shotT>0)return;if(rounds<=0){reload();if(eng)eng.empty();return;}
    rounds--;shotT=BOLT;recoil=1;flash.intensity=2.6;if(eng)eng.shot();
    scene.updateMatrixWorld(true);camera.updateMatrixWorld(true);aimVec.set(aim.x,aim.y);raycaster.setFromCamera(aimVec,camera);var hits=raycaster.intersectObjects(activeTargets(),false);var end=null;
    if(hits.length){var h=hits[0];end=h.point.clone();var sp=h.object.userData.spirit,mc=h.object.userData.machine;
      if(sp && sp.gone<=0){disturbed++;sp.flare=1;sp.gone=3.5;hitMeshes.splice(hitMeshes.indexOf(sp.hit),1);burst(end,0x9ffff2,40,6,4);announce(disturbed>=LOSE?'THE OLD ONES TURN AWAY':'THE OLD ONES ARE NOT YOUR TARGETS',2200);if(eng)eng.spirit();if(disturbed>=LOSE && ending<0)endGame('spirits');}
      else if(mc && mc.alive)damage(mc,end);}
    if(!end)end=raycaster.ray.at(180,new THREE.Vector3());
    var from=new THREE.Vector3(.55,-.32,-1.1).applyQuaternion(camera.quaternion).add(camera.position);var tp=tracer.geometry.attributes.position;tp.setXYZ(0,from.x,from.y,from.z);tp.setXYZ(1,end.x,end.y,end.z);tp.needsUpdate=true;tracerT=.14;
    if(rounds===0)reload();
  }
  function endGame(kind){ending=0;endKind=kind;
    if(kind==='win'){queue=[];glare=0;machines.forEach(function(m){if(m.alive){m.alive=false;m.dead=0;m.deathOrigin=m.grp.position.clone();}});spirits.forEach(function(s){s.attend=null;s.gone=0;s.grp.visible=true;s.grp.scale.setScalar(1);});}
    clearInput();reticle.style.opacity='0';if(eng)eng.end(kind==='win');
    announce(kind==='win'?'THE MACHINES GO QUIET':kind==='spirits'?'THE OLD ONES TURN AWAY':'THE ROAD IS THEIRS',3000);}
  function updateMachines(dt){
      machines.slice().forEach(function(m){m.t+=dt;
        if(m.alive && ending>=0)return;
        if(m.alive){
          if(!reducedMotion && m.parts.cages)m.parts.cages.forEach(function(cage,i){cage.rotation.y+=dt*(i%2?-.8:.65);cage.rotation.z+=dt*.22;});
          m.hitFlash=Math.max(0,m.hitFlash-dt);m.kick*=Math.exp(-dt*12);
          m.armor.emissive.setHex(0x090510).lerp(m.hitColor,m.hitFlash/.24);
          if(m.brokenLamp>0){m.brokenLamp=Math.max(0,m.brokenLamp-dt);m.parts.lamp.material.opacity=reducedMotion?.25:(Math.sin(m.brokenLamp*95)>.1?.65:.06);if(m.brokenLamp===0)m.parts.lamp.visible=false;}
          var sp=m.speed*(1+Math.min(5,silenced)*.025);
          if(m.kind==='drone'){m.z+=sp*dt;m.x+=(Math.sin(m.t*.7+m.z*.05)*1.7-m.x*.025)*dt;m.grp.position.set(m.x,groundAt(m.x,m.z)+m.y+Math.sin(m.t*2.3)*.35,m.z);m.grp.rotation.z=reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(m.t*.9)*.22+Math.sin(m.t*13)*.022;m.grp.rotation.x=reducedMotion?0:.12+Math.sin(m.t*9)*.025;if(!reducedMotion)m.parts.rotors.forEach(function(r,i){r.rotation.y+=dt*(30+i*4);});m.parts.lamp.material.opacity=.85+(reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(m.t*3)*.12);}
          else if(m.kind==='rig'){if(m.z<m.stopZ){m.z+=sp*dt;m.grp.position.set(m.x,groundAt(m.x,m.z),m.z);m.grp.rotation.z=Math.sin(m.t*3)*.05;}else if(m.hp===2){m.lit=Math.min(1,m.lit+dt*.35);m.parts.beam.material.opacity=.045*m.lit;m.parts.lamp.material.opacity=.3+.7*m.lit;m.parts.lamp.scale.set(2.2+m.lit*3,2.2+m.lit*3,1);glare=Math.max(glare,m.lit);m.grp.rotation.z=0;}}
          else{m.z+=sp*dt;m.grp.position.set(m.x,groundAt(m.x,m.z),m.z);m.grp.rotation.x=(groundAt(m.x,m.z-2)-groundAt(m.x,m.z+2))*.2;m.parts.lamps.forEach(function(l){l.material.opacity=.85+Math.sin(m.t*11)*.1;});}
          if(!reducedMotion){
            if(m.parts.legs)m.parts.legs.forEach(function(leg,i){var step=m.z<m.stopZ?Math.sin(m.t*5+i*2.094)*.09:0;leg.rotation.x=leg.userData.rx+step;leg.rotation.z=leg.userData.rz+step*.6;});
            if(m.parts.head)m.parts.head.rotation.y=Math.sin(m.t*.65)*.22;
            if(m.parts.tracks){m.grp.position.y+=Math.sin(m.t*7)*.065;m.grp.rotation.z=Math.sin(m.t*3.5)*.035;m.parts.tracks.forEach(function(track,i){track.rotation.x=Math.sin(m.t*8+i*Math.PI)*.035;});}
          }
          if(!reducedMotion && m.kick>.001)m.grp.rotation.z+=Math.sin(m.t*55)*m.kick;
          if(m.z>WALL_Z-2 && m.kind!=='rig')reachWall(m);}
        else{m.dead+=dt;
          var origin=m.deathOrigin || m.grp.position.clone();
          var ember=Math.exp(-m.dead*2);m.armor.emissive.setHex(0x8c3510).multiplyScalar(ember);
          m.fadeMaterials.forEach(function(f){f.mat.color.copy(f.color).multiplyScalar(.25+.75*Math.exp(-m.dead*.8));});
          if(m.parts.lamp)m.parts.lamp.visible=false;if(m.parts.lamps)m.parts.lamps.forEach(function(l){l.visible=false;});if(m.parts.beam)m.parts.beam.material.opacity=0;
          if(m.wall){if(!reducedMotion)m.grp.rotation.z=Math.sin(m.dead*12)*.02;if(m.dead>2.2)removeMachine(m);}
          else if(m.kind==='drone'){
            var radius=Math.min(1.2,m.dead)*.85;
            m.grp.position.set(origin.x+(reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(m.dead*9)*radius),origin.y-m.dead*m.dead*5,origin.z+(reducedMotion?0:(Math.cos(m.dead*9)-1)*radius));
            if(!reducedMotion){m.grp.rotation.x+=dt*4;m.grp.rotation.z+=dt*5;}
            if(m.grp.position.y<groundAt(m.x,m.z)+.3 || m.dead>2.5){if(!m.impact){m.impact=true;burst(new THREE.Vector3(m.grp.position.x,groundAt(m.x,m.z)+.3,m.grp.position.z),0x8e8576,18,5,2);}removeMachine(m);}
          }else if(m.kind==='rig'){
            var buckle=Math.min(1,m.dead/1.4);m.grp.position.y=origin.y-buckle*.7;
            if(!reducedMotion)m.grp.rotation.x=buckle*1.15;
            m.parts.legs.forEach(function(leg,i){leg.rotation.z=leg.userData.rz+(i%2?1:-1)*buckle*.6;});
            m.parts.head.position.y=5.6-buckle*2.2;
            if(m.dead>3)removeMachine(m);
          }else{
            m.grp.position.y=origin.y-Math.min(.65,m.dead*.35);
            if(!reducedMotion){m.grp.rotation.z=Math.sin(m.dead*9)*Math.exp(-m.dead*3)*.12;m.grp.rotation.x=Math.min(.18,m.dead*.12);}
            if(m.dead>3.2)removeMachine(m);
          }
        }
      });
  }
  // ---- update ----
  function update(dt){
    time+=dt;if(ending>=0){ending+=dt;
      glare=Math.max(0,glare-dt);
      if(endKind==='win'){
        spirits.forEach(function(s,i){var tx=[-9,-5,5,9][i],tz=-14-(i%2)*2;var target=new THREE.Vector3(tx,groundAt(tx,tz)+2.8,tz);s.grp.position.lerp(target,1-Math.exp(-dt*.8));s.glow.material.opacity=.94;});
        lampSprites.forEach(function(l){l.material.opacity=Math.max(0,l.material.opacity-dt*.7);});
      }
      if(ending>(endKind==='win'?6.5:3.6) && !finished){finished=true;clearInput();hud.textContent=endKind==='win'?(document.getElementById('rc-homeward')?'Subcomandante Fortuna lowers the rifle.':'Subcomandante Fortuna lowers the rifle. Behind him, the sixth moai opens its eye.'):endKind==='spirits'?'The spirits turn their faces away. Subcomandante Fortuna lowers the rifle.':'The lights reach the platform. Subcomandante Fortuna lowers the rifle.';
        var exit=document.getElementById(endKind==='win'?'rc-win':'rc-lose');exit.style.display='block';exit.classList.add('dss-mini-exit');
        if(endKind!=='win' && window.dssEase){window.dssEase.lost('reclaim');window.dssEase.offer(stage, { onAgain: function(){ var a = document.querySelector('.rc-again tw-link'); if (a) a.click(); }, onMove: function(){ var l = exit.querySelector('tw-link'); if (l) l.click(); } });} /* 2026-10-28 (Sam: "Easier each retry") */
        var link=exit.querySelector('tw-link');if(link){link.setAttribute('tabindex','0');link.focus({preventScroll:true});}
        var skip=document.getElementById('rc-skip');if(skip)skip.style.display='none';stage.scrollIntoView({block:'nearest'});}}
    else{
      var nudge=1.15*dt;if(held('ArrowLeft'))aim.x-=nudge;if(held('ArrowRight'))aim.x+=nudge;if(held('ArrowUp'))aim.y+=nudge*.8;if(held('ArrowDown'))aim.y-=nudge*.8;aim.x=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,aim.x));aim.y=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,aim.y));
      if(reloadT>0){reloadT-=dt;if(reloadT<=0){reloadT=0;rounds=CLIP;}}
      if(shotT>0)shotT-=dt;
      if(fireQueued){shotBuffer-=dt;if(reloadT>0 || shotBuffer<=0)fireQueued=false;else if(shotT<=0){fireQueued=false;fire();}}
      if(ending>=0)return;
      // waves: next machine from the queue every gap; next wave when the road is clear or after a while
      waveT+=dt;if(queue.length && waveT>=WAVES[wave].gap && machines.filter(function(m){return m.alive;}).length<5){waveT=0;spawn(queue.shift());}
      else if(!queue.length && wave<3 && (machines.every(function(m){return !m.alive;}) && waveT>2)){startWave(wave+1);}
      // machines
      glare=0;
      // spirits drift, attend a machine now and then, flare when hit
      spirits.forEach(function(s){s.t+=dt;
        if(s.gone>0){s.gone-=dt;s.flare=Math.max(0,s.flare-dt*1.6);s.grp.scale.setScalar(1+s.flare*2.2);s.glow.material.opacity=.94*s.flare;s.core.material=spiritMat;s.grp.visible=s.flare>0.01;if(s.gone<=0){s.x=(Math.random()-.5)*50;s.z=-30-Math.random()*45;s.attend=null;s.grp.scale.setScalar(1);s.glow.material.opacity=.94;s.grp.visible=true;if(hitMeshes.indexOf(s.hit)<0)hitMeshes.push(s.hit);}return;}
        if(!s.attend && Math.random()<dt*.06){var live=machines.filter(function(m){return m.alive && m.z<-16;});if(live.length)s.attend=live[Math.floor(Math.random()*live.length)];}
        if(s.attend && (!s.attend.alive || s.attend.z>-14))s.attend=null;
        var tx=s.attend?s.attend.x+s.side*(6+Math.sin(s.t*.7)*.7):s.x+Math.sin(s.t*.35+s.phase)*9, tz=s.attend?s.attend.z+1+Math.cos(s.t*.5)*1.2:s.z+Math.cos(s.t*.27+s.phase)*6;
        var ty=(s.attend?s.attend.grp.position.y-groundAt(s.attend.x,s.attend.z)+1.2:3)+Math.sin(s.t*1.1+s.phase)*.9;
        var gp=s.grp.position;gp.x+=(tx-gp.x)*Math.min(1,dt*1.3);gp.z+=(tz-gp.z)*Math.min(1,dt*1.3);gp.y+=(groundAt(gp.x,gp.z)+ty-gp.y)*Math.min(1,dt*1.5);
        s.glow.material.opacity=reducedMotion?.94:.91+Math.sin(s.t*1.3+s.phase)*.04;
        s.glow.material.rotation=reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(s.t*.28+s.phase)*.07;
      });
      if(spawned>=14 && machines.every(function(m){return !m.alive;}) && ending<0)endGame(silenced>=WIN?'win':'wall');
    }
    updateMachines(dt);
    // bursts
    bursts.slice().forEach(function(b){b.t+=dt;var p=b.p.geometry.attributes.position;for(var i=0;i<b.vel.length;i++){var v=b.vel[i];v.y-=14*dt;p.setXYZ(i,p.getX(i)+v.x*dt,p.getY(i)+v.y*dt,p.getZ(i)+v.z*dt);}p.needsUpdate=true;b.p.material.opacity=Math.max(0,1-b.t/b.life);if(b.t>b.life){scene.remove(b.p);b.p.geometry.dispose();b.p.material.dispose();bursts.splice(bursts.indexOf(b),1);}});
    if(tracerT>0){tracerT-=dt;tracer.material.opacity=Math.max(0,tracerT/.14);}
    flash.intensity=Math.max(0,flash.intensity-dt*24);recoil=Math.max(0,recoil-dt*4.5);
    glareEl.style.opacity=(glare*.22).toFixed(2);
  }
  // ---- draw ----
  function draw(dt){
    if(!renderer||disposed)return;time+=0;breathe+=dt;updateScoreboard();
    var swayAmp=reducedMotion?0:(.004+glare*.006), swayHz=1+glare*.2;
    sway.x=Math.sin(breathe*swayHz*1.7)*swayAmp;sway.y=Math.cos(breathe*swayHz*1.1)*swayAmp*.7;
    var yaw=-aim.x*.34+sway.x, pitch=aim.y*.19+sway.y+recoil*.025;
    camera.position.set(0,3+(reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(breathe*.9)*.03),0);camera.rotation.set(pitch,yaw,recoil*.01,'YXZ');
    flash.position.copy(new THREE.Vector3(.5,-.2,-2).applyQuaternion(camera.quaternion).add(camera.position));
    // moonrise across the game; brighter when the road is won
    var target=started?Math.min(1,moonRise+dt*(ending>=0&&endKind==='win'?.15:.012)):moonRise;moonRise=target;moon.position.y=11+moonRise*26;moonLight.position.set(72,35+moonRise*26,-190);moonLight.intensity=.95+moonRise*.3+(endKind==='win'&&ending>=0?Math.min(.5,ending*.15):0);
    seaTick+=dt;if(sea && !reducedMotion && seaTick>=1/24){seaTick=0;updateSea(breathe);}
    if(shine){shine.material.opacity=.14+moonRise*.13+(reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(breathe*.8)*.035+Math.sin(breathe*1.7)*.018);shine.scale.x=reducedMotion?1:1+Math.sin(breathe*.38)*.07;}
    lampSprites.forEach(function(l,i){l.material.opacity=endKind==='win'&&ending>=0?Math.max(0,1-ending/2)*.6:.55+Math.sin(breathe*2.2+i)*.25+(endKind==='wall'&&ending>=0?.3:0);});
    skyClock.value=reducedMotion?0:breathe;
    if(stars && !reducedMotion){stars.rotation.y+=dt*.00035;if(nebulaSky)nebulaSky.rotation.y=stars.rotation.y;}
    shoreMist.forEach(function(bank,i){var clock=reducedMotion?0:breathe;
      var z=-24-i*8,x=Math.sin(i*2.399+clock*.055)*33;
      bank.position.set(x,groundAt(x,z)+1.4+Math.sin(i+clock*.12)*.45,z);
      bank.material.opacity=(.055+(i%3)*.012)*(endKind==='win'&&ending>=0?.65+.35*Math.exp(-ending):1);
      bank.material.rotation=reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(clock*.08+i)*.035;
    });
    moaiWisps.forEach(function(wisp,i){var d=wisp.userData,clock=reducedMotion?0:breathe;
      var phase=d.phase+clock*.32,radius=1.9+d.coil*.45;
      var x=d.x+Math.cos(phase)*radius,z=d.z+Math.sin(phase)*radius;
      var settle=endKind==='win'&&ending>=0?1-.35*Math.min(1,ending/5):1;
      var rise=settle*(.7+d.coil*1.15)+(reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(phase*.65)*.65);
      wisp.position.set(x,groundAt(d.x,d.z)+rise,z);
      wisp.material.rotation=reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(phase)*.16;
      var moonlit=.5+.5*Math.cos(phase-.9);wisp.material.opacity=.07+moonlit*.1;
      wisp.scale.x=5.5+d.coil*1.5+(reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(phase*.8)*.8);
    });
    var r=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();reticle.style.left=((aim.x+1)/2*100)+'%';reticle.style.top=((1-aim.y)/2*100)+'%';reticle.classList.toggle('rc-hot',reloadT>0);
    // The reticle names exactly what its ray can hit; spirits never have a hidden wide halo.
    scene.updateMatrixWorld(true);camera.updateMatrixWorld(true);aimVec.set(aim.x,aim.y);raycaster.setFromCamera(aimVec,camera);
    var under=raycaster.intersectObjects(activeTargets(),false)[0];aimTarget='';
    if(under){var target=under.object.userData;aimTarget=target.spirit?'SPIRIT · DO NOT FIRE':target.machine.kind==='rig'?(target.machine.hp===2?'RIG · SHOOT THE LAMP':'RIG · ONE MORE HIT'):target.machine.kind==='crawler'?'CRAWLER · '+target.machine.hp+' HITS LEFT':'DRONE · ONE HIT';}
    reticle.style.borderColor=under && under.object.userData.spirit?'#8ff2e8':under?'#ffce82':'';
    var urgent=machines.some(function(m){return m.alive && m.kind!=='rig' && m.z>-32;});
    var label=finished?'':[reloadT>0?'RELOADING '+reloadT.toFixed(1)+'s':'',aimTarget || (urgent?'MACHINE NEAR THE WALL':glare>.3?'GLARE · SHOOT THE LAMP':'')].filter(Boolean).join('   ·   ');
    if(!finished && started && label!==lastHUD){lastHUD=label;hud.textContent=label;}
    if(eng && started && !paused && !finished)eng.update(machines.some(function(m){return m.alive && m.z>-40;}));
    if(composer)composer.render();else renderer.render(scene,camera);
  }
  function loop(now){
    if(disposed)return;if(!canvas.isConnected){cleanup();return;}
    var dt=lastNow===null?0:Math.min(.1,(now-lastNow)/1000);lastNow=now;
    if(!paused && !finished && started){accumulator+=dt;while(accumulator>=1/120){update(1/120);accumulator-=1/120;}}
    draw(paused?0:dt);
    if(eng && (!started||paused||finished))eng.silence();
    animId=requestAnimationFrame(loop);
  }
  function start(){
    if(disposed||!canvas.isConnected)return;
    try{renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({canvas:canvas,antialias:true,powerPreference:'low-power'});}catch(e){loadFailure();return;}
    renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,1.5));renderer.outputEncoding=THREE.sRGBEncoding;
    scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color(0x050a08);scene.fog=new THREE.Fog(0x0b120f,64,210);
    camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(58,4/3,.1,400);raycaster=new THREE.Raycaster();aimVec=new THREE.Vector2();
    buildWorld();
    if(typeof THREE.EffectComposer==='function' && typeof THREE.UnrealBloomPass==='function' && window.innerWidth>=600){
      try{composer=new THREE.EffectComposer(renderer);composer.addPass(new THREE.RenderPass(scene,camera));bloomPass=new THREE.UnrealBloomPass(new THREE.Vector2(canvas.width||720,canvas.height||540),.3,.5,.85);composer.addPass(bloomPass);}catch(e){composer=null;bloomPass=null;}
    }
    if(window.dssFilmGrade){var before=frame.children.length;window.dssFilmGrade(frame);for(var gi=before;gi<frame.children.length;gi++)gradeEls.push(frame.children[gi]);cover.style.zIndex='6';banner.style.zIndex='5';reticle.style.zIndex='5';glareEl.style.zIndex='4';}
    beginButton.disabled=false;resize();resizeObserver=new ResizeObserver(resize);resizeObserver.observe(frame);listen(window,'resize',resize);
    if(window.DSS_DEV)window._rcDev={canvas:canvas,snapshot:function(){return {shotCounts:{drone:shotCounts.drone,rig:shotCounts.rig,crawler:shotCounts.crawler},silenced:silenced,disturbed:disturbed,atWall:atWall,rounds:rounds,reloading:reloadT>0,wave:wave,queue:queue.length,live:machines.filter(function(m){return m.alive;}).map(function(m){return m.kind+'@'+m.z.toFixed(0);}),spirits:spirits.map(function(s){return [s.grp.position.x.toFixed(1),s.grp.position.z.toFixed(1),s.gone>0];}),glare:glare,ending:ending,endKind:endKind,finished:finished,paused:paused,started:started,aim:[aim.x,aim.y],moon:moonRise,bloom:!!composer,drawCalls:renderer.info.render.calls};},
      win:function(){if(ending<0)endGame('win');},lose:function(){if(ending<0)endGame('spirits');},spawn:function(k){return spawn(k||'drone');},aimAt:function(obj){var wp=new THREE.Vector3();obj.getWorldPosition(wp);wp.project(camera);aim.x=wp.x;aim.y=wp.y;},fire:function(){queueFire();},machines:function(){return machines;},spirits:function(){return spirits;}};
    loop(performance.now());
  }
  boot();
})();
</script>

:: The Listening Moai [dream easter] {"position":"2100,2600","size":"100,100"}
(set: $confidence to $confidence - 6)\
<!-- 2026-10-26 (Sam: "Give the Reclamation win +8 morale on the next page, like the Climb"): paid once, on whichever page the win leads to -->(if: ($easterReclaimWon is true) and ($easterReclaimPaid is not true))[(set: $easterReclaimPaid to true)(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 8))(display: "Bars Now")<div class="inventory-note">MORALE +8</div>]\
<div>
You stand before it and it before you.

It mouths an alien word and between its molten lips, at the back of its throat, you notice a sign.

‘That’s the name of those we fight for,’ the man in the balaclava says. ‘Don’t write it down.’
</div>
<span class="inventory-note">MORALE -6</span>

<div>[[Commit the sign to memory|The Glyph]]</div>

:: The Glyph [dream easter centre] {"position":"2300,2600","size":"100,100"}
<!-- Completion passage for Easter Island. Rongorongo glyph SVG reveal
     on click. Sets $easterGlyph + standard exit hooks. -->
<div>
You stare at the glyph, meditate on it, till the sense dirempts from the sign and the sense, which you now perceive in a timeless form of itself, settles in that part of you which is sensitive to eternal things.
</div>

(link: "Fix it in you")[
(set: $easterGlyph to true)\
(unless: $worldsVisited contains "easter")[(set: $worldsVisited to $worldsVisited + (a: "easter"))]
(set: $tonightsWorld to "")\
<script>if(window.dssMarkWorldSeen)window.dssMarkWorldSeen("easter");</script>\
<div class="item-box">
<div class="item-header">GLYPH</div>
<div class="item-name">A glyph in Rongorongo</div>
</div>

<!-- Rongorongo-style glyph — invented, abstract figure. Gold linework
     within a charcoal-paper rectangle. -->
{<div class="easter-glyph-wrap"><svg class="easter-glyph-svg" viewBox="0 0 240 280" width="220" height="260"><defs><linearGradient id='rrPaper' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='1'><stop offset='0' stop-color='#241e16'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='#120f0a'/></linearGradient><linearGradient id='rrRub' x1='0' y1='0' x2='1' y2='0'><stop offset='0' stop-color='#000' stop-opacity='0.35'/><stop offset='0.3' stop-color='#000' stop-opacity='0'/><stop offset='0.7' stop-color='#000' stop-opacity='0'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='#000' stop-opacity='0.3'/></linearGradient><pattern id='rrGrain' width='3' height='3' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><rect width='1' height='1' x='0' y='1' fill='rgba(255,240,210,0.045)'/><rect width='1' height='1' x='2' y='0' fill='rgba(0,0,0,0.25)'/></pattern></defs><path d='M8,10 L232,6 L234,272 L6,274 Z' fill='url(#rrPaper)' stroke='rgba(200,168,106,0.32)' stroke-width='0.6'/><path d='M8,10 L232,6 L234,272 L6,274 Z' fill='url(#rrGrain)'/><path d='M8,10 L232,6 L234,272 L6,274 Z' fill='url(#rrRub)'/><rect x='16' y='46' width='208' height='48' fill='rgba(0,0,0,0.22)'/><line x1='16' y1='96' x2='224' y2='96' stroke='rgba(232,220,192,0.18)' stroke-width='0.6'/><rect x='16' y='116' width='208' height='48' fill='rgba(0,0,0,0.22)'/><line x1='16' y1='166' x2='224' y2='166' stroke='rgba(232,220,192,0.18)' stroke-width='0.6'/><rect x='16' y='186' width='208' height='48' fill='rgba(0,0,0,0.22)'/><line x1='16' y1='236' x2='224' y2='236' stroke='rgba(232,220,192,0.18)' stroke-width='0.6'/><g transform='translate(40.0,70)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><circle cx='0' cy='-10' r='4'/><path d='M4,-10 L9,-8 M0,-6 L0,6 M0,-2 L-7,3 M0,-2 L7,3 M0,6 L-4,14 M0,6 L4,14'/></g><g transform='translate(80.0,70)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><path d='M-9,0 Q0,-7 9,0 Q0,7 -9,0 Z M9,0 L13,-4 M9,0 L13,4'/><circle cx='-5' cy='-1' r='0.8' fill='#dcdfe4' stroke='none'/></g><g transform='translate(120.0,70)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><path d='M0,12 L0,0 M0,0 L-6,-9 M0,0 L-2,-11 M0,0 L2,-11 M0,0 L6,-9 M0,0 L8,-2'/></g><g transform='translate(160.0,70)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><path d='M0,-12 L0,12 M0,-6 L-7,-10 M0,-6 L7,-10 M0,4 L-7,0 M0,4 L7,0'/><circle cx='0' cy='-13' r='2.5'/></g><g transform='translate(200.0,70)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><path d='M4,-10 A10,10 0 1,0 4,10 A7,7 0 1,1 4,-10 Z'/></g><g transform='translate(40.0,140) rotate(180)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><circle cx='0' cy='-10' r='3.5'/><path d='M0,-6 L0,5 M0,-3 L-8,-9 M0,-3 L8,-9 M0,5 L-5,13 M0,5 L5,13'/></g><g transform='translate(80.0,140) rotate(180)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><ellipse cx='0' cy='0' rx='8' ry='5'/><path d='M8,0 L12,0 M-8,0 L-12,0 M-5,4 L-7,8 M5,4 L7,8 M-5,-4 L-7,-8 M5,-4 L7,-8'/></g><g transform='translate(120.0,140) rotate(180)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><path d='M-8,4 Q0,-10 8,4 M-2,-4 L-2,8 M-2,8 L-6,12 M-2,8 L2,12 M6,-2 L10,-5'/></g><g transform='translate(160.0,140) rotate(180)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><circle cx='0' cy='-10' r='4'/><path d='M4,-10 L9,-8 M0,-6 L0,6 M0,-2 L-7,3 M0,-2 L7,3 M0,6 L-4,14 M0,6 L4,14'/></g><g transform='translate(200.0,140) rotate(180)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><path d='M-9,0 Q0,-7 9,0 Q0,7 -9,0 Z M9,0 L13,-4 M9,0 L13,4'/><circle cx='-5' cy='-1' r='0.8' fill='#dcdfe4' stroke='none'/></g><g transform='translate(40.0,210)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><path d='M0,-12 L0,12 M0,-6 L-7,-10 M0,-6 L7,-10 M0,4 L-7,0 M0,4 L7,0'/><circle cx='0' cy='-13' r='2.5'/></g><g transform='translate(80.0,210)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><path d='M0,12 L0,0 M0,0 L-6,-9 M0,0 L-2,-11 M0,0 L2,-11 M0,0 L6,-9 M0,0 L8,-2'/></g><g transform='translate(120.0,210)' fill='none' stroke='#eef0f3' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.98'><path d='M0,12 L0,-2 M0,-2 C4,-6 6,-10 5,-14 C2,-16 -2,-16 -5,-14 C-6,-10 -4,-6 0,-2 Z M-5,-14 Q0,-11 5,-14 M-4,12 L4,12'/></g><g transform='translate(160.0,210)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><path d='M-8,4 Q0,-10 8,4 M-2,-4 L-2,8 M-2,8 L-6,12 M-2,8 L2,12 M6,-2 L10,-5'/></g><g transform='translate(200.0,210)' fill='none' stroke='#c8ccd2' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='0.82'><circle cx='0' cy='-10' r='3.5'/><path d='M0,-6 L0,5 M0,-3 L-8,-9 M0,-3 L8,-9 M0,5 L-5,13 M0,5 L5,13'/></g><path d='M8,10 L232,6 L234,272 L6,274 Z' fill='none' stroke='rgba(0,0,0,0.5)' stroke-width='2'/></svg></div>}

<script>
if (window.dssAudio && window.dssAudio.loreUnravel) {
  setTimeout(function(){ window.dssAudio.loreUnravel(); }, 200);
}
</script>

<div>
It settles deep and silent.
</div>

<!-- ALBA 2 ATTEND-MOMENT (phase 2, 2026-09-01): the second line is latent in every world centre,
     earned by a quiet attend-choice in the world's register (the Green Sea "Listen" pattern). Pink draft. -->
(unless: $alba contains $alba2)[<div>
You notice now and for the first time a flower growing out of the statue’s mouth. The man in the balaclava leans in and takes deeply of its perfume.
</div>
(link: "Do the same")[(set: $alba to $alba + (a: $alba2))(set: $easterFlower to true)<div class="revelation-box" data-alba="2"><em>‘$alba2’</em></div><strong class="alba-counter">THE SECOND LINE OF THREE</strong>]
]
(if: $easterViaDavy is true and $easterReclaim is not true)[(link: "Help with the Reclamation")[(set: $easterHomeFight to true)(go-to: "The Reclamation")]]
[[Down to the boat|Easter Island Return]]
]

:: Easter Island Return [outdoor street-night] {"position":"2300,2800","size":"100,100"}
<script>setTimeout(function(){if(window.dssAudio&&window.dssAudio.passageWhoosh)window.dssAudio.passageWhoosh();},200);</script>
<!-- 2026-10-26 (Sam: "Give the Reclamation win +8 morale on the next page, like the Climb"): paid once, on whichever page the win leads to -->(if: ($easterReclaimWon is true) and ($easterReclaimPaid is not true))[(set: $easterReclaimPaid to true)(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 8))(display: "Bars Now")<div class="inventory-note">MORALE +8</div>]\
(if: $easterFlower is true)[<div>
You’re back on Dean Street with another line in your notebook and lilies in your nose.
</div>](else:)[<div>
Dean Street again, that vision imprinted on your vision like a motherless duck.
</div>]

[[Dean Street|Dean Street]]

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     v2-EXPANSION — THE GREAT PYRAMID (Pillar of Mercy / lower right)
     5 passages: Pyramid Mouth → Descending Corridor → Grand Gallery →
     King's Chamber → Pyramid Return. Gift: a resonant proportion.
     Soho-responds: Inis O'Flatterly (he's been waiting for the
     proportions).
     ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

:: Easter Island Turn-Back [outdoor] {"position":"1900,2800","size":"100,100"}
(set: $tonightsWorld to "")\
<div>
You are hunted down by a drone and then respawn on Dean Street, as if you were in a videogame.

The war on the island burns on; the moai have more to tell you.
</div>

[[Dean Street|Dean Street]]

:: Pyramid Mouth [dream pyramid] {"position":"1700,3000","size":"100,100"}
<div id="py-container"></div>
<div>
It is true – what they say – that you know the pyramids before you see them.

In fact you know them twice: once in their abstract form, which is, in the monuments at Giza, rendered in sui generis fidelity; and once historically, as the Pyramids at Giza, whose life among the Platonic forms has shaped, since you were a child, both your idea of what pyramids are in general and what these specific pyramids are here and now.

Perhaps some millennia hence, schoolchildren will learn ‘shard’ in the same way.

You climb the face until you reach a door.
</div>

<div>[[Descend into the corridor|Descending Corridor]]</div>

:: Descending Corridor [dream pyramid] {"position":"1900,3000","size":"100,100"}
<div>
The passage cuts into the stone so precisely and at an angle so regularly declining that, if you didn’t know better, you would find it hard to believe it was cut with copper tools.

It ends in an unfinished chamber with a dark pit in the floor.

Inside it, though you cannot see him, somebody is humming. It is the Bard, AL HUBZ, laid out as if in his grave. He hums a scale, dancing among its intervals till he settles on the note he’s listening for. Then – louder, louder – hums till the chamber thrums like a glass harmonica.

A portal opens up in the far wall.
</div>

<div>[[Into the dark, at a run|Pyramid Run]]</div>

:: Grand Gallery [dream pyramid] {"position":"2100,3000","size":"100,100"}
<!-- 2026-10-11: the sobriety loss moved here from the Descending Corridor so it lands with its note; $statLoss keeps both at or above 0. -->(set: $sobriety to ($statLoss: $sobriety, 4))(set: $confidence to ($statLoss: $confidence, 5))(display: "Bars Now")\
<div>
The Grand Gallery corbels a limestone ceiling over your head precariously.

You hear the hum again. Somehow this time before you, in the next chamber.
</div>
<span class="inventory-note">SOBRIETY -4 | MORALE -5</span>

<div>[[Into the chamber|King's Chamber]]</div>

:: King's Chamber [dream pyramid centre] {"position":"2300,3000","size":"100,100"}
<!-- Completion passage for the Pyramid. Number/proportion gift —
     the chamber's resonant frequency, abstracted as a small
     geometric figure. -->
<div>
At the heart of the granite chamber is an empty sarcophagus and at its heart, or where the heart would be, is the note the bard, AL HUBZ, was singing, in the form of a buzzing scarab, caught mid-flight as if the wet air in the sepulchre was amber.

You need to sing the harmony.
</div>

<!-- THE HARMONY (2026-10-06, Sam: "hold down a click to make your own humming reach a
     certain pitch which is exactly a tritone above his pitch"). Flat 2D canvas, no WebGL.
     Hold to hum: your note starts on Al Hubz's and climbs three semitones a second; let go
     to hold it. A tritone above him (six semitones, the ratio of root two) within 40 cents
     is a hit and sets $pyramidHarmony. Past the seventh semitone the note cracks. Three
     attempts, then fail-forward: the "Keep listening" link appears either way.
     Every word on the screen is Dr Quill's (2026-10-08). The hm-mark link is
     parked off-screen, not display:none, because Harlowe drops .click() on a hidden tw-link. -->
<div id="dss-harmony">
(if: $jeffreyTune is true)[<button type="button" class="hm-reference">Remember JEFFREY’s tune</button>]
<div class="hm-stage"><canvas width="600" height="400" tabindex="0" aria-label="The granite chamber. An empty sarcophagus, and at its heart a scarab caught in amber. Hold to hum; let go to hold the note."></canvas><div class="hm-banner" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
<div class="hm-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"><b class="hm-title">Hold to hum. Let go when the scarab opens its wings.</b><span class="hm-tries" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:none"><small style="font:10px 'Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;opacity:.75">TRIES</small><span class="hm-marks" aria-label="attempts"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></span></div>
<div class="hm-help">Mouse, finger or the space bar, held down.</div>
</div>
<span id="hm-mark" aria-hidden="true">(link: "hm-harmony")[(set: $pyramidHarmony to true)]</span>
<style>
#dss-harmony{max-width:680px;width:100%;margin:22px auto 10px;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Georgia,serif}
#dss-harmony > br,#dss-harmony .hm-stage > br,#dss-harmony .hm-status > br{display:none}
#dss-harmony b,#dss-harmony span{color:inherit}
#dss-harmony .hm-stage{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;border:1px solid #81765c;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:#130f0b;box-sizing:border-box;box-shadow:0 16px 50px #0007}
#dss-harmony canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none;cursor:pointer;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;-webkit-touch-callout:none}
#dss-harmony canvas:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #dfb978;outline-offset:3px}
#dss-harmony .hm-banner{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:9%;pointer-events:none;font:italic clamp(13px,2.6vw,18px)/1.3 Georgia,serif;color:#f5d490;text-shadow:0 0 14px #f5d49066;opacity:0;transition:opacity .5s}
#dss-harmony .hm-status{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:12px 4px 2px;font-size:clamp(13px,2.4vw,16px);text-align:left}
#dss-harmony .hm-marks{display:inline-flex;gap:7px;flex:none}
#dss-harmony .hm-marks i{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border:1px solid #c9ab6f;border-radius:50%;opacity:.55;transition:background .4s,opacity .4s}
#dss-harmony .hm-marks i.hm-miss{background:#6b5236}
#dss-harmony .hm-marks i.hm-hit{background:#f5d490;opacity:1;box-shadow:0 0 10px #f5d490aa}
#dss-harmony .hm-help{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;opacity:.6;padding:4px 0 0}
#hm-mark{position:absolute;left:-9999px;top:0;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
#hm-after{display:none}
#hm-after.hm-revealed{display:block;animation:hmReveal 1.2s ease-out}
@keyframes hmReveal{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){#hm-after.hm-revealed{animation:none}}
</style>
<script>
(function(){
  var root=document.getElementById('dss-harmony'); if(!root||root.dataset.hmInit==='1')return; root.dataset.hmInit='1';
  var canvas=root.querySelector('canvas'), ctx=canvas.getContext('2d'), W=canvas.width, H=canvas.height;
  var banner=root.querySelector('.hm-banner'), title=root.querySelector('.hm-title'), marks=root.querySelectorAll('.hm-marks i');
  var reduced=window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  // 2026-10-16 (Sam, from a tester: too hard, the tritone unclear): the hum now climbs a Hijaz scale from AL HUBZ's root, a step at a time, and the choice is the octave; one step past it the note cracks
  var F0=130.81, TRIES=3, R0=66, SCALE=[0,1,4,5,7,8,11,12], STEP_MS=520 + (window.dssEase ? window.dssEase.level('chamber') * 90 : 0), TARGET_IDX=SCALE.length-1, TARGET=12, stepIdx=0; /* 2026-10-28 (dssEase): a missed hum makes the scale climb more slowly next time */
  var CX=W*0.5, CY=H*0.56;
  var holding=false, holdStart=0, semis=0, attempt=0, done=false, ghosts=[], result='', resultAt=0, bannerUntil=0, thrum=[], raf=0, lastT=0;
  var ac=null, his=null, mine=null, hisGain=null, mineGain=null, master=null, lfo=null;
  var WORDS={hit:'The chamber thrums. The scarab opens its wings.',low:'He waits. You let go too soon.',high:'Past it. The wings fold.',crack:'The note cracks.',out:'AL HUBZ stops the song.'};
  function now(){return performance.now();}
  function freq(st){return F0*Math.pow(2,st/12);}
  function audio(){
    if(ac)return true; var AC=window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext; if(!AC)return false;
    try{ac=new AC();}catch(e){return false;}
    master=ac.createGain(); master.gain.value=0.0001;
    var lp=ac.createBiquadFilter(); lp.type='lowpass'; lp.frequency.value=1100; lp.Q.value=0.7;
    var dry=ac.createGain(); dry.gain.value=0.8; var wet=ac.createGain(); wet.gain.value=0.45;
    var dl=ac.createDelay(0.5); dl.delayTime.value=0.083; var fb=ac.createGain(); fb.gain.value=0.58; var fl=ac.createBiquadFilter(); fl.type='lowpass'; fl.frequency.value=700;
    master.connect(lp); lp.connect(dry); dry.connect(ac.destination); lp.connect(dl); dl.connect(fl); fl.connect(fb); fb.connect(dl); fl.connect(wet); wet.connect(ac.destination);
    his=ac.createOscillator(); his.type='triangle'; his.frequency.value=F0; hisGain=ac.createGain(); hisGain.gain.value=0.17; his.connect(hisGain); hisGain.connect(master);
    lfo=ac.createOscillator(); lfo.frequency.value=4.6; var lg=ac.createGain(); lg.gain.value=reduced?0:1.4; lfo.connect(lg); lg.connect(his.frequency); lfo.start();
    mine=ac.createOscillator(); mine.type='triangle'; mine.frequency.value=F0; mineGain=ac.createGain(); mineGain.gain.value=0.0001; mine.connect(mineGain); mineGain.connect(master);
    his.start(); mine.start();
    master.gain.setTargetAtTime(1,ac.currentTime,0.4);
    return true;
  }
  function stopAudio(){
    if(!ac)return; try{master.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.0001,ac.currentTime,0.25);}catch(e){}
    var a=ac; ac=null; setTimeout(function(){try{a.close();}catch(e){}},900);
  }
  function shimmer(){
    if(!ac)return; var t=ac.currentTime; [1,1.5,2,3].forEach(function(m,i){
      var o=ac.createOscillator(); o.type='sine'; o.frequency.value=freq(TARGET)*m; var g=ac.createGain(); g.gain.value=0.0001;
      g.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.07/(i+1),t+i*0.06,0.08); g.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.0001,t+1.2+i*0.2,0.6);
      o.connect(g); g.connect(master); o.start(t); o.stop(t+4); });
  }
  function crackSound(){
    if(!ac)return; var t=ac.currentTime; mineGain.gain.cancelScheduledValues(t); mineGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.0001,t,0.03);
    var n=ac.createBufferSource(), b=ac.createBuffer(1,ac.sampleRate*0.18,ac.sampleRate), d=b.getChannelData(0);
    for(var i=0;i<d.length;i++)d[i]=(Math.random()*2-1)*Math.pow(1-i/d.length,2.4);
    n.buffer=b; var g=ac.createGain(); g.gain.value=0.12; var hp=ac.createBiquadFilter(); hp.type='highpass'; hp.frequency.value=600; n.connect(hp); hp.connect(g); g.connect(master); n.start(t);
  }
  function say(text,secs){banner.textContent=text; banner.style.opacity='1'; bannerUntil=now()+(secs||2.4)*1000;}
  function begin(){
    if(done||holding)return; audio(); holding=true; holdStart=now(); semis=0; stepIdx=0; result='';
    if(ac){var t=ac.currentTime; mineGain.gain.cancelScheduledValues(t); mineGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.15,t,0.12); mine.frequency.setValueAtTime(F0,t);}
    try{canvas.focus({preventScroll:true});}catch(e){}
  }
  function settle(kind){
    holding=false; resultAt=now(); result=kind; ghosts.push({st:semis,idx:stepIdx,at:resultAt,kind:kind});
    var i=attempt; attempt++; if(marks[i])marks[i].className=(kind==='hit')?'hm-hit':'hm-miss';
    if(kind==='hit'){ if(ac){var t=ac.currentTime; mineGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.16,t,0.1); mineGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.0001,t+2.6,0.9); hisGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.0001,t+2.6,0.9);} shimmer(); for(var k=0;k<4;k++)thrum.push({at:resultAt+k*260}); say(WORDS.hit,4); finish(true); return; }
    if(kind==='crack'){ crackSound(); say(WORDS.crack); }
    else { if(ac){var t2=ac.currentTime; mineGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.0001,t2+0.5,0.35);} say(WORDS[kind]); }
    if(attempt>=TRIES){ if(window.dssEase) window.dssEase.lost('chamber'); setTimeout(function(){ if(root.isConnected){ say(WORDS.out,4); if(ac){var t3=ac.currentTime; hisGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.0001,t3+0.6,1.2);} } },1500); finish(false); }
  }
  function release(){
    if(!holding)return;
    settle(stepIdx===TARGET_IDX?'hit':'low');
  }
  function finish(won){
    if(done)return; done=true; title.textContent=won?WORDS.hit:WORDS.out;
    var mark=document.querySelector('#hm-mark tw-link'); if(won&&mark){try{mark.click();}catch(e){}}
    setTimeout(function(){ if(!root.isConnected)return; var after=document.getElementById('hm-after'); if(after){after.classList.add('hm-revealed');} },won?2200:2600);
  }
  // 2026-10-24 (Sam): hear the target without spending a try or starting a hum.
  var reference=root.querySelector('.hm-reference'), referenceSound=null;
  if(reference)reference.addEventListener('click',function(){
    if(holding)return;
    if(referenceSound)referenceSound.stop();
    referenceSound=window.dssAudio&&window.dssAudio.jeffreyTune?window.dssAudio.jeffreyTune(true):null;
  });
  // controls
  canvas.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(e){e.preventDefault(); try{canvas.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);}catch(x){} begin();});
  ['pointerup','pointercancel'].forEach(function(ev){canvas.addEventListener(ev,function(e){e.preventDefault(); release();});});
  canvas.addEventListener('contextmenu',function(e){e.preventDefault();});
  function onKey(e){ if(e.code!=='Space'&&e.key!==' ')return; if(reference&&e.target===reference)return; if(!root.isConnected)return; e.preventDefault(); if(e.type==='keydown'){ if(!e.repeat)begin(); } else release(); }
  window.addEventListener('keydown',onKey); window.addEventListener('keyup',onKey);
  window.addEventListener('blur',release);
  // drawing
  var grain=[]; for(var g=0;g<420;g++)grain.push([Math.random()*W,Math.random()*H,Math.random()]);
  function closeness(st){ return st>=TARGET?1:(st/TARGET)*0.22; } // the wings open only at the octave; a faint warmth rises on the way
  function draw(t){
    var dt=lastT?Math.min(50,t-lastT):16; lastT=t;
    if(holding){ var idx=Math.floor((now()-holdStart)/STEP_MS); if(idx>TARGET_IDX){ semis=TARGET+1; settle('crack'); } else { if(idx!==stepIdx){ stepIdx=idx; if(ac)mine.frequency.setTargetAtTime(freq(SCALE[stepIdx]),ac.currentTime,0.035); } semis=SCALE[stepIdx]; } }
    var breathe=reduced?0:Math.sin(t/1400)*2;
    ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);
    var bg=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,H); bg.addColorStop(0,'#17120d'); bg.addColorStop(1,'#0d0a07'); ctx.fillStyle=bg; ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);
    // the box: a granite room drawn as a wedge of perspective
    ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(245,212,144,0.16)'; ctx.lineWidth=1;
    ctx.strokeRect(70.5,46.5,W-141,H-100);
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0.5,0.5); ctx.lineTo(70.5,46.5); ctx.moveTo(W-0.5,0.5); ctx.lineTo(W-70.5,46.5); ctx.moveTo(0.5,H-0.5); ctx.lineTo(70.5,H-53.5); ctx.moveTo(W-0.5,H-0.5); ctx.lineTo(W-70.5,H-53.5); ctx.stroke();
    // joints in the granite
    ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(245,212,144,0.07)'; for(var j=1;j<4;j++){ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(70.5,46.5+j*(H-100)/4); ctx.lineTo(W-70.5,46.5+j*(H-100)/4); ctx.stroke();}
    // sarcophagus
    ctx.save(); ctx.translate(CX,CY+58); ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(245,212,144,0.34)'; ctx.lineWidth=1.2; ctx.strokeRect(-118.5,-26.5,237,53); ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(245,212,144,0.14)'; ctx.strokeRect(-106.5,-16.5,213,33); ctx.restore();
    // the scale, a ladder of eight stones up the right of the chamber: the root at the foot, the octave at the top, ringed; the hum climbs it a stone at a time, and earlier attempts leave their mark on the stone they let go at
    var LX=CX+178, LY0=CY+62, LY1=CY-108, nS=SCALE.length, showMine=holding||(result&&(now()-resultAt)<2600);
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(LX,LY0+8); ctx.lineTo(LX,LY1-8); ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(245,212,144,0.14)'; ctx.lineWidth=1; ctx.stroke();
    for(var li=0;li<nS;li++){ var ly=LY0+(LY1-LY0)*li/(nS-1), top=(li===TARGET_IDX), lit=showMine&&li<=stepIdx, cur=showMine&&li===stepIdx, ghostHere=false;
      for(var gj=0;gj<ghosts.length;gj++) if(ghosts[gj].idx===li&&ghosts[gj].kind!=='crack') ghostHere=true;
      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(LX-(top?16:10),ly); ctx.lineTo(LX+(top?16:10),ly); ctx.strokeStyle=lit?'rgba(255,236,196,0.92)':(ghostHere?'rgba(245,212,144,0.42)':'rgba(245,212,144,0.26)'); ctx.lineWidth=top?2:1.2; ctx.stroke();
      if(top){ ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(LX,ly,7,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(245,212,144,'+(lit?'0.95':'0.45')+')'; ctx.lineWidth=1.2; ctx.stroke(); }
      if(cur){ ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(LX,ly,4,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,236,196,0.95)'; ctx.fill(); } }
    // his ring, breathing
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(CX,CY,R0+breathe,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(245,212,144,0.55)'; ctx.lineWidth=1.4; ctx.stroke();
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(CX,CY,R0+breathe+6,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(245,212,144,0.10)'; ctx.lineWidth=5; ctx.stroke();
    // (the expanding ring that was my note is gone: the ladder above says where the hum is)
    // the thrum: rings rolling out from the scarab after a hit
    for(var ti=thrum.length-1;ti>=0;ti--){ var age2=(now()-thrum[ti].at)/1000; if(age2<0)continue; if(age2>2.2){thrum.splice(ti,1);continue;}
      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(CX,CY,R0*1.4142+age2*120,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(245,212,144,'+(0.35*(1-age2/2.2)).toFixed(3)+')'; ctx.lineWidth=2; ctx.stroke(); }
    // the scarab in amber
    var c=done&&result==='hit'?1:(holding?closeness(semis):(result&&result!=='crack'?closeness(semis)*Math.max(0,1-(now()-resultAt)/1800):0));
    var glow=ctx.createRadialGradient(CX,CY,2,CX,CY,60+c*50); glow.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,190,96,'+(0.22+c*0.5).toFixed(3)+')'); glow.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,190,96,0)'); ctx.fillStyle=glow; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(CX,CY,60+c*50,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();
    ctx.save(); ctx.translate(CX,CY);
    var open=c*1.05, flutter=reduced?0:Math.sin(t/90)*0.05*c;
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(245,212,144,'+(0.18+c*0.42).toFixed(3)+')'; ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,236,196,'+(0.35+c*0.55).toFixed(3)+')'; ctx.lineWidth=1;
    [-1,1].forEach(function(side){ ctx.save(); ctx.rotate(side*(open+flutter)); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.ellipse(side*9,-2,7,15,side*0.18,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.fill(); ctx.stroke(); ctx.restore(); });
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(120,78,34,'+(0.6+c*0.4).toFixed(3)+')'; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.ellipse(0,2,8,13,0,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.fill(); ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,236,196,'+(0.5+c*0.5).toFixed(3)+')'; ctx.stroke();
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0,-11); ctx.lineTo(0,15); ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,236,196,'+(0.25+c*0.4).toFixed(3)+')'; ctx.stroke();
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(0,-13,4,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.fillStyle='rgba(120,78,34,0.9)'; ctx.fill(); ctx.stroke();
    ctx.restore();
    // rim of lamplight on the box edge, and grain
    var rim=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,H-54,0,H); rim.addColorStop(0,'rgba(245,212,144,0)'); rim.addColorStop(1,'rgba(245,212,144,0.07)'); ctx.fillStyle=rim; ctx.fillRect(0,H-54,W,54);
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,236,196,0.05)'; for(var k=0;k<grain.length;k++){ var p=grain[k]; var y=(p[1]+(reduced?0:t*0.004*p[2]))%H; ctx.fillRect(p[0],y,1,1); }
    if(bannerUntil&&now()>bannerUntil){banner.style.opacity='0'; bannerUntil=0;}
    if(!root.isConnected){ if(referenceSound)referenceSound.stop(); stopAudio(); window.removeEventListener('keydown',onKey); window.removeEventListener('keyup',onKey); window.removeEventListener('blur',release); return; }
    raf=requestAnimationFrame(draw);
  }
  raf=requestAnimationFrame(draw);
  if(window.DSS_DEV){ window._harmonyDev={begin:begin,release:release,state:function(){return {semis:semis,attempt:attempt,done:done,result:result,holding:holding};},setSemis:function(v){semis=v; holdStart=now()-v/RATE*1000;}}; }
})();
</script>

