<!-- ALBA 2 ATTEND-MOMENT (phase 2, 2026-09-01): the second line is latent in every world centre,
     earned by a quiet attend-choice in the world's register (the Green Sea "Listen" pattern). Pink draft. -->
(unless: $alba contains $alba2)[<div>
As you are to the chamber, so is the stamen to the flower.
</div>
(link: "Keep listening to the silence")[(set: $alba to $alba + (a: $alba2))<div class="revelation-box" data-alba="2"><em>‘$alba2’</em></div><strong class="alba-counter">THE SECOND LINE OF THREE</strong>]
]
[[Back the way you came|Pyramid Return]]

:: Pyramid Return [outdoor street-night] {"position":"2300,3200","size":"100,100"}
<script>setTimeout(function(){if(window.dssAudio&&window.dssAudio.passageWhoosh)window.dssAudio.passageWhoosh();},200);</script>
<div>
You’re back on Dean Street, gold dust on your trouser-legs and very red, sore knees. A note rings in your ear and round your skull.
</div>

[[Dean Street|Dean Street]]

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     v2-EXPANSION — EZEKIEL'S WHEEL (Pillar of Severity / lower left)
     5 passages: The Plain of Chebar → Storm from the North → Four Living
     Creatures → The Wheel → Ezekiel Return. Gift: a transcribed
     vision of the wheel-within-a-wheel. Soho-responds: the Spanish
     Artist at the French (has been seeing this in his dying visions).
     ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

:: The Plain of Chebar [dream ezekiel] {"position":"1700,3400","size":"100,100"}
<div id="pc-container"></div>
A woman squats washing a lambskin in an irrigation channel cut south of the Euphrates. The season is dry so the water is low; the hide turns bronze as she rubs it.
She is waiting for some black swan to fall out of the sky.

[[Wait with her|Storm from the North]]

:: Storm from the North [dream ezekiel] {"position":"1900,3400","size":"100,100"}
(set: $sobriety to $sobriety - 5)\
<blockquote class="dss-scripture">And I saw, and lo! a whirlwind came from the north, and a great cloud, and fire wrapping in, and brightness in the compass thereof; and as the likeness of electrum from the midst thereof, that is, from the midst of the fire.</blockquote>

[[Behold|Four Living Creatures]]

:: Four Living Creatures [dream ezekiel] {"position":"2100,3400","size":"100,100"}
<!-- 2026-10-25 (Sam): the drawing prepares you for the creatures; storm sobriety cost remains. -->
(unless: $benitoDrawing is true)[(set: $confidence to $confidence - 8)]\
Four faces and each with four wings, all flushed like the orange’s rind. Four beasts from four places on a plane which is, in its own prehistoric cosmology, endless and flat, and kept in its place by sharp wind.
(if: $benitoDrawing is true)[<div class="inventory-note benito-drawing-payoff">BENITO’s drawing helps you recognise the creatures.<br>MORALE LOSS AVOIDED: 8</div><span class="inventory-note">SOBRIETY -5</span>](else:)[<span class="inventory-note">SOBRIETY -5 | MORALE -8</span>]

[[Look!|The Wheel]]

:: The Wheel [dream ezekiel centre] {"position":"2300,3400","size":"100,100"}
<!-- Completion passage for Ezekiel. The wheel-within-a-wheel reveals
     in stages: outer wheel, then inner wheel rotating perpendicular,
     then eyes around the rim. Player transcribes what they saw. -->

(link: "Draw it down")[
(set: $ezekielVision to true)\
(unless: $worldsVisited contains "ezekiel")[(set: $worldsVisited to $worldsVisited + (a: "ezekiel"))]
(set: $tonightsWorld to "")\
<script>if(window.dssMarkWorldSeen)window.dssMarkWorldSeen("ezekiel");</script>\
<div class="item-box">
<div class="item-header">VISION</div>
<div class="item-name">The wheel-within-a-wheel</div>
</div>

<!-- Ezekiel's wheel SVG — outer wheel, inner perpendicular wheel, eyes
     around the rim. Gold linework. Most ornate of the world reveals;
     fits the apocalyptic register. -->
{<div class="ezekiel-wheel-wrap"><svg class="ezekiel-wheel-svg" viewBox="0 0 320 320" width="290" height="290"><defs><radialGradient id='ezHalo' cx='50%' cy='50%' r='55%'><stop offset='0' stop-color='#f5d490' stop-opacity='0.16'/><stop offset='0.7' stop-color='#f5d490' stop-opacity='0.05'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='#f5d490' stop-opacity='0'/></radialGradient></defs><g transform='translate(160,160)'><circle r='158' fill='url(#ezHalo)'/><circle r='140' fill='none' stroke='#f5d490' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle r='126' fill='none' stroke='#f5d490' stroke-width='1.1'/><g transform='rotate(0) translate(0,-133) rotate(90)'><g transform='scale(0.95)'><path d='M-7,0 Q0,-5.5 7,0 Q0,5.5 -7,0 Z' fill='#0e0b08' stroke='#f5d490' stroke-width='1'/><circle r='1.8' fill='#f5d490'/></g></g><g transform='rotate(18) translate(0,-133) rotate(90)'><g transform='scale(0.95)'><path d='M-7,0 Q0,-5.5 7,0 Q0,5.5 -7,0 Z' fill='#0e0b08' stroke='#f5d490' stroke-width='1'/><circle r='1.8' fill='#f5d490'/></g></g><g transform='rotate(36) translate(0,-133) rotate(90)'><g transform='scale(0.95)'><path d='M-7,0 Q0,-5.5 7,0 Q0,5.5 -7,0 Z' fill='#0e0b08' stroke='#f5d490' stroke-width='1'/><circle r='1.8' fill='#f5d490'/></g></g><g transform='rotate(54) translate(0,-133) rotate(90)'><g transform='scale(0.95)'><path d='M-7,0 Q0,-5.5 7,0 Q0,5.5 -7,0 Z' fill='#0e0b08' stroke='#f5d490' stroke-width='1'/><circle r='1.8' fill='#f5d490'/></g></g><g transform='rotate(72) translate(0,-133) rotate(90)'><g transform='scale(0.95)'><path d='M-7,0 Q0,-5.5 7,0 Q0,5.5 -7,0 Z' fill='#0e0b08' stroke='#f5d490' stroke-width='1'/><circle r='1.8' fill='#f5d490'/></g></g><g transform='rotate(90) translate(0,-133) rotate(90)'><g transform='scale(0.95)'><path d='M-7,0 Q0,-5.5 7,0 Q0,5.5 -7,0 Z' fill='#0e0b08' stroke='#f5d490' stroke-width='1'/><circle r='1.8' fill='#f5d490'/></g></g><g transform='rotate(108) translate(0,-133) rotate(90)'><g transform='scale(0.95)'><path d='M-7,0 Q0,-5.5 7,0 Q0,5.5 -7,0 Z' fill='#0e0b08' strok