A VOICE: ‘She went down with all hands, by the Old Head of Kinsale. Atlantic winter, poor sods, no one stood a chance.’

<!-- 2026-10-26 (Sam): "the pipe cleaners" only for a player who heard the Ham's rumour -->The whole thing’s off: (if: $hamRumour is true)[the pipe cleaners, ]the port that would give succour. ‘Thank fuck for that,’ you think and go about your life.

[[Back to Dean Street|Dean Street]]
](else-if: $holdsAshtonName is true)[(if: $sobriety < 30)[(set: $shipCall to "slipped")(set: $ashtonSold to true)\
QUIET FRANKIE’S purring down the line: ‘Give her up, son. Spill what the whole world knows, it couldn’t hurt you.’

As a man thrown from a boat on the high seas, who is held aloft a moment by a wave and, being close to heaven, calls the name of the one Goddess he thinks could pluck him out, you say: ASHTON GRANGER.

The line goes dead. The wave rolls on and drops you now in free fall back into the bitter waters, which are as cold as the stars that measure them.

[[Back to Dean Street|Dean Street]]
](else:)[(set: $shipNews to "asked")\
QUIET FRANKIE, purring down the line: ‘Give her up, son. Spill what the whole world knows, it couldn’t hurt you.’

YOU: ‘I wouldn’t do that, FRANKIE, and neither would you. Don’t ask me to.’

QUIET FRANKIE: ‘Oh, but you would. In fact, I think you must.’

Shopping her would clear your debt with JOHN ST. JOHN. It’s the debt that keeps you coming back, always owing someone a pint. It’s plausible, even, you speculate, that ST. JOHN is in league with SALVU COPPER. But you can’t be sure of any of this and it’s time to make your choice.

|shipname>[(link: "Give them ASHTON’S name")[(set: $shipCall to "given")(set: $ashtonSold to true)(replace: ?shipname)[YOU: ‘ASHTON GRANGER.’ You give him what he wants to hear.

‘Good boy,’ says QUIET FRANKIE and leaves you quits.

[[Back to Dean Street|Dean Street]]]]
(link: "Hang up")[(set: $shipCall to "kept")(replace: ?shipname)[You say nothing. The silence goes on long enough to be an answer, and you hang up on it. The Debt stands.

[[Back to Dean Street|Dean Street]]]]]
]](else:)[(set: $shipCall to "news")(if: $shipNews is "")[(set: $shipNews to "rumour")]\
