:: Lore The Great Work [system] {"position":"600,2100","size":"100,100"}
<!-- 2026-10-19 (Sam: explain the alchemy, "4 plus 3"): the editor's note behind the ⟡ LORE mark on the notebook's HAUNTS heading and on "The work" line of the night's first haunt. Printed hidden in the header (#dss-lore-greatwork); the mark lifts it onto a note card, as the passages' own LORE links do. -->\
<!-- 2026-10-19: Sam's version, from Claude's draft (built on Ripley's lines, quoted from The Compound of Alchymy as Ashmole printed it in Theatrum Chemicum Britannicum, 1652, whose colophon dates it AN.DOM.1471; the first gate, stanzas 22 and 17; the twelfth gate, stanza 8). Typo fixes only: "dedicated,to", a double space; then (Sam) the repeated "you know that" cut and "left-hand" hyphenated. -->\
<div class="lore-box"><strong>⟡ THE GREAT WORK ⟡</strong>
<div class="editors-note"><span class="editors-note-label">Editor’s note</span><p>In 1471 George Ripley, a canon of Bridlington in Yorkshire, dedicated to King Edward IV a poem on the making of the Stone. He called it <em>The Compound of Alchymy</em> and divided the Great Work into twelve gates, Calcination first, Projection last, each to be passed in its order. At the first gate he writes:</p><div class="verse">At the fyrst Gate, now art thou in,<br>Of the Phylosophers Castle where they dwell;<br>Whych Castle ys round as any Bell:<br>And Gates hath Eleven yet mo,<br>One ys conquered, now to the second go.</div><p>Tonight, like every night for those who live, you are an alchemist: ‘The Wheele of Elements thou canst turne about.’ Like any journeyman in the left-hand path you know that magic happens in the world and not within you, if it would be called magic at all. Soho is the little world tonight. Its haunts are seeded with twelve gates. Find them. They will not come in Ripley’s perfect order; a night so seldom does. But take them as they come to you and you might do such things…</p><p>That ‘all the Castell thou holdyst at wyll,’</p><p>Take fewer and the dawn will come regardless, though incompletely, like you.</p></div></div>

:: Mantra Syllable Cue [system] {"position":"500,2100","size":"100,100"}
<!-- v2-expansion: rendered via (display:) right after each haunt-set.
     Reads $haunts's length (which has just been incremented) to figure
     out which mantra syllable to fade in. The fade is brief — player
     notices but doesn't yet understand. Realisation lands at the Cave. --><!-- 2026-10-19 (Sam: "On the sanskrit, you decide"): the syllable no longer shows on the haunt box, so each box carries one system, the Work (and the six syllables ran out halfway through the twelve). The chant stays in the notebook's DREAMS row and the Cave. To restore, put back:
{(set: _n to $haunts's length)(if: _n is a number and _n >= 1 and _n <= $mantra's length)[<div class="mantra-cue">⟨ (print: _n of $mantra) ⟩</div>]} -->

:: Nazca Race [dream nazca] {"position":"2250,3250","size":"100,100"}
<!-- v2-expansion: the NASCAR-lines race, REBUILT 2026-08-21 (Fable),
     SHOWCASE PASS same night (Sam: "the graphics improvement you did
     elsewhere"). Sam's design kept from his stashed 2026-05-15 build:
     hummingbird bezier track, two laps, faceless opponent on the
     perfect line at his 0.0010 joy-ride pace, spinout off the line.
     Showcase: golden-hour light with REAL long shadows, bloom + film
     grade (canvas-sized composer, not dssMakeComposer which is
     window-sized), richer pampa bake (desert varnish, crossing
     ceremonial lines, rock fields, decor glyphs), dust devils, sun
     glare sprite, proper car bodywork (windscreen, chrome, "73" door
     roundel, body roll, wheels that spin), the black car raises NO
     dust (the dream telling on it), and THE GOLD WAKE - the line
     lights faintly where you have driven it, so lap two chases the
     glyph you lit on lap one. Mechanics feel pass: 3x faster steering
     attack, gentle heading drift, softer off-track scrub, speed FOV. -->
(unless: $nazcaRaceWon is a boolean)[(set: $nazcaRaceWon to false)]\

<div class="nazca-race-stage">
<div class="nazca-race-frame">
<canvas id="nazca-race-canvas" width="720" height="450"></canvas>
<canvas id="nazca-race-map" width="150" height="100"></canvas>
<canvas id="nazca-race-item" width="56" height="56"></canvas>
<div id="nazca-race-count"></div>
</div>
<div id="nazca-race-hud">Click the sand to start. ↑ / W / GO accelerates; ← → steers; ↓ / S / BRAKE slows. Follow the pale road. Gold diamonds carry items; Space uses yours.</div>
</div>

<span id="nz-race-win" style="display:none;">(link: "Cross the line")[(set: $nazcaRaceWon to true)(go-to: "The Centre — Nazca")]</span>
<span id="nz-race-lose" style="display:none;">[[The other car pulls away|The Centre — Nazca]]</span>

<span id="nz-race-skip" style="display:none;"><div class="claude-draft" style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.4em;font-size:0.78em;opacity:0.45;letter-spacing:0.08em;">[[(skip race — testing)|The Centre — Nazca]]</div></span>
<script>if (window.DSS_DEV) { var _sk = document.getElementById('nz-race-skip'); if (_sk) _sk.style.display = 'block'; }</script>

<script>
(function(){
  var canvas = document.getElementById('nazca-race-canvas');
  if (!canvas || canvas.dataset.nzInit === '1') return;
  canvas.dataset.nzInit = '1';

  function boot(){
    if (typeof THREE === 'undefined'){
      var s = document.createElement('script');
      s.src = 'vendor/three/three.min.js';
      s.onload = function(){ (window.dssLoadPost ? window.dssLoadPost(start) : start()); };
      document.head.appendChild(s);
    } else {
      (window.dssLoadPost ? window.dssLoadPost(start) : start());
    }
  }

  // ── The hummingbird CIRCUIT (v3, 2026-08-21 — Sam: "longer, more
  //    interesting track"): a lap that IS the glyph. Route: along the
  //    back → over the head → the BEAK straight, flat out, into the
  //    tip HAIRPIN → back under the throat → the SOUTH WING sweeper →
  //    the belly run → the TAIL-FEATHER hairpin → the NORTH WING sweep
  //    home. Closed Catmull-Rom through hand-laid waypoints (lap ~5250
  //    units, ~2x Sam's old loop). The second tail feather and the eye
  //    are baked into the ground art as decor (not driven). ──────────
  var WPTS = [
    [-60,170],[140,185],[300,205],[420,160],[470,85],
    [700,105],[960,75],[1080,30],[1110,-40],[1040,-95],[800,-110],[540,-120],[430,-150],
    [390,-280],[300,-420],[140,-470],[10,-400],[-60,-260],
    [-220,-225],[-460,-305],[-720,-375],[-880,-395],[-950,-305],[-860,-205],[-620,-160],[-420,-130],
    [-360,20],[-420,200],[-330,330],[-160,330],[-140,290]
  ];
  var TRACK_WIDTH = 100;
  var CL = [];
  (function(){
    var M2 = WPTS.length, SPS = 12;
    function crm(p0, p1, p2, p3, t){
      var t2 = t*t, t3 = t2*t;
      return 0.5*((2*p1) + (-p0 + p2)*t + (2*p0 - 5*p1 + 4*p2 - p3)*t2 + (-p0 + 3*p1 - 3*p2 + p3)*t3);
    }
    for (var i = 0; i < M2; i++){
      var p0 = WPTS[(i-1+M2)%M2], p1 = WPTS[i], p2 = WPTS[(i+1)%M2], p3 = WPTS[(i+2)%M2];
      for (var s2 = 0; s2 < SPS; s2++){
        var tt = s2/SPS;
        CL.push({ x: crm(p0[0],p1[0],p2[0],p3[0],tt), y: crm(p0[1],p1[1],p2[1],p3[1],tt) });
      }
    }
  })();
  // Equal-distance samples: a lap fraction means distance, not waypoint count.
  // This keeps the rival, timing and look-ahead consistent through every bend.
  var trackLength = 0;
  (function(){
    var raw = CL, lengths = [0], count = raw.length;
    for (var i = 0; i < count; i++){
      var a = raw[i], b = raw[(i+1)%count];
      trackLength += Math.hypot(b.x-a.x, b.y-a.y); lengths.push(trackLength);
    }
    CL = [];
    var j = 0;
    for (var k = 0; k < count; k++){
      var dist = k*trackLength/count;
      while (j < count-1 && lengths[j+1] < dist) j++;
      var f = (dist-lengths[j])/(lengths[j+1]-lengths[j]);
      var p = raw[j], q = raw[(j+1)%count];
      CL.push({x:p.x+(q.x-p.x)*f, y:p.y+(q.y-p.y)*f});
    }
  })();
  var N = CL.length;
  function cpt(t){
    var n = ((t % 1) + 1) % 1 * N, i = Math.floor(n), f = n-i;
    var a = CL[i], b = CL[(i+1)%N];
    return {x:a.x+(b.x-a.x)*f, y:a.y+(b.y-a.y)*f};
  }
  function cdir(t){
    var a = cpt(t), b = cpt(t + 1.5/N);
    var dx = b.x - a.x, dy = b.y - a.y, l = Math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy) || 1;
    return {x: dx/l, y: dy/l};
  }
  function closestT(x, y){
    var best = 0, bd = 1e18;
    for (var i = 0; i < N; i++){
      var a = CL[i], b = CL[(i+1)%N], vx = b.x-a.x, vy = b.y-a.y;
      var f = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, ((x-a.x)*vx+(y-a.y)*vy)/(vx*vx+vy*vy || 1)));
      var dx = a.x+vx*f-x, dy = a.y+vy*f-y, d = dx*dx+dy*dy;
      if (d < bd){ bd = d; best = i+f; }
    }
    return {t: (best/N)%1, d: Math.sqrt(bd)};
  }
  var CURVE = [];
  (function(){
    for (var i = 0; i < N; i++){
      var a = CL[(i-3+N)%N], b = CL[i], c = CL[(i+3)%N];
      var v1x = b.x-a.x, v1y = b.y-a.y, v2x = c.x-b.x, v2y = c.y-b.y;
      var l1 = Math.sqrt(v1x*v1x+v1y*v1y)||1, l2 = Math.sqrt(v2x*v2x+v2y*v2y)||1;
      CURVE.push(1 - (v1x*v2x + v1y*v2y)/(l1*l2));
    }
  })();

  // per-point width factor: the beak-tip hairpin carries a RUN-OFF
  // bulge (the first hard corner must not be a trap; the widened tip
  // reads as the glyph's beak-point anyway). 1.0 elsewhere.
  var WF = [];
  (function(){
    var apex = 0, bx2 = -1e9;
    for (var i = 0; i < N; i++){ if (CL[i].x > bx2){ bx2 = CL[i].x; apex = i; } }
    for (var i = 0; i < N; i++){
      var d6 = Math.min(Math.abs(i - apex), N - Math.abs(i - apex));
      WF.push(d6 < 26 ? 1 + 0.6 * Math.cos((d6/26) * Math.PI/2) : 1);
    }
  })();
  function wfAt(t){ return WF[Math.floor(((t % 1) + 1) % 1 * N) % N]; }

  var MINX = -1150, MAXX = 1310, MINY = -670, MAXY = 540;
  var WW = MAXX - MINX, WH = MAXY - MINY;
  var GCX = (MINX+MAXX)/2, GCZ = (MINY+MAXY)/2;
  var TW = 3072, TH = 1536;
  function txx(x){ return (x - MINX)/WW * TW; }
  function txy(y){ return (y - MINY)/WH * TH; }

  var renderer, composer, scene, camera, player, opp, sunLight, paintEnv=null;
  var windDust=[];
  var playerBody, oppBody, playerWheels = [], oppWheels = [];
  var dustPool = [], wakePool = [], wakeIdx = 0, lastWakeX = 0, lastWakeY = 0;
  var condor, devils = [], wakeMesh, wakeColor, roadRims;
  var mapCtx = document.getElementById('nazca-race-map').getContext('2d');
  var itemCtx = document.getElementById('nazca-race-item').getContext('2d');
  var hud = document.getElementById('nazca-race-hud');
  var countEl = document.getElementById('nazca-race-count');
  var animId = null, disposed = false;

  // ── state: Sam's constants + the feel pass ───────────────────────
  var camX = 0, camY = 0, camAngle = 0, moveAngle = 0, speed = 0, steerVelocity = 0;
  var maxSpeedOn = 3.8, maxSpeedOff = 1.4;
  var accelRate = 0.042, decelRate = 0.016, brakeRate = 0.08;
  var maxSteerVel = 0.046;
  var steerBuildup = 0.0075;  // feel: third pass down (0.016 twitchy, 0.010 still hot)
  var steerReturn  = 0.022;   // and a quicker return to straight
  var keys = {}, touching = false, touchSteer = 0;
  var racing = false, raceStarted = false, countdownAt = null, finished = false;
  var TOTAL_LAPS = 2;
  var playerLapsT = 0, lastT = 0, oppT = -0.04, oppLapsT = -0.04;
  var oppSpeedT = 3.05/trackLength; // physical pace, with readable braking before bends
  var spinUntil = 0, spinFrom = 0, spinning = false;
  var drifting = false, driftMs = 0, boost = 0, endFlare = 0;
  var patches = [], suckPool = [], suckIdx = 0, startLights = [];
  var eng = null;
  var item = null, itemBoxes = [], slicks = [], stones = [], condorAtk = null;
  var oppStun = 0, lastLead = null, finalLapNoted = false, driftStage = 0;
  var oppDropAt = 0;
  var slickMat = null, stoneAmmoMat = null;
  var lastTime = null, offJudder = 0;
  var simTime = 0, accumulator = 0, renderTime = null, paused = false;
  var countdownStep = -1, messageUntil = 0, raceElapsed = 0, lapStartedAt = 0;
  var lapTimes = [], bestLap = null, recoveryT = 0, cameraHeading = null;
  var completedLaps = 0, nextGate = 1;
  var dashboard, pauseButton, retryButton, itemButton, racePanel, cleanupInput;
  var reducedMotion = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  function raceNow(){ return simTime; }
  function announce(label, duration){
    countEl.textContent = label; countEl.style.fontSize = label.length > 12 ? '24px' : '38px';
    countEl.style.opacity = '1'; messageUntil = simTime + (duration || 1000);
  }
  function formatTime(ms){ return (ms/1000).toFixed(2) + 's'; }

  (function(){
    var p = cpt(0), d = cdir(0);
    camX = p.x - d.y*24; camY = p.y + d.x*24;
    camAngle = Math.atan2(-d.x, d.y);
    moveAngle = camAngle;
    lastWakeX = camX; lastWakeY = camY;
    lastT = closestT(camX, camY).t;
  })();

  function start(){
    if (disposed) return;
    scene = new THREE.Scene();
    scene.background = new THREE.Color(0x8a6044); /* 2026-10-23 (Sam): Nazca rust/smog with a gold sun, kept light enough to race in */
    scene.fog = new THREE.Fog(0x8a6044, 620, 1500);
    camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, canvas.width/canvas.height, 1, 2800);
    renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, antialias: true });
    renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, window.innerWidth<600?1.25:1.5));
    renderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping || THREE.LinearToneMapping;
    renderer.toneMappingExposure = 0.86;
    renderer.shadowMap.enabled = true;
    renderer.shadowMap.type = THREE.PCFSoftShadowMap;

    // canvas-sized composer (dssMakeComposer is window-sized; this one
    // must match the 720x450 buffer or the bloom smears)
    composer = null;
    if (window.innerWidth>=600 && typeof THREE.EffectComposer === 'function' && typeof THREE.UnrealBloomPass === 'function'){
      composer = new THREE.EffectComposer(renderer);
      composer.setSize(canvas.width, canvas.height);
      composer.addPass(new THREE.RenderPass(scene, camera));
      composer.addPass(new THREE.UnrealBloomPass(new THREE.Vector2(canvas.width, canvas.height), 0.2, 0.4, 0.92));
    }
    // film grade over the frame div
    if (window.dssFilmGrade) window.dssFilmGrade(document.querySelector('.nazca-race-frame'));

    // ---- golden hour ----
    scene.add(new THREE.AmbientLight(0x8a8078, 0.22));
    var bounce = new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xa89a86, 0x8a5a3a, 0.38);
    scene.add(bounce);
    sunLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xd4ae6a, 1.8);
    sunLight.position.set(-420, 78, -300);   // LOW sun: long shadows
    sunLight.castShadow = true;
    sunLight.shadow.mapSize.set(1024, 1024);
    sunLight.shadow.camera.near = 50;
    sunLight.shadow.camera.far = 1400;
    sunLight.shadow.camera.left = -380; sunLight.shadow.camera.right = 380;
    sunLight.shadow.camera.top = 380;   sunLight.shadow.camera.bottom = -380;
    sunLight.shadow.bias = -0.0008;
    scene.add(sunLight);
    scene.add(sunLight.target);

    // ---- sky: banded dusk-gold + baked cirrus; sun disc + glare ----
    var skyC = document.createElement('canvas'); skyC.width = 512; skyC.height = 512;
    var sx2 = skyC.getContext('2d');
    var skg = sx2.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, 512);
    skg.addColorStop(0.0, '#2a201a');
    skg.addColorStop(0.42, '#6a4632');
    skg.addColorStop(0.62, '#9a6a42');
    skg.addColorStop(0.78, '#c8a060');
    skg.addColorStop(1.0, '#8a5a3a');
    sx2.fillStyle = skg; sx2.fillRect(0,0,512,512);
    for (var cl2 = 0; cl2 < 7; cl2++){
      var cy2 = 90 + Math.random()*140, cw2 = 120 + Math.random()*260;
      var cg2 = sx2.createLinearGradient(0, cy2-6, 0, cy2+6);
      cg2.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,246,226,0)');
      cg2.addColorStop(0.5, 'rgba(255,246,226,' + (0.10+Math.random()*0.12) + ')');
      cg2.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255,246,226,0)');
      sx2.fillStyle = cg2;
      sx2.fillRect(Math.random()*400 - 60, cy2-8, cw2, 16);
    }
    var skyTex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(skyC);
    var sky = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(2100, 24, 12),
      new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ map: skyTex, side: THREE.BackSide, fog: false, toneMapped:false }));
    scene.add(sky);
    var glowC = document.createElement('canvas'); glowC.width = 128; glowC.height = 128;
    var gcx2 = glowC.getContext('2d');
    var gg2 = gcx2.createRadialGradient(64,64,3,64,64,62);
    gg2.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,244,214,1)');
    gg2.addColorStop(0.18, 'rgba(255,228,164,0.8)');
    gg2.addColorStop(0.5, 'rgba(255,206,120,0.22)');
    gg2.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');
    gcx2.fillStyle = gg2; gcx2.fillRect(0,0,128,128);
    var sunTexGlow = new THREE.CanvasTexture(glowC);
    var sunSprite = new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({ map: sunTexGlow, blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending, transparent: true, opacity: 0.95, depthWrite: false, fog: false }));
    sunSprite.position.set(-1180, 185, -840);
    sunSprite.scale.set(560, 560, 1);
    scene.add(sunSprite);

    // ---- the pampa: one big baked texture (mode-7 on the GPU) ----
    var g2 = document.createElement('canvas'); g2.width = TW; g2.height = TH;
    var gx = g2.getContext('2d');
    // desert varnish base: layered rust bands
    var bg2 = gx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, TW, TH);
    bg2.addColorStop(0, '#875634'); bg2.addColorStop(0.5, '#8f5e3c'); bg2.addColorStop(1, '#815031');
    gx.fillStyle = bg2; gx.fillRect(0, 0, TW, TH);
    for (var m2 = 0; m2 < 520; m2++){
      var mr = 14 + Math.random()*120;
      var mg = gx.createRadialGradient(Math.random()*TW, Math.random()*TH, 2, Math.random()*TW, Math.random()*TH, mr);
      mg.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(' + (Math.random()<0.5 ? '116,72,44' : '172,124,84') + ',' + (0.08+Math.random()*0.15) + ')');
      mg.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');
      gx.fillStyle = mg; gx.fillRect(0, 0, TW, TH);
    }
    // wind streaks, one prevailing direction
    gx.save();
    gx.translate(TW/2, TH/2); gx.rotate(-0.32); gx.translate(-TW/2, -TH/2);
    for (var ws = 0; ws < 260; ws++){
      gx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(' + (Math.random()<0.5 ? '210,176,132' : '110,70,44') + ',' + (0.04+Math.random()*0.07) + ')';
      gx.lineWidth = 1 + Math.random()*2;
      var wy2 = Math.random()*TH, wx2 = Math.random()*TW;
      gx.beginPath(); gx.moveTo(wx2, wy2); gx.lineTo(wx2 + 120 + Math.random()*300, wy2 + (Math.random()-0.5)*10); gx.stroke();
    }
    gx.restore();
    // pebble grain
    for (var pb = 0; pb < 9000; pb++){
      gx.fillStyle = 'rgba(' + (Math.random()<0.6 ? '80,48,28' : '158,112,72') + ',' + (0.10+Math.random()*0.18) + ')';
      gx.fillRect(Math.random()*TW, Math.random()*TH, 1+Math.random()*2, 1+Math.random()*2);
    }
    // cracked-earth patches
    for (var cp3 = 0; cp3 < 14; cp3++){
      var ccx = Math.random()*TW, ccy = Math.random()*TH, crr = 60 + Math.random()*120;
      gx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(70,42,26,0.28)'; gx.lineWidth = 1.2;
      for (var ck = 0; ck < 10; ck++){
        var ca2 = Math.random()*Math.PI*2;
        gx.beginPath(); gx.moveTo(ccx, ccy);
        var px3 = ccx, py3 = ccy;
        for (var seg2 = 0; seg2 < 4; seg2++){
          px3 += Math.cos(ca2 + (Math.random()-0.5)*0.8) * crr/4;
          py3 += Math.sin(ca2 + (Math.random()-0.5)*0.8) * crr/4;
          gx.lineTo(px3, py3);
        }
        gx.stroke();
      }
    }
    // rock fields (dark scatters, far from the track)
    for (var rf = 0; rf < 9; rf++){
      var rfx = Math.random()*TW, rfy = Math.random()*TH;
      for (var rk = 0; rk < 46; rk++){
        gx.fillStyle = 'rgba(58,36,22,' + (0.25+Math.random()*0.3) + ')';
        var rrx = rfx + (Math.random()-0.5)*220, rry = rfy + (Math.random()-0.5)*140;
        gx.beginPath(); gx.arc(rrx, rry, 1.5+Math.random()*4, 0, Math.PI*2); gx.fill();
      }
    }
    // ceremonial straights: dead-straight pale lines crossing the whole plain
    // (the real pampa is covered in them; the track crosses two)
    gx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(214,196,158,0.34)';
    gx.lineWidth = 9;
    [[-620, 240, 730, -300], [-620, -180, 730, 60], [-300, 430, 240, -360]].forEach(function(ln){
      gx.beginPath(); gx.moveTo(txx(ln[0]), txy(ln[1])); gx.lineTo(txx(ln[2]), txy(ln[3])); gx.stroke();
    });
    // neighbour glyphs: spiral + a small condor + radiating rays
    gx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(216,198,162,0.30)'; gx.lineWidth = 6; gx.beginPath();
    for (var sp2 = 0; sp2 < 260; sp2++){
      var sa = sp2*0.13, sr = 3 + sp2*0.6;
      var sxp = txx(-460) + Math.cos(sa)*sr*0.9, syp = txy(330) + Math.sin(sa)*sr*0.55;
      if (sp2 === 0) gx.moveTo(sxp, syp); else gx.lineTo(sxp, syp);
    }
    gx.stroke();
    for (var ry = 0; ry < 7; ry++){
      gx.beginPath(); gx.moveTo(txx(600), txy(-280));
      gx.lineTo(txx(600) + Math.cos(ry*0.42+2.5)*560, txy(-280) + Math.sin(ry*0.42+2.5)*560);
      gx.stroke();
    }
    (function drawCondorGlyph(){
      var cgx = txx(180), cgy = txy(330), s4 = 2.6;
      gx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(216,198,162,0.32)'; gx.lineWidth = 5;
      gx.beginPath();
      gx.moveTo(cgx - 60*s4, cgy);
      gx.quadraticCurveTo(cgx - 20*s4, cgy - 26*s4, cgx, cgy - 6*s4);
      gx.quadraticCurveTo(cgx + 20*s4, cgy - 26*s4, cgx + 60*s4, cgy);
      gx.quadraticCurveTo(cgx + 22*s4, cgy - 4*s4, cgx + 8*s4, cgy + 16*s4);
      gx.lineTo(cgx + 3*s4, cgy + 30*s4);
      gx.lineTo(cgx - 3*s4, cgy + 16*s4);
      gx.quadraticCurveTo(cgx - 22*s4, cgy - 4*s4, cgx - 60*s4, cgy);
      gx.stroke();
    })();
    // the line itself
    var sxScale = TW/WW;
    function strokeCL(width, style){
      gx.strokeStyle = style; gx.lineWidth = width*sxScale; gx.lineJoin = 'round'; gx.lineCap = 'round';
      gx.beginPath();
      for (var i2 = 0; i2 <= N; i2++){
        var q = CL[i2 % N];
        if (i2 === 0) gx.moveTo(txx(q.x), txy(q.y)); else gx.lineTo(txx(q.x), txy(q.y));
      }
      gx.stroke();
    }
    strokeCL(TRACK_WIDTH + 30, 'rgba(54,32,20,0.8)');   // swept-off dark berm
    strokeCL(TRACK_WIDTH + 8, 'rgba(120,82,52,0.5)');   // berm inner shading
    strokeCL(TRACK_WIDTH, '#dcccaa');                    // the cleared line
    strokeCL(TRACK_WIDTH - 12, '#e6d6b4');
    strokeCL(TRACK_WIDTH*0.45, 'rgba(206,180,142,0.55)'); // worn racing groove
    strokeCL(3, 'rgba(150,120,86,0.5)');
    // the beak-tip run-off bulge (mirrors the WF widening in the logic)
    (function(){
      var apex = 0, bx3 = -1e9;
      for (var i3 = 0; i3 < N; i3++){ if (CL[i3].x > bx3){ bx3 = CL[i3].x; apex = i3; } }
      function tipPass(mul, style){
        for (var i3 = apex-26; i3 <= apex+26; i3++){
          var ia = ((i3 % N) + N) % N, ib = (((i3+1) % N) + N) % N;
          var wfl = WF[ia];
          if (wfl <= 1.001) continue;
          gx.strokeStyle = style; gx.lineJoin = 'round'; gx.lineCap = 'round';
          gx.lineWidth = (TRACK_WIDTH*wfl*mul.w + mul.add)*sxScale;
          gx.beginPath(); gx.moveTo(txx(CL[ia].x), txy(CL[ia].y)); gx.lineTo(txx(CL[ib].x), txy(CL[ib].y)); gx.stroke();
        }
      }
      tipPass({w:1, add:30}, 'rgba(54,32,20,0.8)');
      tipPass({w:1, add:0}, '#dcccaa');
      tipPass({w:0.88, add:0}, '#e6d6b4');
    })();
    for (var wn = 0; wn < 4200; wn++){
      var wq = CL[Math.floor(Math.random()*N)];
      var wa = Math.random()*Math.PI*2, wr = Math.random()*TRACK_WIDTH*0.46;
      gx.fillStyle = 'rgba(150,110,70,' + (0.04+Math.random()*0.08) + ')';
      gx.fillRect(txx(wq.x + Math.cos(wa)*wr), txy(wq.y + Math.sin(wa)*wr), 1+Math.random()*2, 1+Math.random()*2);
    }
    // cleared-edge stone rows: the real lines are edged by swept stones;
    // they also make the road readable at distance
    for (var es = 0; es < N; es += 2){
      var eq = CL[es], ed = cdir(es/N);
      [-1, 1].forEach(function(sd3){
        var exx = eq.x - ed.y*(TRACK_WIDTH/2*WF[es] + 5)*sd3, eyy = eq.y + ed.x*(TRACK_WIDTH/2*WF[es] + 5)*sd3;
        gx.fillStyle = 'rgba(60,38,24,' + (0.35+Math.random()*0.25) + ')';
        gx.beginPath(); gx.arc(txx(exx), txy(eyy), (1.2+Math.random()*1.6)*sxScale*0.6, 0, Math.PI*2); gx.fill();
      });
    }
    // glyph fidelity: the second tail feather (decor, not driven) + the eye
    gx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(220,204,170,0.42)';
    gx.lineWidth = 34*sxScale;
    gx.lineCap = 'round';
    gx.beginPath(); gx.moveTo(txx(-380), txy(-40)); gx.quadraticCurveTo(txx(-660), txy(-10), txx(-930), txy(-60)); gx.stroke();
    gx.fillStyle = 'rgba(220,204,170,0.5)';
    gx.beginPath(); gx.arc(txx(330), txy(150), 9*sxScale, 0, Math.PI*2); gx.fill();
    (function(){
      var p0 = cpt(0.0), d0 = cdir(0.0);
      var px = -d0.y, py = d0.x;
      var sq = 5, rows = 4, cols = Math.floor(TRACK_WIDTH/sq);
      for (var r2 = 0; r2 < rows; r2++){
        for (var c2 = 0; c2 < cols; c2++){
          gx.fillStyle = ((r2 + c2) % 2 === 0) ? 'rgba(240,234,214,0.9)' : 'rgba(40,30,22,0.85)';
          var bx = p0.x + px*(c2*sq - TRACK_WIDTH/2 + sq/2) + d0.x*(r2*sq - rows*sq/2);
          var by = p0.y + py*(c2*sq - TRACK_WIDTH/2 + sq/2) + d0.y*(r2*sq - rows*sq/2);
          gx.fillRect(txx(bx)-sq*sxScale/2, txy(by)-sq*sxScale/2, sq*sxScale, sq*sxScale);
        }
      }
    })();
    var groundTex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(g2);
    groundTex.anisotropy = (renderer.capabilities.getMaxAnisotropy ? renderer.capabilities.getMaxAnisotropy() : 4);
    var ground = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(WW, WH),
      new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ map: groundTex, roughness: 0.95, metalness: 0.0 }));
    ground.rotation.x = -Math.PI/2;
    ground.position.set(GCX, 0, GCZ);
    ground.receiveShadow = true;
    scene.add(ground);
    /* 2026-10-29 (Sam: "the dirt texture I just downloaded must be useful in the Nazca lines dream loop"): his cracked earth laid over the whole
       pampa as a fine tiled crackle that only darkens (multiplied, lightened first), so the plain reads as baked, fissured ground and the lines
       look scraped into it; the painted ground and its lines are unchanged beneath */
    (function(){ var im = new Image(), dt = new THREE.Texture(im); dt.wrapS = dt.wrapT = THREE.RepeatWrapping; dt.repeat.set(WW / 140, WH / 140); dt.anisotropy = groundTex.anisotropy;
      im.src = 'data:image/jpeg;base64,';
      im.onload = function(){ try { var gc = g2.getContext('2d'), ps = 140 * sxScale, pat = gc.createPattern(im, 'repeat'); if (pat.setTransform && window.DOMMatrix) pat.setTransform(new DOMMatrix().scale(ps / im.width, ps / im.height)); gc.save(); gc.globalCompositeOperation = 'multiply'; gc.fillStyle = pat; gc.fillRect(0, 0, g2.width, g2.height); gc.restore(); groundTex.needsUpdate = true; } catch (e) {} }; /* painted into the ground's canvas, multiplied */ })();

    // Clear, unbroken rims follow the same widening as collision. One draw.
    var rimVerts=[];
    for(var ri=0;ri<N;ri++){var rt=ri/N,rn=(ri+1)/N,ra=cpt(rt),rb=cpt(rn),rd=cdir(rt),re=cdir(rn);
      [-1,1].forEach(function(side){rimVerts.push(ra.x-rd.y*TRACK_WIDTH*.5*wfAt(rt)*side,.16,ra.y+rd.x*TRACK_WIDTH*.5*wfAt(rt)*side,rb.x-re.y*TRACK_WIDTH*.5*wfAt(rn)*side,.16,rb.y+re.x*TRACK_WIDTH*.5*wfAt(rn)*side);});}
    var rimGeo=new THREE.BufferGeometry();rimGeo.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(rimVerts,3));
    roadRims=new THREE.LineSegments(rimGeo,new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xffe8b8,transparent:true,opacity:.72}));scene.add(roadRims);

    // ---- distant ridge ----
    var ridgeMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x87705d, roughness: 1 });
    var ridgeFar = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x9b8672, roughness: 1 });
    for (var rj = 0; rj < 12; rj++){
      var ang = rj/12 * Math.PI*2 + 0.3;
      var far2 = rj % 3 === 0;
      var cone = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.ConeGeometry(220 + Math.random()*200, 90 + Math.random()*140, 5), far2 ? ridgeFar : ridgeMat);
      cone.position.set(GCX + Math.cos(ang)*(far2 ? 1500 : 1320), 16, GCZ + Math.sin(ang)*(far2 ? 1500 : 1320));
      cone.scale.z = 0.4;
      cone.rotation.y = Math.random()*3;
      scene.add(cone);
    }

    // ---- weathered wood for arches ----
    var woodC = document.createElement('canvas'); woodC.width = 64; woodC.height = 256;
    var wxc = woodC.getContext('2d');
    wxc.fillStyle = '#6a4a2e'; wxc.fillRect(0,0,64,256);
    for (var wg2 = 0; wg2 < 30; wg2++){
      wxc.strokeStyle = 'rgba(' + (Math.random()<0.5 ? '46,30,16' : '124,92,58') + ',' + (0.2+Math.random()*0.3) + ')';
      wxc.lineWidth = 0.8 + Math.random()*1.6;
      var wxx = Math.random()*64;
      wxc.beginPath(); wxc.moveTo(wxx, 0);
      wxc.quadraticCurveTo(wxx + (Math.random()-0.5)*10, 128, wxx + (Math.random()-0.5)*6, 256);
      wxc.stroke();
    }
    var woodTex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(woodC);
    var wood = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ map: woodTex, roughness: 0.9 });

    // Start gate: massive dry-stacked desert stones, without column bases or capitals.
    var stoneC=document.createElement('canvas');stoneC.width=stoneC.height=128;
    var stx=stoneC.getContext('2d');stx.fillStyle='#a49881';stx.fillRect(0,0,128,128);
    for(var grain=0;grain<1800;grain++){
      var shade=grain%2===0?'58,49,38':'221,207,176';
      stx.fillStyle='rgba('+shade+','+(.07+(grain%9)*.018)+')';
      var gx=Math.sin(grain*127.1+3)*43758.5453,gy=Math.sin(grain*311.7+9)*21942.472;
      stx.fillRect((gx-Math.floor(gx))*128,(gy-Math.floor(gy))*128,1+grain%4,1+grain%3);
    }
    // Shallow pits, branching fissures and earth gathered at the joints.
    for(var pit=0;pit<65;pit++){
      var pitX=(Math.sin(pit*17.3+1)*.5+.5)*128,pitY=(Math.sin(pit*43.7+4)*.5+.5)*128;
      stx.fillStyle='rgba(48,39,27,.2)';stx.beginPath();stx.ellipse(pitX,pitY,1+pit%3,.5+pit%2,.7*pit,0,Math.PI*2);stx.fill();
    }
    stx.strokeStyle='rgba(46,36,24,.32)';stx.lineWidth=.7;
    for(var crack=0;crack<5;crack++){
      var cx=12+crack*24,cy=crack%2?0:93;stx.beginPath();stx.moveTo(cx,cy);
      for(var seg=1;seg<6;seg++)stx.lineTo(cx+Math.sin(seg*3.7+crack)*5,cy+seg*7);
      stx.stroke();
    }
    var stain=stx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,128);stain.addColorStop(0,'rgba(47,35,23,.27)');stain.addColorStop(.18,'rgba(47,35,23,0)');stain.addColorStop(.78,'rgba(47,35,23,0)');stain.addColorStop(1,'rgba(47,35,23,.34)');stx.fillStyle=stain;stx.fillRect(0,0,128,128);
    var gateStoneTex=new THREE.CanvasTexture(stoneC);
    var gateStoneMats=[0xb6a58b,0x9f947f,0xc0ae90].map(function(color){return new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({map:gateStoneTex,bumpMap:gateStoneTex,bumpScale:.48,color:color,roughness:1});});
    function ancientBlock(w,h,d,seed){
      var geo=coachwork(w,h,d,.65),pos=geo.attributes.position;
      for(var v=0;v<pos.count;v++){
        var x=pos.getX(v),y=pos.getY(v),z=pos.getZ(v);
        var wear=Math.sin(x*1.7+y*2.1+z*1.3+seed)*Math.cos(x*.6-z*1.9+seed);
        pos.setXYZ(v,x+wear*.23,y+Math.sin(x*2.4+z*1.6+seed)*.15,z+wear*.25);
      }
      geo.computeVertexNormals();geo.computeBoundingSphere();return geo;
    }
    function buildArch(t, withBanner){
      var p = cpt(t), d = cdir(t);
      var px = -d.y, py = d.x;
      var grp = new THREE.Group();
      var hw = TRACK_WIDTH/2 + 14;
      [-1, 1].forEach(function(side){
        if(withBanner){
          for(var course=0;course<5;course++){
            var broad=14.8-course*.35+(course%2)*.8;
            var blockGeo=ancientBlock(broad,8.65,14+(course%2)*1.4,course*3+side);
            var block=new THREE.Mesh(blockGeo,gateStoneMats[(course+(side>0?1:0))%3]);
            block.position.set(px*hw*side+Math.sin(course*2+side)*.45,4.45+course*9.15,py*hw*side+Math.cos(course*3+side)*.4);
            block.rotation.y=-Math.atan2(py,px)+Math.sin(course*4+side)*.035;
            block.castShadow=true;block.receiveShadow=true;grp.add(block);
          }
        }else{
          var post=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(2.6,3.4,46,8),wood);
          post.position.set(px*hw*side,23,py*hw*side);post.castShadow=true;grp.add(post);
          var foot=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(4.6,5.6,4,8),wood);
          foot.position.set(px*hw*side,2,py*hw*side);grp.add(foot);
        }
      });
      var beam = new THREE.Mesh(withBanner?ancientBlock(hw*2+22,9,16,17):new THREE.BoxGeometry(hw*2+10,4,4),withBanner?gateStoneMats[2]:wood);
      beam.position.set(0,withBanner?49.5:46,0);
      if(withBanner)beam.receiveShadow=true;
      beam.rotation.y = -Math.atan2(py, px);
      beam.castShadow = true;
      grp.add(beam);
      if (withBanner){
        var bc = document.createElement('canvas'); bc.width = 256; bc.height = 48;
        var bcx = bc.getContext('2d');
        bcx.fillStyle = '#b6a17b'; bcx.fillRect(0,0,256,48);
        // Sun-bleached patches and old water stains beneath the lettering.
        for(var stain=0;stain<12;stain++){
          var sx=stain*23-8,sy=12+Math.sin(stain*3.1)*20;
          var sg=bcx.createRadialGradient(sx,sy,0,sx,sy,22+stain%4*5);
          sg.addColorStop(0,stain%2?'rgba(63,44,25,.22)':'rgba(235,219,181,.25)');sg.addColorStop(1,'rgba(150,120,80,0)');bcx.fillStyle=sg;bcx.fillRect(0,0,256,48);
        }
        bcx.fillStyle = 'rgba(75,51,29,0.76)';
        bcx.font = 'bold 30px Georgia, serif';
        bcx.textAlign = 'center'; bcx.textBaseline = 'middle';
        bcx.fillText('N A Z C A R', 128, 25);
        // Fine abrasions break up the ink while keeping NAZCAR legible.
        for(var scuff=0;scuff<950;scuff++){
          var rx=Math.sin(scuff*127.1+4)*43758.5453,ry=Math.sin(scuff*311.7+8)*21942.47;
          bcx.fillStyle=scuff%4?'rgba(208,189,151,.3)':'rgba(60,44,28,.15)';
          bcx.fillRect((rx-Math.floor(rx))*256,(ry-Math.floor(ry))*48,.5+scuff%3,.35+scuff%2*.3);
        }
        // Vertical folds, accumulated grime and softly ragged edges.
        for(var fold=0;fold<7;fold++){
          var fx=17+fold*37;var fg=bcx.createLinearGradient(fx-3,0,fx+4,0);
          fg.addColorStop(0,'rgba(40,27,14,0)');fg.addColorStop(.45,'rgba(40,27,14,.16)');fg.addColorStop(.6,'rgba(237,217,172,.18)');fg.addColorStop(1,'rgba(40,27,14,0)');bcx.fillStyle=fg;bcx.fillRect(fx-3,0,7,48);
        }
        bcx.globalCompositeOperation='destination-out';
        for(var edge=0;edge<130;edge++){
          var ex=edge*2;bcx.fillStyle='rgba(0,0,0,1)';bcx.fillRect(ex,0,2,.5+(Math.sin(edge*7.3)*.5+.5)*2.6);bcx.fillRect(ex,48-(.7+(Math.sin(edge*4.9)*.5+.5)*3.2),2,4);
        }
        bcx.globalCompositeOperation='source-over';
        var signTex=new THREE.CanvasTexture(bc);
        var signGeo=new THREE.PlaneGeometry(hw*1.7,12,32,4),signPos=signGeo.attributes.position;
        for(var sv=0;sv<signPos.count;sv++){
          var xx=signPos.getX(sv),yy=signPos.getY(sv);
          signPos.setXYZ(sv,xx,yy-Math.cos(xx/(hw*.85)*Math.PI/2)*.35,Math.sin(xx*.32)*.12);
        }
        signGeo.computeVertexNormals();
        var banner = new THREE.Mesh(signGeo,
          new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ map:signTex,bumpMap:signTex,bumpScale:.1,transparent:true,alphaTest:.12,side:THREE.DoubleSide,roughness:1 }));
        banner.position.set(0, 37, 0);
        banner.rotation.y = -Math.atan2(py, px);
        banner.userData.isBanner = true;
        grp.add(banner);
        for (var sl2 = 0; sl2 < 3; sl2++){
          var lamp = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(2.1, 10, 8),
            new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x3a1410, roughness: 0.4, emissive: 0x200604, emissiveIntensity: 0.5 }));
          lamp.position.set(px*((sl2-1)*11), 41.5, py*((sl2-1)*11));
          grp.add(lamp);
          startLights.push(lamp);
        }
      }
      grp.position.set(p.x, 0, p.y);
      scene.add(grp);
      return grp;
    }
    var startArch = buildArch(0, true);
    buildArch(0.40, false);
    buildArch(0.78, false);

    // ---- cairns ----
    var cairnMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x5c4632, roughness: 0.95 });
    for (var ci = 0; ci < N; ci += 6){
      if (CURVE[ci] > 0.05){
        var cd2 = cdir(ci/N), cp2 = cpt(ci/N);
        var side2 = (ci % 8 < 4) ? 1 : -1;
        var cxp = cp2.x - cd2.y*(TRACK_WIDTH/2 + 24)*side2;
        var cyp = cp2.y + cd2.x*(TRACK_WIDTH/2 + 24)*side2;
        for (var st2 = 0; st2 < 3; st2++){
          var stone = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.DodecahedronGeometry(3.6 - st2*0.9), cairnMat);
          stone.position.set(cxp + (Math.random()-0.5)*3, 2.4 + st2*4.4, cyp + (Math.random()-0.5)*3);
          stone.rotation.set(Math.random(), Math.random(), Math.random());
          stone.castShadow = true;
          scene.add(stone);
        }
      }
    }

    // hairpin stakes: pale-tipped timbers on the OUTSIDE of the two
    // tightest corners, so the turn reads from a distance
    var stakeMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x7c6248, roughness: 0.9 });
    var stakeTipMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xe8ddc2, roughness: 0.7 });
    for (var si2 = 0; si2 < N; si2 += 2){
      if (CURVE[si2] > 0.16){
        var sd2 = cdir(si2/N), sp3 = cpt(si2/N);
        var lx = sp3.x - sd2.y*(TRACK_WIDTH/2 + 16), lz = sp3.y + sd2.x*(TRACK_WIDTH/2 + 16);
        var rx2 = sp3.x + sd2.y*(TRACK_WIDTH/2 + 16), rz2 = sp3.y - sd2.x*(TRACK_WIDTH/2 + 16);
        var ox2 = closestT(lx, lz).d > closestT(rx2, rz2).d ? lx : rx2;
        var oz2 = closestT(lx, lz).d > closestT(rx2, rz2).d ? lz : rz2;
        var stake = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1.1, 1.4, 16, 6), stakeMat);
        stake.position.set(ox2, 8, oz2);
        stake.rotation.z = (Math.random()-0.5)*0.12;
        stake.castShadow = true;
        scene.add(stake);
        var tip = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1.15, 1.15, 3.4, 6), stakeTipMat);
        tip.position.set(ox2, 15, oz2);
        scene.add(tip);
      }
    }

    // ---- WHITE SAND: gypsum drifts blown onto the straights ----
    (function(){
      var lastI = -999;
      for (var i5 = 0; i5 < N; i5++){
        if (CURVE[i5] < 0.012 && (i5 - lastI) >= 14){
          lastI = i5;
          var dd = cdir(i5/N), pp2 = CL[i5];
          var off = ((patches.length % 3) - 1) * TRACK_WIDTH*0.22;
          patches.push({ x: pp2.x - dd.y*off, y: pp2.y + dd.x*off, taken: false, grp: null });
        }
      }
      var duneMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xf2ead6, roughness: 0.85, emissive: 0x555044, emissiveIntensity: 0.12 });
      var decalC = document.createElement('canvas'); decalC.width = 64; decalC.height = 64;
      var dcx = decalC.getContext('2d');
      var dcg = dcx.createRadialGradient(32,32,3,32,32,30);
      dcg.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(244,238,220,0.7)');
      dcg.addColorStop(0.6, 'rgba(240,232,210,0.28)');
      dcg.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');
      dcx.fillStyle = dcg; dcx.fillRect(0,0,64,64);
      var decalTex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(decalC);
      for (var i6 = 0; i6 < patches.length; i6++){
        var grp2 = new THREE.Group();
        var decal = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(26, 26),
          new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ map: decalTex, transparent: true, depthWrite: false }));
        decal.rotation.x = -Math.PI/2; decal.position.y = 0.28;
        grp2.add(decal);
        for (var dn = 0; dn < 3; dn++){
          var dune = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.ConeGeometry(3.4 + Math.random()*2.6, 2.2 + Math.random()*1.6, 7), duneMat);
          dune.position.set((Math.random()-0.5)*10, 1.1, (Math.random()-0.5)*10);
          grp2.add(dune);
        }
        grp2.position.set(patches[i6].x, 0, patches[i6].y);
        scene.add(grp2);
        patches[i6].grp = grp2;
      }
    })();

    // ---- ITEM BOXES: spinning gold octahedra, Mario rows of three ----
    (function(){
      var rows = [0.12, 0.5, 0.82];
      var boxMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xd4ae6a, roughness: 0.3, metalness: 0.7, emissive: 0x8a6a2a, emissiveIntensity: 0.55 });
      for (var r5 = 0; r5 < rows.length; r5++){
        var bd5 = cdir(rows[r5]), bp5 = cpt(rows[r5]);
        for (var c5 = -1; c5 <= 1; c5++){
          var bx5 = bp5.x - bd5.y*(c5*TRACK_WIDTH*0.27), bz5 = bp5.y + bd5.x*(c5*TRACK_WIDTH*0.27);
          var bm5 = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.OctahedronGeometry(6), boxMat);
          bm5.position.set(bx5, 8, bz5);
          bm5.castShadow = true;
          scene.add(bm5);
          itemBoxes.push({ x: bx5, y: bz5, mesh: bm5, taken: false, respawnAt: 0, ph: Math.random()*6 });
        }
      }
    })();
    slickMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x14100c, roughness: 0.15, metalness: 0.5 });
    stoneAmmoMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x4c4238, roughness: 0.8 });

    // ---- suck + spark particle pool ----
    var whiteC = document.createElement('canvas'); whiteC.width = 32; whiteC.height = 32;
    var wcx2 = whiteC.getContext('2d');
    var wg3 = wcx2.createRadialGradient(16,16,2,16,16,15);
    wg3.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(248,242,226,0.9)'); wg3.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');
    wcx2.fillStyle = wg3; wcx2.fillRect(0,0,32,32);
    var whiteTex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(whiteC);
    var sparkC = document.createElement('canvas'); sparkC.width = 32; sparkC.height = 32;
    var scx2 = sparkC.getContext('2d');
    var sg2 = scx2.createRadialGradient(16,16,1,16,16,15);
    sg2.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,224,150,1)'); sg2.addColorStop(0.4, 'rgba(240,190,90,0.5)'); sg2.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');
    scx2.fillStyle = sg2; scx2.fillRect(0,0,32,32);
    var sparkTex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(sparkC);
    for (var sp5 = 0; sp5 < 26; sp5++){
      var ss = new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({ map: whiteTex, transparent: true, opacity: 0, depthWrite: false }));
      ss.userData = { mode: 0 };
      scene.add(ss); suckPool.push(ss);
    }
    window._nzSpawnSuck = function(x, z){
      var s6 = suckPool[suckIdx = (suckIdx+1) % suckPool.length];
      s6.material.map = whiteTex; s6.material.blending = THREE.NormalBlending;
      if (s6.material.color && s6.material.color.setHex) s6.material.color.setHex(0xffffff);
      s6.position.set(x + (Math.random()-0.5)*16, 1 + Math.random()*3, z + (Math.random()-0.5)*16);
      s6.userData = { mode: 1, born: raceNow() };
      var sc2 = 2 + Math.random()*2; s6.scale.set(sc2, sc2, 1);
    };
    window._nzSpawnSpark = function(x, z, hex){
      var s7 = suckPool[suckIdx = (suckIdx+1) % suckPool.length];
      s7.material.map = sparkTex; s7.material.blending = THREE.AdditiveBlending;
      if (s7.material.color && s7.material.color.setHex) s7.material.color.setHex(hex || 0xffe096);
      s7.position.set(x + (Math.random()-0.5)*8, 1.5 + Math.random()*3, z + (Math.random()-0.5)*8);
      s7.userData = { mode: 2, born: raceNow(), vx: (Math.random()-0.5)*1.6, vy: 0.6+Math.random(), vz: (Math.random()-0.5)*1.6 };
      var sc3 = 1.2 + Math.random()*1.4; s7.scale.set(sc3, sc3, 1);
    };

    // ---- engine: sawtooth pair through a lowpass; honours the mute ----
    try {
      var actx = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();
      var eGain = actx.createGain(); eGain.gain.value = 0;
      var eFilt = actx.createBiquadFilter(); eFilt.type = 'lowpass'; eFilt.frequency.value = 420; eFilt.Q.value = 2.2;
      var o1 = actx.createOscillator(); o1.type = 'sawtooth'; o1.frequency.value = 52;
      var o2 = actx.createOscillator(); o2.type = 'square'; o2.frequency.value = 26;
      var og2 = actx.createGain(); og2.gain.value = 0.35;
      o1.connect(eFilt); o2.connect(og2); og2.connect(eFilt);
      eFilt.connect(eGain); eGain.connect(actx.destination);
      o1.start(); o2.start();
      eng = {
        resume: function(){ try { actx.resume(); } catch(e){} },
        update: function(sp, drift){
          var muted = (window.dssAudio && window.dssAudio.isMuted && window.dssAudio.isMuted());
          var tgt = (muted || paused || !racing || finished) ? 0 : (0.016 + 0.03*(sp/4.6));
          eGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(tgt, actx.currentTime, 0.08);
          var f = 46 + 130*(sp/4.6) + (drift ? 14 : 0);
          o1.frequency.setTargetAtTime(f, actx.currentTime, 0.06);
          o2.frequency.setTargetAtTime(f/2, actx.currentTime, 0.06);
          eFilt.frequency.setTargetAtTime(300 + 900*(sp/4.6), actx.currentTime, 0.08);
        },
        blip: function(){
          var muted = (window.dssAudio && window.dssAudio.isMuted && window.dssAudio.isMuted());
          if (muted) return;
          var b2 = actx.createOscillator(), bg3 = actx.createGain();
          b2.type = 'sine'; b2.frequency.value = 640;
          try { b2.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(980, actx.currentTime + 0.09); } catch(e){}
          bg3.gain.value = 0.0; bg3.gain.setTargetAtTime(0.05, actx.currentTime, 0.01);
          bg3.gain.setTargetAtTime(0, actx.currentTime + 0.1, 0.05);
          b2.connect(bg3); bg3.connect(actx.destination);
          b2.start(); b2.stop(actx.currentTime + 0.3);
        },
        kill: function(){ try { o1.stop(); o2.stop(); actx.close(); } catch(e){} }
      };
    } catch(e){ eng = null; }

    // A small sky/earth reflection probe: wide, blurred highlights for old enamel.
    var envScene=new THREE.Scene();
    var envCanvas=document.createElement('canvas');envCanvas.width=128;envCanvas.height=64;
    var ex=envCanvas.getContext('2d'),eg=ex.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,64);
    eg.addColorStop(0,'#7194b7');eg.addColorStop(.43,'#b8cad4');eg.addColorStop(.52,'#ffc17b');eg.addColorStop(.6,'#94704f');eg.addColorStop(1,'#372e28');
    ex.fillStyle=eg;ex.fillRect(0,0,128,64);
    var envTex=new THREE.CanvasTexture(envCanvas);
    var envShell=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(20,24,12),new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({map:envTex,side:THREE.BackSide}));envScene.add(envShell);
    var pmrem=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);paintEnv=pmrem.fromScene(envScene,.038);/* 2026-10-24 (Sam): .12 asked 59 blur samples of a 20-sample cap and warned in the console on every race; .038 is the widest blur the cap allows, the same picture without the warning */pmrem.dispose();envShell.geometry.dispose();envShell.material.dispose();envTex.dispose();

    // ---- cars: real bodywork ----
    // Rounded panels with continuous corner normals, no external geometry library.
    function coachwork(w,h,l,r){
      var geo=new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,h,l,8,6,10),pos=geo.attributes.position,norm=geo.attributes.normal;
      var inner=[w/2-r,h/2-r,l/2-r];
      for(var v=0;v<pos.count;v++){
        var x=pos.getX(v),y=pos.getY(v),z=pos.getZ(v);
        var cx=Math.max(-inner[0],Math.min(inner[0],x)),cy=Math.max(-inner[1],Math.min(inner[1],y)),cz=Math.max(-inner[2],Math.min(inner[2],z));
        var nx=x-cx,ny=y-cy,nz=z-cz,len=Math.sqrt(nx*nx+ny*ny+nz*nz)||1;
        nx/=len;ny/=len;nz/=len;pos.setXYZ(v,cx+nx*r,cy+ny*r,cz+nz*r);norm.setXYZ(v,nx,ny,nz);
      }
      pos.needsUpdate=true;norm.needsUpdate=true;geo.computeBoundingSphere();return geo;
    }
    function buildCar(bodyColor, glassColor, roundel){
      var grp = new THREE.Group();
      var bodyGrp = new THREE.Group();
      grp.add(bodyGrp);
      var paint = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: bodyColor, roughness: 0.46, metalness: 0.55, envMap:paintEnv.texture, envMapIntensity:0.85 });
      var glass = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: glassColor, roughness: 0.15, metalness: 0.6 });
      var chrome = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xc9c5b9, roughness: 0.34, metalness: 0.88, envMap:paintEnv.texture, envMapIntensity:0.95 });
      var chassis = new THREE.Mesh(coachwork(13,4.4,26,1.8), paint);
      chassis.position.y = 5.4; chassis.castShadow = true; bodyGrp.add(chassis);
      var hood = new THREE.Mesh(coachwork(12.2,2.2,9.5,1.05), paint);
      hood.position.set(0, 8, 8); hood.castShadow = true; bodyGrp.add(hood);
      var boot = new THREE.Mesh(coachwork(12.2,2.6,7.5,1.2), paint);
      boot.position.set(0, 8.1, -9.5); boot.castShadow = true; bodyGrp.add(boot);
      var cabin = new THREE.Mesh(coachwork(10.6,4.2,12,1.7), paint);
      cabin.position.set(0, 10.6, -1.6); cabin.castShadow = true; bodyGrp.add(cabin);
      var windshield = new THREE.Mesh(coachwork(9.4,3.2,.65,.3), glass);
      windshield.position.set(0, 10.4, 3.9);
      windshield.rotation.x = -0.38;
      bodyGrp.add(windshield);
      var rearGlass = new THREE.Mesh(coachwork(9.4,3,.65,.3), glass);
      rearGlass.position.set(0, 10.3, -7.1);
      rearGlass.rotation.x = 0.42;
      bodyGrp.add(rearGlass);
      [-1, 1].forEach(function(side){
        var sideGlass = new THREE.Mesh(coachwork(.55,2.7,8.6,.25), glass);
        sideGlass.position.set(side*5.1, 10.5, -1.6);
        bodyGrp.add(sideGlass);
        var bump = new THREE.Mesh(coachwork(13.4,1.1,1.3,.5), chrome);
        bump.position.set(0, 3.6, side*13.1);
        bodyGrp.add(bump);
      });
      var fenderGeo=new THREE.SphereGeometry(1,16,10);
      [-1,1].forEach(function(side){
        [8.4,-8.6].forEach(function(axle){var wing=new THREE.Mesh(fenderGeo,paint);wing.position.set(side*5.45,5.5,axle);wing.scale.set(2,2.3,4.4);wing.castShadow=true;bodyGrp.add(wing);});
        var lampRim=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(1.35,14,8),chrome);lampRim.position.set(side*4.4,6.7,12.6);lampRim.scale.set(1,1,.4);bodyGrp.add(lampRim);
        var headlamp=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(1.03,14,8),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xf4deb1,roughness:.28,metalness:.15}));headlamp.position.set(side*4.4,6.7,13.02);headlamp.scale.set(1,1,.25);bodyGrp.add(headlamp);
        var tail=new THREE.Mesh(coachwork(2,.85,.5,.24),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x8a2417,roughness:.35}));tail.position.set(side*4.5,6,-13);bodyGrp.add(tail);
      });
      if (roundel){
        var rc = document.createElement('canvas'); rc.width = 64; rc.height = 64;
        var rcx = rc.getContext('2d');
        rcx.fillStyle = 'rgba(238,232,214,0.96)';
        rcx.beginPath(); rcx.arc(32,32,26,0,Math.PI*2); rcx.fill();
        rcx.fillStyle = '#241c12';
        rcx.font = 'bold 30px Georgia, serif';
        rcx.textAlign = 'center'; rcx.textBaseline = 'middle';
        rcx.fillText('93', 32, 34);
        var rTex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(rc);
        [-1, 1].forEach(function(side){
          var disc = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(5, 5),
            new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ map: rTex, transparent: true }));
          disc.position.set(side*6.56, 5.8, 1.5);
          disc.rotation.y = side*Math.PI/2;
          bodyGrp.add(disc);
        });
      }
      var wheels = [];
      var wheelGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(3.4, 3.4, 2.8, 14);
      var tyre = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x161310, roughness: 0.9 });
      var hubGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1.7, 1.7, 3.0, 12);
      [[-6.9, 8.4],[6.9, 8.4],[-6.9, -8.6],[6.9, -8.6]].forEach(function(wp){
        var wgrp = new THREE.Group();
        var wh2 = new THREE.Mesh(wheelGeo, tyre);
        var hub = new THREE.Mesh(hubGeo, chrome);
        wh2.rotation.z = Math.PI/2; hub.rotation.z = Math.PI/2;
        wgrp.add(wh2); wgrp.add(hub);
        wgrp.position.set(wp[0], 3.4, wp[1]);
        wh2.castShadow = true;
        grp.add(wgrp);
        wheels.push(wgrp);
      });
      return { grp: grp, body: bodyGrp, wheels: wheels };
    }
    var pc = buildCar(0xa8402a, 0x20242a, true);
    player = pc.grp; playerBody = pc.body; playerWheels = pc.wheels;
    var oc = buildCar(0x171512, 0x090808, false);
    opp = oc.grp; oppBody = oc.body; oppWheels = oc.wheels;
    scene.add(player); scene.add(opp);

    // ---- dust ----
    var dustC = document.createElement('canvas'); dustC.width = 32; dustC.height = 32;
    var dxc = dustC.getContext('2d');
    var dg = dxc.createRadialGradient(16,16,2,16,16,15);
    dg.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(206,172,128,0.55)'); dg.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');
    dxc.fillStyle = dg; dxc.fillRect(0,0,32,32);
    var dustTex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(dustC);
    for (var dp = 0; dp < 72; dp++){
      var d3 = new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({ map: dustTex, transparent: true, opacity: 0, depthWrite: false }));
      d3.userData = { life: 0 };
      scene.add(d3); dustPool.push(d3);
    }
    // Broad, irregular dust banks with a bright sunlit crown and earthen belly.
    var bankCanvas=document.createElement('canvas');bankCanvas.width=128;bankCanvas.height=64;
    var bx=bankCanvas.getContext('2d');
    for(var puff=0;puff<13;puff++){
      var px=14+puff*8,py=30+Math.sin(puff*2.3)*7;
      var bg=bx.createRadialGradient(px,py,0,px,py,23);
      bg.addColorStop(0,'rgba(208,156,98,.55)');bg.addColorStop(.45,'rgba(224,171,107,.32)');bg.addColorStop(1,'rgba(224,171,107,0)');
      bx.fillStyle=bg;bx.fillRect(0,0,128,64);
      var edge=bx.createRadialGradient(px-5,py-9,0,px-5,py-9,17);
      edge.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,198,115,.32)');edge.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,209,133,0)');bx.fillStyle=edge;bx.fillRect(0,0,128,64);
    }
    // Feather every texture boundary so overlapping banks never show a rectangle.
    bx.globalCompositeOperation='destination-in';
    var featherX=bx.createLinearGradient(0,0,128,0);featherX.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,255,255,0)');featherX.addColorStop(.2,'white');featherX.addColorStop(.8,'white');featherX.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,255,255,0)');bx.fillStyle=featherX;bx.fillRect(0,0,128,64);
    var featherY=bx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,64);featherY.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,255,255,0)');featherY.addColorStop(.25,'white');featherY.addColorStop(.75,'white');featherY.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,255,255,0)');bx.fillStyle=featherY;bx.fillRect(0,0,128,64);
    var bankTex=new THREE.CanvasTexture(bankCanvas);
    for(var wd=0;wd<(window.innerWidth<600?5:8);wd++){
      var veil=new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map:bankTex,transparent:true,opacity:.3,depthWrite:false}));
      veil.scale.set(180+(wd%4)*36,45+(wd%3)*15,1);scene.add(veil);windDust.push(veil);
    }
    var dustIdx = 0;
    window._nzSpawnDust = function(x, z, str){
      var d4 = dustPool[dustIdx = (dustIdx+1) % dustPool.length];
      d4.position.set(x + (Math.random()-0.5)*6, 2 + Math.random()*2, z + (Math.random()-0.5)*6);
      d4.userData.life = 1;
      d4.userData.str = str;
      var s3 = 5 + Math.random()*5;
      d4.scale.set(s3, s3, 1);
    };

    // ---- THE GOLD WAKE: the line lights where you have driven it ----
    var wakeC = document.createElement('canvas'); wakeC.width = 32; wakeC.height = 64;
    var wkx = wakeC.getContext('2d');
    var wkg = wkx.createRadialGradient(16,32,2,16,32,30);
    wkg.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(240,208,140,0.65)');
    wkg.addColorStop(0.5, 'rgba(212,174,106,0.22)');
    wkg.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');
    wkx.fillStyle = wkg; wkx.fillRect(0,0,32,64);
    var wakeTex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(wakeC);
    // The whole gold trail shares a single geometry, texture and draw.
    wakeMesh=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(7,13),new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({map:wakeTex,blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending,transparent:true,opacity:.65,depthWrite:false}),340);
    wakeMesh.frustumCulled=false;wakeColor=new THREE.Color();scene.add(wakeMesh);
    for(var wk2=0;wk2<340;wk2++){
      var wkm=new THREE.Object3D();wkm.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;wkm.position.y=.32;wkm.userData={on:false,born:0};
      wkm.scale.setScalar(0);wkm.updateMatrix();wakeMesh.setMatrixAt(wk2,wkm.matrix);wakeMesh.setColorAt(wk2,wakeColor.setRGB(0,0,0));wakePool.push(wkm);
    }

    // ---- dust devils on the far plain ----
    var devilC = document.createElement('canvas'); devilC.width = 64; devilC.height = 256;
    var dvx = devilC.getContext('2d');
    for (var dv2 = 0; dv2 < 26; dv2++){
      var dva = 0.14 + Math.random()*0.18;
      dvx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,207,132,' + dva + ')';
      dvx.lineWidth = 1.5 + Math.random()*3;
      var dvy0 = Math.random()*256;
      dvx.beginPath(); dvx.moveTo(8 + Math.random()*16, 256);
      dvx.quadraticCurveTo(32 + (Math.random()-0.5)*20, dvy0, 20 + Math.random()*24, 0);
      dvx.stroke();
    }
    var devilTex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(devilC);
    for (var dv3 = 0; dv3 < 2; dv3++){
      var devil = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(18 + dv3*3, 7 + dv3*2, 140, 16, 1, true),
        new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ map: devilTex, transparent: true, opacity: 0.32, side: THREE.DoubleSide, depthWrite: false }));
      devil.position.set(GCX,70,GCZ);
      devil.userData = { ph: Math.random()*Math.PI*2, spd: 0.10 + Math.random()*0.12, wanderR: 160 + Math.random()*260, cx: devil.position.x, cz: devil.position.z };
      devil.userData.plumes=[];devil.userData.wasVisible=false;
      // Soft clumps rise in a widening helix from the ground into the column.
      for(var plume=0;plume<20;plume++){
        var curl=new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map:dustTex,color:0xffd08c,transparent:true,opacity:0,depthWrite:false}));
        devil.add(curl);devil.userData.plumes.push(curl);
      }
      var foot=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(65,65),new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({map:dustTex,color:0xeeb775,transparent:true,opacity:0,depthWrite:false}));
      foot.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;foot.position.y=-69.4;devil.add(foot);devil.userData.foot=foot;
      scene.add(devil); devils.push(devil);
    }

    // ---- condor shadow ----
    var condC = document.createElement('canvas'); condC.width = 128; condC.height = 64;
    var cnx = condC.getContext('2d');
    cnx.fillStyle = 'rgba(20,14,10,0.5)';
    cnx.beginPath();
    cnx.moveTo(10, 30); cnx.quadraticCurveTo(40, 6, 64, 26);
    cnx.quadraticCurveTo(88, 6, 118, 30);
    cnx.quadraticCurveTo(88, 26, 66, 40); cnx.quadraticCurveTo(64, 52, 62, 40);
    cnx.quadraticCurveTo(40, 26, 10, 30);
    cnx.fill();
    condor = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(64, 32),
      new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ map: new THREE.CanvasTexture(condC), transparent: true, opacity: 0, depthWrite: false }));
    condor.rotation.x = -Math.PI/2;
    condor.position.y = 0.6;
    condor.userData = { active: false, nextAt: raceNow() + 9000 };
    scene.add(condor);

    buildRaceUI();
    bindInput();
    animId = requestAnimationFrame(loop);
  }

  // ── mechanics ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  function isOnTrack(x, y){ var c = closestT(x, y); return c.d < TRACK_WIDTH*0.58*wfAt(c.t); }
  function buildRaceUI(){
    canvas.tabIndex = 0;
    canvas.setAttribute('aria-label', 'NaZCAR race. Arrow keys or WASD to drive. Space uses an item. P pauses.');
    racePanel = document.createElement('div'); racePanel.className = 'nz-dashboard';
    racePanel.innerHTML = '<div><small data-nz="speedLabel">SPEED</small><strong data-nz="speed">0</strong></div><div class="nz-charge"><small data-nz="state">DRIFT / BOOST</small><meter data-nz="charge" min="0" max="1" value="0" aria-label="Drift and boost charge"></meter></div><div><small data-nz="lap">LAP 1 / 2</small><strong data-nz="time">0.00s</strong></div>';
    canvas.parentElement.appendChild(racePanel);
    dashboard = {};
    ['speedLabel','speed','state','charge','lap','time'].forEach(function(k){ dashboard[k] = racePanel.querySelector('[data-nz="'+k+'"]'); });
    var controls = document.createElement('div'); controls.className = 'nz-controls';
    function button(text, action){
      var b = document.createElement('button'); b.type = 'button'; b.textContent = text;
      b.addEventListener('click', action); controls.appendChild(b); return b;
    }
    pauseButton = button('Start race', function(){
      if (!raceStarted && countdownAt === null) startCountdown(); else setPaused(!paused);
      canvas.focus({preventScroll:true});
    });
    itemButton = button('Item · Space', useItem); itemButton.disabled = true;
    retryButton = button('Race again', resetRace); retryButton.hidden = true;
    var expandButton = button('Expand', function(){
      var expanded = canvas.parentElement.parentElement.classList.toggle('nz-expanded');
      expandButton.textContent = expanded ? 'Shrink' : 'Expand';
      expandButton.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(expanded));
      canvas.focus({preventScroll:true});
    });
    expandButton.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');
    // 2026-10-18 (Sam: the bar under the race felt unfinished): the controls sit in a toolbar above the frame, as in the other dream games
    var toolbar = document.createElement('div'); toolbar.className = 'nz-toolbar';
    var tbLabel = document.createElement('span'); tbLabel.textContent = 'NAZCA \u00b7 THE RACE'; toolbar.appendChild(tbLabel); toolbar.appendChild(controls);
    canvas.parentElement.parentElement.insertBefore(toolbar, canvas.parentElement);
    var help = document.createElement('div'); help.className = 'nz-help';
    help.textContent = '↑ / W accelerate · ← → / A D steer · ↓ / S brake · Space item · P pause. Brake before tight bends. Hold a turn at speed to charge a drift; straighten to boost. Leaf: speed; stone: ahead; slick: behind; condor: seeks the rival.';
    canvas.parentElement.appendChild(help); // inside the frame: shown only while paused, as a slip over the track
    var touch = document.createElement('div'); touch.className = 'nz-touch';
    [['◀','a','Steer left'],['▶','d','Steer right'],['BRAKE','s','Brake'],['GO','w','Accelerate']].forEach(function(spec){
      var b = document.createElement('button'); b.type = 'button'; b.textContent = spec[0]; b.setAttribute('aria-label', spec[2]);
      b.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){
        e.preventDefault(); b.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); if (paused) setPaused(false);
        if (!raceStarted) startCountdown(); keys[spec[1]] = true;
      });
      function release(){ keys[spec[1]] = false; }
      b.addEventListener('pointerup', release); b.addEventListener('pointercancel', release); b.addEventListener('lostpointercapture', release);
      touch.appendChild(b);
    });
    canvas.parentElement.parentElement.appendChild(touch);
    ['nz-race-win','nz-race-lose'].forEach(function(id){
      var exit = document.getElementById(id); if (exit) canvas.parentElement.parentElement.appendChild(exit);
    });
    // 2026-10-18 (Sam): the minigame rules card, as the other games have it: NAZCAR on a race-day ticket, both instruction
    // texts word for word on the slip. Play presses the race's own Start button; the pre-race HUD text, now on the card,
    // is cleared then (the HUD carries the live lap and position once racing). The help line under the track stays.
    if (window.dssShowMinigameRules) {
      var hudEl = document.getElementById('nazca-race-hud');
      window.dssShowMinigameRules({ key: 'nazca', play: 'Start race', title: 'NAZCAR',
        lines: [hudEl ? hudEl.textContent : '', help.textContent].filter(Boolean).map(function(t){ return t.replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;'); }),
        onPlay: function(){ if (hudEl && !raceStarted) hudEl.textContent = ''; pauseButton.click(); } });
    }
  }
  function setPaused(value){
    if (finished || (countdownAt === null && !raceStarted)) return;
    paused = value; keys = {}; touching = false; touchSteer = 0;
    canvas.parentElement.parentElement.classList.toggle('nz-paused', !!paused); // 2026-10-18: the help shows as a slip over the track while paused
    renderTime = null; accumulator = 0;
    pauseButton.textContent = paused ? 'Resume' : 'Pause · P';
    if (paused){ announce('PAUSED', Infinity); if (eng) eng.update(0, false); }
    else { countEl.style.opacity = '0'; messageUntil = 0; countdownStep = -1; }
  }
  function resetRace(){
    if (!finished) return;
    [stones, slicks].forEach(function(list){ list.forEach(function(o){ if (o.mesh){ scene.remove(o.mesh); o.mesh.geometry.dispose(); } }); });
    stones = []; slicks = []; item = null; condorAtk = null; oppStun = 0;
    patches.forEach(function(p){ p.taken = false; if(p.grp) p.grp.visible = true; });
    itemBoxes.forEach(function(b){ b.taken = false; b.mesh.visible = true; });
    wakePool.forEach(function(w,i){w.userData.on=false;w.scale.setScalar(0);w.updateMatrix();wakeMesh.setMatrixAt(i,w.matrix);});wakeMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;
    dustPool.forEach(function(d){ d.userData.life = 0; d.material.opacity = 0; });
    suckPool.forEach(function(s){ s.userData.mode = 0; s.material.opacity = 0; });
    var p = cpt(0), d = cdir(0);
    camX = p.x-d.y*24; camY = p.y+d.x*24; camAngle = Math.atan2(-d.x,d.y); moveAngle = camAngle;
    lastT = closestT(camX,camY).t; recoveryT = 0; lastWakeX = camX; lastWakeY = camY;
    playerLapsT = 0; oppT = oppLapsT = -0.04; speed = 0; steerVelocity = 0;
    completedLaps = 0; nextGate = 1; dashboard.speedLabel.textContent = 'SPEED';
    drifting = spinning = paused = racing = raceStarted = finished = false;
    driftMs = driftStage = boost = endFlare = offJudder = 0;
    countdownAt = null; countdownStep = -1; finalLapNoted = false; lastLead = null;
    raceElapsed = lapStartedAt = 0; lapTimes = []; oppDropAt = simTime + 18000;
    cameraHeading = null; camPos = null; keys = {}; touching = false; touchSteer = 0;
    condor.material.opacity = 0; condor.userData.active = false; condor.userData.nextAt = simTime + 9000;
    ['nz-race-win','nz-race-lose'].forEach(function(id){ document.getElementById(id).style.display = 'none'; });
    retryButton.hidden = true; pauseButton.disabled = false;
    startLights.forEach(function(l){ l.material.color.setHex(0x3a1410); l.material.emissive.setHex(0x200604); l.material.emissiveIntensity = 0.5; });
    canvas.focus({preventScroll:true}); startCountdown();
  }
  function updateHud(){
    if (!hud) return;
    var lapNum = Math.min(Math.floor(Math.max(0, playerLapsT)) + 1, TOTAL_LAPS);
    var lead = playerLapsT >= oppLapsT ? 'FIRST' : 'SECOND';
    hud.textContent = 'LAP ' + lapNum + ' OF ' + TOTAL_LAPS + '   ·   YOU ARE RUNNING ' + lead + '.';
    if (!dashboard) return;
    dashboard.speed.textContent = Math.round(speed/maxSpeedOn*100) + '%';
    dashboard.lap.textContent = 'LAP ' + lapNum + ' / ' + TOTAL_LAPS;
    dashboard.time.textContent = formatTime(raceElapsed);
    var cr = closestT(camX,camY), d = cdir(cr.t);
    var wrongWay = speed > 0.7 && -Math.sin(moveAngle)*d.x+Math.cos(moveAngle)*d.y < -0.35;
    var ahead=cdir(cr.t+Math.max(100,speed*42)/trackLength), turn=d.x*ahead.y-d.y*ahead.x;
    var bend=Math.abs(turn)>.42?'BEND '+(turn>0?'RIGHT':'LEFT')+' · BRAKE':'';
    var slickAhead=slicks.some(function(slk){if(slk.owner!=='opponent')return false;var dx=slk.x-camX,dy=slk.y-camY,along=dx*d.x+dy*d.y;return along>0 && along<Math.max(130,speed*55) && Math.abs(dx*d.y-dy*d.x)<TRACK_WIDTH;});
    var hint=slickAhead?'SLICK AHEAD · STEER CLEAR':bend;
    var itemHelp=item?({leaf:'SPACE: SPEED BOOST',stone:'SPACE: THROW AHEAD AT THE BLACK CAR',slick:'SPACE: DROP BEHIND YOU',condor:'SPACE: CONDOR SEEKS THE BLACK CAR'}[item]):'GOLD DIAMONDS: COLLECT AN ITEM';
    hud.textContent += '   ·   '+(hint?hint+'   ·   ':'')+itemHelp;
    var state = spinning ? 'RECOVERING' : wrongWay ? 'WRONG WAY' : !isOnTrack(camX,camY) ? 'OFF ROAD' : boost > 0.1 ? 'BOOST' : drifting ? (driftStage === 2 ? 'GOLD · RELEASE TURN' : driftStage === 1 ? 'BLUE · RELEASE TURN' : 'CHARGING DRIFT') : 'DRIFT / BOOST';
    dashboard.state.textContent = state;
    dashboard.charge.value = boost > 0.1 ? Math.min(1,boost/2) : Math.min(1,driftMs/1800);
    racePanel.dataset.charge = boost > 0.1 || driftStage === 2 ? 'gold' : 'blue';
    itemButton.disabled = !item || paused || spinning || !racing;
    itemButton.textContent = item ? ({leaf:'Leaf · boost',stone:'Stone · throw',slick:'Slick · drop',condor:'Condor · strike'}[item]) + ' / Space' : 'Item · Space';
  }

  function useItem(){
    if (!racing || paused || finished || spinning || !item) return;
    var used = item; item = null;announce({leaf:'LEAF · SPEED BOOST',stone:'STONE · THROWN AHEAD',slick:'SLICK · LEFT BEHIND',condor:'CONDOR · SEEKING THE BLACK CAR'}[used],1100);
    if (used === 'leaf'){
      boost = Math.min(2, boost + 1.3);
      if (window._nzSpawnSpark) for (var uk = 0; uk < 14; uk++) window._nzSpawnSpark(camX + Math.sin(moveAngle)*15, camY - Math.cos(moveAngle)*15, 0x9ae08a);
    } else if (used === 'stone'){
      stones.push({ x: camX - Math.sin(moveAngle)*18, y: camY + Math.cos(moveAngle)*18, a: moveAngle, life: 3500, mesh: null });
    } else if (used === 'slick'){
      slicks.push({ x: camX + Math.sin(moveAngle)*20, y: camY - Math.cos(moveAngle)*20, owner: 'player', armAt: raceNow() + 500, mesh: null });
      if (slicks.length > 4) removeHazard(slicks.shift());
    } else if (used === 'condor'){
      condorAtk = { t0: raceNow(), x: camX, y: camY };
    }
    if (eng) eng.blip();
  }

  function startCountdown(){
    if (raceStarted || countdownAt !== null || disposed) return;
    countdownAt = simTime; countdownStep = -1;
    pauseButton.textContent = 'Pause · P';
    if (eng) eng.resume();
  }
  function tickCountdown(){
    if (countdownAt === null || raceStarted) return;
    var step = Math.min(3, Math.floor((simTime-countdownAt)/900));
    if (step === countdownStep) return;
    countdownStep = step; announce(['3','2','1','GO'][step], 750);
    if (step < 3 && startLights[step]){
      startLights[step].material.color.setHex(0xcc6a1a);
      startLights[step].material.emissive.setHex(0xff9a20);
      startLights[step].material.emissiveIntensity = 1.6;
    }
    if (step === 3){
      raceStarted = racing = true; oppDropAt = simTime + 18000;
      startLights.forEach(function(l){ l.material.color.setHex(0x1a8838); l.material.emissive.setHex(0x22cc55); l.material.emissiveIntensity = 1.8; });
      updateHud();
    }
  }

  function removeHazard(o){if(o.mesh){scene.remove(o.mesh);o.mesh.geometry.dispose();}}
  function triggerSpinout(){
    announce('BACK TO THE LINE · KEEP GOING',1200);
    spinning = true;
    spinFrom = camAngle;
    spinUntil = raceNow() + 1000;
    speed = 0; steerVelocity = 0; boost = 0;
    drifting = false; driftMs = driftStage = 0;
  }

  function update(){
    tickCountdown();
    if (!racing || finished || paused) return;
    var now = raceNow(), dt = 1;
    raceElapsed += 1000/60;

    if (spinning){
      var left = spinUntil - now;
      if (left <= 0){
        spinning = false;
        var p = cpt(recoveryT), d = cdir(recoveryT);
        camX = p.x; camY = p.y;
        camAngle = Math.atan2(-d.x, d.y);
        moveAngle = camAngle; lastT = recoveryT;
        speed = 0.6;
      } else {
        var pr = 1 - left/1000;
        camAngle = reducedMotion?spinFrom:spinFrom + 3*Math.PI * (1 - Math.pow(1-pr, 2));
      }
    } else {
      var accelInput = keys['ArrowUp'] || keys['w'] || touching;
      var brakeInput = keys['ArrowDown'] || keys['s'];
      var leftInput  = keys['ArrowLeft'] || keys['a'] || touchSteer < 0;
      var rightInput = keys['ArrowRight'] || keys['d'] || touchSteer > 0;

      var on = isOnTrack(camX, camY);
      if (boost > 0) boost = Math.max(0, boost - 0.012*dt);
      var maxSp = (on ? maxSpeedOn : maxSpeedOff) + 1.35*Math.min(1, boost);
      if (boost > 0.05 && !brakeInput) speed = Math.min(speed + 0.09*dt, maxSp);
      if (accelInput && !brakeInput) speed = Math.min(speed + accelRate*dt, Math.max(maxSp, speed));
      else            speed = Math.max(speed - decelRate*dt, 0);
      if (brakeInput){speed = Math.max(speed - brakeRate*dt, 0);boost=Math.max(0,boost-.06*dt);}
      if (!on){
        // soft scrub, not a wall: bleed toward the off-road cap
        speed = Math.max(speed * Math.pow(0.972, dt), Math.min(speed, maxSpeedOff));
        offJudder = Math.min(1, offJudder + 0.08*dt);
      } else {
        offJudder = Math.max(0, offJudder - 0.06*dt);
      }

      // steering: fast attack, quick return, saturating with speed
      var steerScale = 0.95 - 0.45*Math.min(1, speed/3.8);   // agile slow, stable fast
      var capV = maxSteerVel*steerScale;
      if (leftInput && !rightInput)       steerVelocity = Math.max(steerVelocity - steerBuildup*dt, -capV);
      else if (rightInput && !leftInput)  steerVelocity = Math.min(steerVelocity + steerBuildup*dt,  capV);
      else {
        if (steerVelocity > 0) steerVelocity = Math.max(0, steerVelocity - steerReturn*dt);
        else if (steerVelocity < 0) steerVelocity = Math.min(0, steerVelocity + steerReturn*dt);
      }
      camAngle += steerVelocity*dt*Math.min(1, speed/0.85);

      // DRIFT: hold a hard turn at speed and the tail steps out; hold
      // the slide past ~0.85s and come off the wheel for a gold-spark
      // turbo. No scrub in the slide — drifting IS the fast way round.
      var wantDrift = on && !brakeInput && (speed/maxSpeedOn) > 0.6 && Math.abs(steerVelocity) > capV*0.8;
      if (wantDrift){
        drifting = true; driftMs += dt*16.67;
        driftStage = driftMs > 1800 ? 2 : (driftMs > 850 ? 1 : 0);
        if (driftStage > 0 && Math.random() < 0.5 && window._nzSpawnSpark){
          window._nzSpawnSpark(camX + Math.sin(moveAngle)*15, camY - Math.cos(moveAngle)*15,
            driftStage === 2 ? 0xffc46a : 0x9adcf0);
        }
      } else {
        if (drifting && driftStage > 0 && on && !brakeInput){
          announce(driftStage === 2 ? 'GOLD BOOST' : 'DRIFT BOOST', 650);
          boost = Math.min(2, boost + (driftStage === 2 ? 1.2 : 0.6));
          if (window._nzSpawnSpark) for (var sk = 0; sk < (driftStage === 2 ? 16 : 10); sk++)
            window._nzSpawnSpark(camX + Math.sin(moveAngle)*15, camY - Math.cos(moveAngle)*15,
              driftStage === 2 ? 0xffc46a : 0x9adcf0);
        }
        drifting = false; driftMs = 0; driftStage = 0;
      }
      var lagK = 1 - Math.pow(drifting ? 0.945 : 0.84, dt);
      var dAng = camAngle - moveAngle;
      while (dAng >  Math.PI) dAng -= Math.PI*2;
      while (dAng < -Math.PI) dAng += Math.PI*2;
      moveAngle += dAng * lagK;

      camX += -Math.sin(moveAngle)*speed*dt;
      camY +=  Math.cos(moveAngle)*speed*dt;

      var offC = closestT(camX, camY);
      if (offC.d < TRACK_WIDTH*.48*wfAt(offC.t)) recoveryT = offC.t;
      if (offC.d > TRACK_WIDTH*1.6*wfAt(offC.t)) triggerSpinout();

      if (speed > 0.7 && Math.random() < (drifting ? 0.95 : (on ? 0.4 : 0.9))){
        window._nzSpawnDust(camX + Math.sin(moveAngle)*14, camY - Math.cos(moveAngle)*14, on ? 0.35 : 0.7);
      }

      // the gold wake: lay a lit segment every ~10 units, on the line only
      var wdx = camX - lastWakeX, wdy = camY - lastWakeY;
      if (on && raceStarted && (wdx*wdx + wdy*wdy) > 256){
        lastWakeX = camX; lastWakeY = camY;
        var wkm2 = wakePool[wakeIdx = (wakeIdx+1) % wakePool.length];
        wkm2.position.x = camX; wkm2.position.z = camY;
        wkm2.rotation.z = -moveAngle;
        wkm2.scale.setScalar(1);wkm2.updateMatrix();wakeMesh.setMatrixAt(wakeIdx,wkm2.matrix);wakeMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;
        wkm2.userData.on = true;
        wkm2.userData.born = now;
      }

      // white sand: hoover the gypsum drifts for a boost
      for (var pc2 = 0; pc2 < patches.length; pc2++){
        var pt2 = patches[pc2];
        if (pt2.taken) continue;
        var pdx = pt2.x - camX, pdy = pt2.y - camY;
        if (pdx*pdx + pdy*pdy < 620){
          pt2.taken = true;
          if (pt2.grp) pt2.grp.visible = false;
          boost = Math.min(1.5, boost + 0.6);
          if (window._nzSpawnSuck) for (var su = 0; su < 9; su++) window._nzSpawnSuck(pt2.x, pt2.y);
          if (eng) eng.blip();
        }
      }

      // item boxes: you carry ONE thing at a time
      for (var ib2 = 0; ib2 < itemBoxes.length; ib2++){
        var box3 = itemBoxes[ib2];
        if (box3.taken || item) continue;
        var bdx = box3.x - camX, bdy = box3.y - camY;
        if (bdx*bdx + bdy*bdy < 420){
          box3.taken = true; box3.respawnAt = now + 5000;
          box3.mesh.visible = false;
          var roll2 = Math.random();
          item = oppLapsT>playerLapsT ? (roll2<.45?'leaf':roll2<.7?'stone':'condor') : (roll2<.35?'leaf':roll2<.6?'stone':roll2<.85?'slick':'condor');
          announce({leaf:'LEAF · SPACE TO BOOST',stone:'STONE · SPACE TO THROW AHEAD',slick:'SLICK · SPACE TO DROP BEHIND',condor:'CONDOR · SPACE TO SEEK THE RIVAL'}[item],1800);
          if (eng) eng.blip();
        }
      }
    }

    var cr = closestT(camX, camY);
    var dT = cr.t - lastT;
    if (dT >  0.5) dT -= 1;
    if (dT < -0.5) dT += 1;
    if (raceStarted && !spinning && cr.d < TRACK_WIDTH*0.8*wfAt(cr.t) && Math.abs(dT)*trackLength <= speed*dt*4+8){
      // Ordered quarter-lap gates prevent shortcut/recovery mileage from
      // winning a race away from the actual chequered finish line.
      var gateDistance = ((nextGate/4)%1-lastT+1)%1;
      if (dT > 0 && gateDistance <= dT+1e-9){
        nextGate++;
      }
      if (nextGate === 5){
        nextGate = 1; completedLaps++;
        var lapTime = raceElapsed-lapStartedAt; lapTimes.push(lapTime); lapStartedAt = raceElapsed;
        bestLap = bestLap === null ? lapTime : Math.min(bestLap,lapTime);
        for (var pr2 = 0; pr2 < patches.length; pr2++){ patches[pr2].taken = false; if (patches[pr2].grp) patches[pr2].grp.visible = true; }
      }
      playerLapsT = completedLaps + cr.t - (nextGate === 1 && cr.t > 0.75 ? 1 : 0);
    }
    lastT = cr.t;

    // Cars deliberately pass through each other: body overlap has no collision response.
    // hazards in flight: stones fly straight, slicks wait, the condor homes
    var opNow = cpt(oppT), opDirH = cdir(oppT);
    var opX = opNow.x - opDirH.y*18, opY = opNow.y + opDirH.x*18;
    for (var st3 = stones.length - 1; st3 >= 0; st3--){
      var stn = stones[st3];
      stn.life -= dt*16.67;
      stn.x += -Math.sin(stn.a)*6.2*dt; stn.y += Math.cos(stn.a)*6.2*dt;
      var sdx = stn.x - opX, sdy = stn.y - opY;
      if (sdx*sdx + sdy*sdy < 420){
        oppStun = 1600; stn.life = 0;announce('HIT · THE BLACK CAR STALLS',1100);
        if (window._nzSpawnSpark) for (var hk = 0; hk < 10; hk++) window._nzSpawnSpark(opX, opY, 0xffe096);
      }
      if (stn.life <= 0){ removeHazard(stn); stones.splice(st3, 1); }
    }
    for (var sl3 = slicks.length - 1; sl3 >= 0; sl3--){
      var slk = slicks[sl3];
      if(now>slk.armAt+14000){removeHazard(slk);slicks.splice(sl3,1);continue;}
      if (now < slk.armAt) continue;
      var odx2 = slk.x - opX, ody2 = slk.y - opY;
      if (slk.owner !== 'opponent' && odx2*odx2 + ody2*ody2 < 300){ oppStun = 1300; removeHazard(slk); slicks.splice(sl3, 1); continue; }
      var pdx2 = slk.x - camX, pdy2 = slk.y - camY;
      if (slk.owner !== 'player' && !spinning && racing && pdx2*pdx2 + pdy2*pdy2 < 260){ removeHazard(slk); slicks.splice(sl3, 1); triggerSpinout(); }
    }
    if (condorAtk && (now - condorAtk.t0) >= 2200){
      oppStun = 1500; condorAtk = null; condor.material.opacity = 0;
      if (window._nzSpawnSpark) for (var ck = 0; ck < 12; ck++) window._nzSpawnSpark(opX, opY, 0x9adcf0);
    }

    // the black car plays the game too: when it leads, it sometimes
    // leaves a slick on the line behind it (your line)
    if (racing && !finished && now > oppDropAt){
      oppDropAt = now + 20000 + Math.random()*14000;
      if ((oppLapsT-playerLapsT)*trackLength>230 && (oppLapsT-playerLapsT)*trackLength<650){
        slicks.push({ x: opX + Math.sin(Math.atan2(-opDirH.x, opDirH.y))*26, y: opY - Math.cos(Math.atan2(-opDirH.x, opDirH.y))*26, owner: 'opponent', armAt: now + 1100, mesh: null });
        announce('THE BLACK CAR LEAVES A SLICK',1600);
        if (slicks.length > 5) removeHazard(slicks.shift());
      }
    }

    var oi = Math.floor(((oppT % 1)+1)%1 * N) % N;
    var aheadCurve = Math.max(CURVE[oi], CURVE[(oi+3)%N], CURVE[(oi+6)%N]);
    var oppEase = 1 - Math.min(0.44, aheadCurve*2.8);
    // Mario rubber band: the black car hustles when behind, coasts when ahead
    var gap2 = playerLapsT - oppLapsT;
    var band = Math.max(0.82, Math.min(1.03, 1 + gap2*0.35));
    var od = oppSpeedT * oppEase * band * Math.min(1,raceElapsed/2000) * dt * (window.dssEase ? window.dssEase.by('nazca', 1, 0.88) : 1); /* 2026-10-28 (dssEase): each lost race slows the black car a little; steering untouched */
    if (oppStun > 0){ oppStun -= dt*16.67; od = 0; }
    oppT += od; oppLapsT += od;

    updateHud();

    var leadNow = playerLapsT >= oppLapsT;
    if (lastLead !== null && leadNow !== lastLead && racing && eng) eng.blip();
    lastLead = leadNow;
    if (!finalLapNoted && playerLapsT > 0.9 && Math.floor(Math.max(0, playerLapsT)) === TOTAL_LAPS - 1){
      finalLapNoted = true;
      announce('FINAL LAP · ' + formatTime(lapTimes[0]), 1600);
      if (eng) eng.blip();
    }

    if (completedLaps >= TOTAL_LAPS){ endRace(true); }
    else if (oppLapsT >= TOTAL_LAPS){ endRace(false); }
  }

  function endRace(won){
    finished = true; racing = false; messageUntil = Infinity;
    if (!won && window.dssEase) window.dssEase.lost('nazca'); /* 2026-10-28 (Sam: "Easier each retry"): Race again is gentler each time */
    pauseButton.disabled = true; retryButton.hidden = false; itemButton.disabled = true;
    dashboard.speedLabel.textContent = 'BEST LAP';
    dashboard.state.textContent = 'RACE COMPLETE';
    dashboard.lap.textContent = 'TOTAL TIME';
    dashboard.time.textContent = formatTime(raceElapsed);
    dashboard.charge.value = 0;
    dashboard.speed.textContent = bestLap === null ? '—' : formatTime(bestLap);
    countEl.textContent = won ? 'YOU CROSS FIRST.' : 'THE BLACK CAR CROSSES FIRST.';
    countEl.style.opacity = '1';
    countEl.style.fontSize = '26px';
    if (hud) hud.textContent = won ? 'The line is the line.' : 'The line did not mind either way.';
    if (won) endFlare = raceNow();
    var span = document.getElementById(won ? 'nz-race-win' : 'nz-race-lose');
    if (span){
      span.style.display = 'block';
      span.classList.add('dss-mini-exit');
      setTimeout(function(){
        if (!disposed && finished && span.style.display !== 'none' && span.scrollIntoView) span.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reducedMotion?'auto':'smooth', block: 'center' });
      }, 900);
    }
    if (window.dssAudio && window.dssAudio.loreUnravel && won) window.dssAudio.loreUnravel();
  }

  // ── render ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  var camPos = null, playerWheelSpin = 0, oppLastPos = null;
  function loop(){
    if (disposed) return;
    animId = requestAnimationFrame(loop);
    if (!document.getElementById('nazca-race-canvas')){ dispose(); return; }
    var wall = performance.now();
    var elapsed = renderTime === null ? 0 : Math.min(100, Math.max(0, wall-renderTime));
    renderTime = wall;
    if (paused){ if (eng) eng.update(0,false); return; }
    var visualDt = elapsed/(1000/60);
    accumulator += elapsed;
    while (accumulator >= 1000/60){ simTime += 1000/60; update(); accumulator -= 1000/60; }
    if (messageUntil && simTime >= messageUntil){ countEl.style.opacity = '0'; messageUntil = 0; }
    var now = raceNow();
    var t = now/1000;

    // player car: position, nose, body roll + squat, wheel spin
    player.position.set(camX, 0, camY);
    var slide = camAngle - moveAngle;
    player.rotation.y = -(camAngle + slide*0.5);
    playerBody.rotation.z = steerVelocity*(drifting ? 8.5 : 5.2);
    playerBody.rotation.x = -speed*0.008 + Math.sin(t*37)*0.004*offJudder;
    playerBody.position.y = Math.sin(t*41)*0.35*offJudder;
    playerWheelSpin += (racing ? speed : 0)*0.32*visualDt;
    for (var pw = 0; pw < playerWheels.length; pw++) playerWheels[pw].rotation.x = playerWheelSpin;

    // opponent: on the line, slight offset, wheels turning; NO dust
    var op = cpt(oppT), odr = cdir(oppT);
    var oppX = op.x - odr.y*18, oppZ = op.y + odr.x*18;
    opp.position.set(oppX, 0, oppZ);
    opp.rotation.y = -(Math.atan2(-odr.x, odr.y));
    var od2 = cdir(oppT + 2.5/N);
    var crossZ = odr.x*od2.y - odr.y*od2.x;
    if (oppBody) oppBody.rotation.z = Math.max(-0.12, Math.min(0.12, crossZ*26));
    for (var ow = 0; ow < oppWheels.length; ow++) oppWheels[ow].rotation.x += racing && oppStun <= 0 ? 0.55*visualDt : 0;

    for (var i = 0; i < dustPool.length; i++){
      var d5 = dustPool[i];
      if (d5.userData.life > 0){
        d5.userData.life -= 0.016*visualDt;
        d5.position.y += 0.16*visualDt;
        if(!reducedMotion){d5.position.x += .32*visualDt;d5.position.z += .12*visualDt;}
        d5.scale.x += 0.22*visualDt; d5.scale.y += 0.17*visualDt;
        d5.material.opacity = Math.max(0, d5.userData.life * (d5.userData.str || 0.4));
      } else d5.material.opacity = 0;
    }

    // A five-second gust passes, then the road stays clear for roughly 19 seconds.
    windDust.forEach(function(veil,i){var motion=reducedMotion?0:t;
      var gustAge=((motion-8-i*.14)%24+24)%24;
      var envelope=gustAge<5?Math.pow(Math.sin(Math.PI*gustAge/5),1.5):0;
      veil.visible=!reducedMotion && envelope>.005;
      if(!veil.visible)return;
      var ahead=95+(i%4)*65,road=cpt(lastT+ahead/trackLength);
      var phase=motion*(.22+(i%3)*.025)+i*2.399;
      var sweep=(gustAge/5*2-1)*(180+(i%4)*25);
      veil.position.set(road.x+sweep,12+(i%3)*8+Math.sin(phase*1.3)*4,road.y+Math.cos(phase*.7)*28+(Math.floor(i/5)-1.5)*24);
      veil.material.rotation=reducedMotion?0:Math.sin(phase*.8)*.12;
      var billow=reducedMotion?1:1+Math.sin(phase*1.2)*.12;
      veil.scale.set((180+(i%4)*36)*billow,(45+(i%3)*15)/billow,1);
      veil.material.opacity=envelope*(.22+.045*Math.sin(phase));
      // Looking into the low sun lights up the suspended dust.
      var sx=-420,sz=-300,dx=veil.position.x-camera.position.x,dz=veil.position.z-camera.position.z;
      var backlight=Math.max(0,(dx*sx+dz*sz)/(Math.sqrt(dx*dx+dz*dz)*516+1));
      veil.material.color.setRGB(1+backlight*.5,1+backlight*.28,1+backlight*.08);
    });

    // boost exhaust sparks
    if (boost > 0.3 && Math.random() < 0.3 && window._nzSpawnSpark)
      window._nzSpawnSpark(camX + Math.sin(moveAngle)*16, camY - Math.cos(moveAngle)*16, 0xffd27a);

    // item boxes spin, bob, respawn
    for (var ib3 = 0; ib3 < itemBoxes.length; ib3++){
      var box4 = itemBoxes[ib3];
      if (box4.taken && now >= box4.respawnAt){ box4.taken = false; box4.mesh.visible = true; }
      if (!box4.taken){
        box4.mesh.rotation.y += 0.04*visualDt;
        box4.mesh.rotation.x += 0.017*visualDt;
        box4.mesh.position.y = 8 + Math.sin(t*2 + box4.ph)*1.6;
      }
    }
    // hazard meshes (lazy) + condor swoop + stun wobble
    for (var st4 = 0; st4 < stones.length; st4++){
      var stn2 = stones[st4];
      if (!stn2.mesh){ stn2.mesh = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.DodecahedronGeometry(4), stoneAmmoMat); scene.add(stn2.mesh); }
      stn2.mesh.position.set(stn2.x, 3.4, stn2.y);
      stn2.mesh.rotation.x += 0.3*visualDt; stn2.mesh.rotation.z += 0.22*visualDt;
    }
    for (var sl4 = 0; sl4 < slicks.length; sl4++){
      var slk2 = slicks[sl4];
      if (!slk2.mesh){
        slk2.mesh = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CircleGeometry(16, 20), slickMat);
        slk2.mesh.rotation.x = -Math.PI/2; slk2.mesh.position.set(slk2.x, 0.34, slk2.y);
        scene.add(slk2.mesh);
      }
    }
    if (condorAtk && condor){
      var cpr = Math.min(1, (now - condorAtk.t0)/2200);
      var opP2 = cpt(oppT), opD2 = cdir(oppT);
      condor.position.x = condorAtk.x + ((opP2.x - opD2.y*18) - condorAtk.x)*cpr;
      condor.position.z = condorAtk.y + ((opP2.y + opD2.x*18) - condorAtk.y)*cpr;
      condor.material.opacity = 0.85;
      condor.scale.setScalar(1 + 0.3*Math.sin(cpr*20));
    }
    if (oppStun > 0 && oppBody){ oppBody.rotation.z = Math.sin(t*30)*0.2; }

    // suck + spark particles
    for (var sp6 = 0; sp6 < suckPool.length; sp6++){
      var s8 = suckPool[sp6], sud = s8.userData;
      if (!sud.mode) continue;
      var age2 = (now - sud.born)/1000;
      if (sud.mode === 1){
        if (age2 > 0.5){ sud.mode = 0; s8.material.opacity = 0; continue; }
        var k2 = age2/0.5;
        var tx2 = camX + Math.sin(moveAngle)*10, tz2 = camY - Math.cos(moveAngle)*10;
        s8.position.x += (tx2 - s8.position.x) * (0.18 + 0.5*k2);
        s8.position.z += (tz2 - s8.position.z) * (0.18 + 0.5*k2);
        s8.position.y = Math.max(0.6, s8.position.y - 0.08);
        s8.material.opacity = 0.8*(1-k2) + 0.1;
        s8.scale.multiplyScalar(0.97);
      } else {
        if (age2 > 0.7){ sud.mode = 0; s8.material.opacity = 0; continue; }
        s8.position.x += sud.vx*visualDt; s8.position.y += sud.vy*visualDt; s8.position.z += sud.vz*visualDt;
        sud.vy -= 0.09*visualDt;
        s8.material.opacity = 0.9*(1 - age2/0.7);
      }
    }

    // wake: settle from bright to a steady ember
    for (var wq2 = 0; wq2 < wakePool.length; wq2++){
      var wk3 = wakePool[wq2];
      if (wk3.userData.on){
        var age = (now - wk3.userData.born)/1000;
        var lvl = age < 1.2 ? (0.5 - 0.28*(age/1.2)) : 0.22;
        if (endFlare){ var fa = (now - endFlare)/1000; lvl = 0.85*Math.exp(-fa/2.2) + 0.2; }
        var glow=lvl*(reducedMotion?1:.92+.08*Math.sin(t*.65+wq2*.35));wakeMesh.setColorAt(wq2,wakeColor.setRGB(glow,glow*.92,glow*.76));
      }
    }

    wakeMesh.instanceColor.needsUpdate=true;
    roadRims.material.opacity=reducedMotion?.72:.72+.04*Math.sin(t*.3);

    // dust devils wander
    for (var dv4 = 0; dv4 < devils.length; dv4++){
      var dvl = devils[dv4], du = dvl.userData;
      du.ph += .006*visualDt;
      dvl.rotation.y += 0.055*visualDt;
      var devilAge=((t-18-dv4*22)%44+44)%44;
      var devilFade=devilAge<10?Math.sin(Math.PI*devilAge/10):0;
      dvl.visible=!reducedMotion && devilFade>.01;
      if(dvl.visible && !du.wasVisible){
        var devilRoad=cpt(lastT+260/trackLength),devilDir=cdir(lastT+260/trackLength),side=dv4===0?1:-1;
        du.cx=devilRoad.x-devilDir.y*135*side;du.cz=devilRoad.y+devilDir.x*135*side;
      }
      du.wasVisible=dvl.visible;
      dvl.position.x=du.cx+Math.cos(du.ph)*16;dvl.position.z=du.cz+Math.sin(du.ph*.8)*12;
      dvl.material.opacity=devilFade*.72;
      du.plumes.forEach(function(curl,j){
        var rise=(j/20+t*.19)%1,angle=j*2.399+t*1.8,radius=5+rise*16;
        curl.position.set(Math.cos(angle)*radius,-68+rise*137,Math.sin(angle)*radius);
        var size=14+rise*21;curl.scale.set(size,size*.8,1);
        curl.material.rotation=-angle*.3;
        curl.material.opacity=devilFade*Math.sin(Math.PI*rise)*.64;
        var sunlight=.5+.5*Math.cos(angle+2.52);
        curl.material.color.setRGB(1+sunlight*.65,.79+sunlight*.3,.48+sunlight*.12);
      });
      du.foot.material.opacity=devilFade*.55;
    }

    if (!condorAtk && !condor.userData.active && now > condor.userData.nextAt){
      condor.userData.active = true;
      condor.userData.t0 = now;
      condor.userData.fromX = camX - 320; condor.userData.fromZ = camY - 140 + Math.random()*280;
      condor.userData.dz = (Math.random()-0.5)*0.5;
    }
    if (!condorAtk && condor.userData.active){
      var ct = (now - condor.userData.t0)/9000;
      if (ct >= 1){ condor.userData.active = false; condor.userData.nextAt = now + 16000 + Math.random()*18000; condor.material.opacity = 0; }
      else {
        condor.position.x = condor.userData.fromX + ct*680;
        condor.position.z = condor.userData.fromZ + ct*680*condor.userData.dz;
        condor.material.opacity = Math.sin(ct*Math.PI)*0.75;
        condor.scale.setScalar(0.9 + 0.25*Math.sin(ct*11));
      }
    }

    // shadow frustum follows the player
    sunLight.position.set(camX - 420, 78, camY - 300);
    sunLight.target.position.set(camX, 0, camY);
    sunLight.target.updateMatrixWorld();

    // chase camera with lag + speed FOV
    if (cameraHeading === null) cameraHeading = moveAngle;
    var headDelta = Math.atan2(Math.sin(moveAngle-cameraHeading),Math.cos(moveAngle-cameraHeading));
    cameraHeading += headDelta*(1-Math.pow(0.89,visualDt));
    var follow = 65 + (reducedMotion ? 0 : Math.min(14,speed*2.5));
    var tx = camX + Math.sin(cameraHeading)*follow, tz = camY - Math.cos(cameraHeading)*follow;
    if (!camPos) camPos = { x: tx, z: tz };
    camPos.x += (tx - camPos.x)*(1-Math.pow(0.80,visualDt));
    camPos.z += (tz - camPos.z)*(1-Math.pow(0.80,visualDt));
    camera.position.set(camPos.x, 35, camPos.z);
    camera.lookAt(camX - Math.sin(cameraHeading)*65, 4, camY + Math.cos(cameraHeading)*65);
    var targetFov = reducedMotion ? 64 : 60 + 6*(speed/maxSpeedOn) + (boost > 0.25 ? 3 : 0);
    if (Math.abs(camera.fov - targetFov) > 0.1){
      camera.fov += (targetFov - camera.fov)*(1-Math.pow(0.9,visualDt));
      camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
    }

    if (eng) eng.update(speed, drifting);
    if (composer) composer.render(); else renderer.render(scene, camera);
    drawMinimap();
    drawItemSlot();
  }

  function drawMinimap(){
    var mw = 150, mh = 100;
    mapCtx.clearRect(0, 0, mw, mh);
    // dark leather backing, rounded
    mapCtx.fillStyle = 'rgba(16,11,7,0.72)';
    mapCtx.beginPath();
    if (mapCtx.roundRect) mapCtx.roundRect(0, 0, mw, mh, 8); else mapCtx.rect(0, 0, mw, mh);
    mapCtx.fill();
    mapCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(212,174,106,0.35)';
    mapCtx.lineWidth = 1;
    mapCtx.beginPath();
    if (mapCtx.roundRect) mapCtx.roundRect(1.5, 1.5, mw-3, mh-3, 7); else mapCtx.rect(1.5, 1.5, mw-3, mh-3);
    mapCtx.stroke();
    function mx(x){ return (x - MINX)/WW * (mw-16) + 8; }
    function my(y){ return (y - MINY)/WH * (mh-16) + 8; }
    // the bird in gold ink; the driven portion burns brighter
    mapCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(212,174,106,0.5)';
    mapCtx.lineWidth = 1.3;
    mapCtx.beginPath();
    for (var i = 0; i <= N; i++){
      var q = CL[i % N];
      if (i === 0) mapCtx.moveTo(mx(q.x), my(q.y)); else mapCtx.lineTo(mx(q.x), my(q.y));
    }
    mapCtx.stroke();
    if (raceStarted && playerLapsT > 0){
      var lit = Math.min(1, playerLapsT % 1 + (playerLapsT >= 1 ? 1 : 0));
      mapCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(240,208,140,0.95)';
      mapCtx.lineWidth = 1.7;
      mapCtx.beginPath();
      var upto = Math.floor(Math.min(1, lit) * N);
      for (var li = 0; li <= upto; li++){
        var lq = CL[li % N];
        if (li === 0) mapCtx.moveTo(mx(lq.x), my(lq.y)); else mapCtx.lineTo(mx(lq.x), my(lq.y));
      }
      mapCtx.stroke();
    }
    // decor feather + eye so the map reads as the whole bird
    mapCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(212,174,106,0.3)';
    mapCtx.lineWidth = 1;
    mapCtx.beginPath(); mapCtx.moveTo(mx(-380), my(-40)); mapCtx.quadraticCurveTo(mx(-660), my(-10), mx(-930), my(-60)); mapCtx.stroke();
    mapCtx.fillStyle = 'rgba(212,174,106,0.55)';
    mapCtx.beginPath(); mapCtx.arc(mx(330), my(150), 1.6, 0, Math.PI*2); mapCtx.fill();
    if (endFlare){
      mapCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,228,160,' + (0.45 + 0.45*Math.sin(raceNow()/170)) + ')';
      mapCtx.lineWidth = 2.2;
      mapCtx.beginPath();
      for (var fb = 0; fb <= N; fb++){
        var fq = CL[fb % N];
        if (fb === 0) mapCtx.moveTo(mx(fq.x), my(fq.y)); else mapCtx.lineTo(mx(fq.x), my(fq.y));
      }
      mapCtx.stroke();
    }
    mapCtx.fillStyle = 'rgba(240,208,140,0.9)';
    mapCtx.font = 'italic 9px Georgia';
    mapCtx.fillText('LAP ' + Math.min(TOTAL_LAPS, Math.floor(Math.max(0, playerLapsT)) + 1) + '/' + TOTAL_LAPS, 8, 12);
    var op2 = cpt(oppT);
    mapCtx.fillStyle = '#0c0b0a';
    mapCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(220,200,160,0.85)'; mapCtx.lineWidth = 0.9;
    mapCtx.beginPath(); mapCtx.arc(mx(op2.x), my(op2.y), 3, 0, Math.PI*2); mapCtx.fill(); mapCtx.stroke();
    mapCtx.fillStyle = '#cf5330';
    mapCtx.save(); mapCtx.translate(mx(camX),my(camY)); mapCtx.rotate(moveAngle);
    mapCtx.beginPath(); mapCtx.moveTo(0,5); mapCtx.lineTo(-3.5,-3); mapCtx.lineTo(3.5,-3); mapCtx.closePath(); mapCtx.fill(); mapCtx.restore();
  }

  function drawItemSlot(){
    itemCtx.clearRect(0, 0, 56, 56);
    itemCtx.fillStyle = 'rgba(16,11,7,0.72)';
    itemCtx.beginPath(); itemCtx.arc(28, 28, 26, 0, Math.PI*2); itemCtx.fill();
    itemCtx.strokeStyle = item ? 'rgba(240,208,140,0.95)' : 'rgba(212,174,106,0.35)';
    itemCtx.lineWidth = 2;
    itemCtx.beginPath(); itemCtx.arc(28, 28, 25, 0, Math.PI*2); itemCtx.stroke();
    if (!item) return;
    if (item === 'leaf'){
      itemCtx.fillStyle = '#7fbf6a';
      itemCtx.beginPath(); itemCtx.ellipse(28, 28, 7, 15, 0.6, 0, Math.PI*2); itemCtx.fill();
      itemCtx.strokeStyle = '#4a7a3a'; itemCtx.lineWidth = 1.4;
      itemCtx.beginPath(); itemCtx.moveTo(20, 38); itemCtx.lineTo(35, 18); itemCtx.stroke();
    } else if (item === 'stone'){
      itemCtx.fillStyle = '#8a7a66';
      itemCtx.beginPath(); itemCtx.arc(28, 29, 11, 0, Math.PI*2); itemCtx.fill();
      itemCtx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.25)';
      itemCtx.beginPath(); itemCtx.arc(24, 25, 4, 0, Math.PI*2); itemCtx.fill();
    } else if (item === 'condor'){
      itemCtx.strokeStyle = '#d8c9a8'; itemCtx.lineWidth = 3; itemCtx.lineCap = 'round';
      itemCtx.beginPath(); itemCtx.moveTo(12, 32); itemCtx.quadraticCurveTo(28, 16, 44, 32); itemCtx.stroke();
      itemCtx.beginPath(); itemCtx.moveTo(28, 24); itemCtx.lineTo(28, 34); itemCtx.stroke();
    } else if (item === 'slick'){
      itemCtx.fillStyle = '#1c1814';
      itemCtx.beginPath(); itemCtx.ellipse(28, 30, 13, 9, 0, 0, Math.PI*2); itemCtx.fill();
      itemCtx.fillStyle = 'rgba(150,190,210,0.3)';
      itemCtx.beginPath(); itemCtx.ellipse(24, 27, 4, 2.4, 0.5, 0, Math.PI*2); itemCtx.fill();
    }
  }

  // ── input ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  function bindInput(){
    var driveKeys = ['ArrowUp','ArrowDown','ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','w','a','s','d'];
    function kd(e){
      var target = e.target, key = e.key.length === 1 ? e.key.toLowerCase() : e.key;
      if (e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey || e.altKey || target && (target.isContentEditable || /^(INPUT|TEXTAREA|SELECT|BUTTON)$/.test(target.tagName))) return;
      if (document.querySelector('[aria-modal="true"]')){ setPaused(true); return; }
      if (key === 'p' || key === 'Escape'){
        if (!e.repeat && (raceStarted || countdownAt !== null)){ e.preventDefault(); setPaused(!paused); } return;
      }
      if (driveKeys.indexOf(key) < 0 && key !== ' ') return;
      if (finished || paused) return;
      e.preventDefault(); keys[key] = true;
      if (key === ' ' && !e.repeat) useItem();
      if (!raceStarted) startCountdown();
    }
    function ku(e){ keys[e.key.length === 1 ? e.key.toLowerCase() : e.key] = false; }
    function blur(){ keys = {}; touching = false; touchSteer = 0; setPaused(true); }
    function visibility(){ if (document.hidden) blur(); }
    function click(){ canvas.focus({preventScroll:true}); if (paused) setPaused(false); else if (!raceStarted) startCountdown(); }
    window.addEventListener('keydown', kd); window.addEventListener('keyup', ku); window.addEventListener('blur', blur);
    document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', visibility); canvas.addEventListener('click', click);
    cleanupInput = function(){
      window.removeEventListener('keydown', kd); window.removeEventListener('keyup', ku); window.removeEventListener('blur', blur);
      document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange', visibility); canvas.removeEventListener('click', click);
    };
  }

  function dispose(){
    if (disposed) return;
    disposed = true;
    if (animId) cancelAnimationFrame(animId);
    if (cleanupInput) cleanupInput();
    delete window._nzSpawnDust;delete window._nzSpawnSpark;delete window._nzSpawnSuck;
    if (paintEnv){paintEnv.dispose();paintEnv=null;}
    if (composer && composer.dispose) composer.dispose();
    if (eng){ eng.kill(); eng = null; }
    if (renderer){
      if (scene) scene.traverse(function(ch){
        if (ch.geometry && ch.geometry.dispose) { try { ch.geometry.dispose(); } catch(e){} }
        if (ch.material){
          var ms = Array.isArray(ch.material) ? ch.material : [ch.material];
          ms.forEach(function(m3){ if (m3.map && m3.map.dispose) { try { m3.map.dispose(); } catch(e){} } if (m3.dispose) { try { m3.dispose(); } catch(e){} } });
        }
      });
      try { renderer.dispose(); } catch(e){}
    }
  }
  var watchdog = setInterval(function(){
    if (!document.getElementById('nazca-race-canvas')){ dispose(); clearInterval(watchdog); }
  }, 500);

  boot();
})();
</script>

:: Pyramid Run [dream pyramid] {"position":"2400,3250","size":"100,100"}
<!-- v2-expansion: THE PYRAMID RUN (2026-08-21, Sam: "a mario style
     platformer where you travel through tunnels into the pyramid").
     Side-scrolling cutaway with the bar-game's Sam-approved Mario feel
     dials ported verbatim (gravity 600, jump -400, jump-cut 0.55,
     falling gravity 1.8x, coyote 90ms, buffer 120ms, pace 1.45/0.62,
     base scroll 200). Three acts: the descending corridor (pits,
     lintels, scarabs, sand columns, torch checkpoints), THE BALL (a
     rolling stone you must outrun), and the Grand Gallery ascent
     (corbelled ledges climbing into growing light). Collect resonance
     glyphs (phi-marks) in the dark. Fail-forward: you always arrive;
     a clean run (stumbles <= 3 and glyphs >= 4) sets $pyramidRunWon,
     paid with a MORALE nod at the King's Chamber. -->
(unless: $pyramidRunWon is a boolean)[(set: $pyramidRunWon to false)]\

<div class="pr-stage"><div class="pr-toolbar"><span>THE PYRAMID · DESCENT</span><span><button id="pr-pause" type="button">Pause</button> <button id="pr-expand" type="button">Expand</button></span></div><div class="pr-frame"><canvas id="pyr-run-canvas" width="720" height="540" tabindex="0" aria-label="Pyramid run. Up or space jumps, down ducks, right hurries, left walks back. P pauses." aria-describedby="pyr-run-hud"></canvas><div id="pyr-run-banner" role="status"></div><div class="pr-cover" id="pr-cover"><p class="pr-kicker">SEVEN MARKS IN THE DARK</p><h2>The Pyramid Run</h2><p>You run automatically.<br>↑ / Space jump · ↓ duck · → hurry · ← go back<br>Hold a jump across pits; release early to land sooner.<br>Jump scarabs and sand; duck under marked lintels.<br>The snake well slows you to measured hops. Torches save your place.</p><p>Gather 4 marks with at most 3 stumbles for the bonus.<br>You reach the Gallery either way.</p><button id="pr-begin" type="button">Enter the dark</button></div></div><div id="pyr-run-hud">Follow the torchlight.</div><div class="pr-pad" aria-label="Running controls"><button type="button" data-pr-key="ArrowLeft" aria-label="Walk back">← Back</button><button type="button" data-pr-key="ArrowRight" aria-label="Hurry">→ Hurry</button><button type="button" data-pr-key="ArrowUp" aria-label="Jump; hold for height">↑ Jump</button><button type="button" data-pr-key="ArrowDown" aria-label="Hold to duck">↓ Duck</button></div></div>

<span id="pyr-run-win" style="display:none;">(link: "Step into the Gallery")[(set: $pyramidRunWon to true)(go-to: "Grand Gallery")]</span>
<span id="pyr-run-lose" style="display:none;">[[Limp into the Gallery|Grand Gallery]]</span><span class="pr-again" style="display:none;">[[Again|Pyramid Run]]</span>

<span id="pyr-run-skip" style="display:none;"><div class="claude-draft" style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.4em;font-size:0.78em;opacity:0.45;letter-spacing:0.08em;">[[(skip run — testing)|Grand Gallery]]</div></span>
<script>if (window.DSS_DEV) { var _pk = document.getElementById('pyr-run-skip'); if (_pk) _pk.style.display = 'block'; }</script>

<script>
(function(){
  var canvas = document.getElementById('pyr-run-canvas');
  if (!canvas || canvas.dataset.pyrInit === '1') return;
  canvas.dataset.pyrInit = '1';
  var ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
  var W = canvas.width, H = canvas.height;
