[[Back to the street|Dean Street]]

:: Soho Square: the hut [outdoor]
<div id="sq-container" data-state="approach"></div>
<div class="sq-copy" data-sq-copy="intro">The gardener’s hut squats in the square’s middle and winds you up; so much papier-mâché left out in the rain. There’ll be fuel in there though, and you’ve the means to start a fire. The best thing you could do is burn it down.</div>
<div class="sq-links">(if: $hutBurnt is false and $sobriety < 30 and $blackouts >= 1)[<span data-sq-action="light">[[light it|Soho Hut Burns]]</span>]
<span data-sq-action="leave">[[walk away|Dean Street]]</span></div>
<div class="sq-copy" data-sq-copy="door" data-sq-name="The hut door">Open it and build a fire inside.</div>
<!-- 2026-10-08 (Sam): with neither matches nor the lighter, the door card offers "look" first; the gods deliver one last match. -->(if: $hasMatches is false and $dreamKey is not "lighter")[<div class="sq-copy" data-sq-copy="door-none" data-sq-look="look">No matches and no lighter, but look again and maybe the gods will deliver.</div><div class="sq-copy" data-sq-copy="door-found">One last match, you must have missed it.</div>]
<div class="sq-copy" data-sq-copy="king" data-sq-name="The Statue of Charles II">What the fuck are you looking at, Charlie?</div>
<div class="sq-copy" data-sq-copy="gate" data-sq-name="The gate">You can still walk away.</div>

:: Soho Hut Burns [outdoor]
<!-- Payment is guarded against repeat visits and direct entry without the fork's conditions. -->
(if: $hutBurnt is false and $sobriety < 30 and $blackouts >= 1)[(if: $hasMatches is true and $dreamKey is not "lighter")[(if: $matchesLeft is not a number or $matchesLeft <= 0)[(set: $matchesLeft to 5)](set: $matchesLeft to $matchesLeft - 1)](set: $hutBurnt to true)(set: $confidence to ($statCut: $confidence, 12))(set: $sobriety to ($statLift: $sobriety, 10))(if: $lostToDrink is an array)[(unless: $lostToDrink contains "hut")[(set: $lostToDrink to $lostToDrink + (a: "hut"))]]]\
(if: $hutBurnt is true)[<div id="sq-container" data-state="burnt"></div>
<div class="sq-copy" data-sq-copy="fire">Earth and water again from fire and wind. The limpid embers seem of a different world to the dank grass. In them the collocution of light and heat ossifies a pure, translucent substance, which catches gingerly on the king’s black cheek. The sodden grass limps almost out of form.</div>
<div class="sq-links"><span data-sq-action="after">[[Turn your back on the pyre.|Soho Square: after]]</span></div>](else:)[<div>[[Back to the street|Alley: Soho Square]]</div>]

:: Soho Square: after [street-night]
<blockquote class="dss-scripture">The palaces of crowned kings – the huts,<br>The habitations of all things which dwell,<br>Were burnt for beacons; cities were consum’d,<br>And men were gather’d round their blazing homes<br>To look once more into each other’s face.<span class="dss-scripture-cite">Byron, ‘Darkness’</span></blockquote>
<div>[[Leave it all behind|Dean Street]]</div>

:: Alley: Charing Cross Road [street-night] {"position":"2600,1080","size":"100,100"}
(unless: $alleys is an array)[(set: $alleys to (a:))](unless: $alleys contains "foyles")[(set: $alleys to $alleys + (a: "foyles"))](set: $alleyReturn to true)\
(display: "Key Guards")(if: $notebook is "stolen")[<div>Outside Foyles, a man is flogging books. You spot your notebook on the top of a pile.</div>(if: $dreamKey is not "")[(set: _price to $keyNames's ($dreamKey))(link: "Trade the " + _price + " for the notebook")[(if: $dreamKey is "cocaine")[(set: $keyCocaine to "traded")](else-if: $dreamKey is "ticket")[(set: $keyTicket to "traded")](else-if: $dreamKey is "slip")[(set: $keySlip to "traded")](else-if: $dreamKey is "lighter")[(set: $keyLighter to "traded")](else-if: $dreamKey is "eye")[(set: $keyEye to "traded")](set: $dreamKey to "")(set: $notebook to "held")(replace: ?ccrstash)[]<script>/* structure pass 3: the traded key leaves the header's pocket cell at once */document.querySelectorAll('.pocket-cell').forEach(function(c){c.remove();});</script><div>He takes the (print: _price), seems satisfied and gives you your notebook.</div><div class="item-box"><div class="item-header">◈ OBJECT RECOVERED</div><div class="item-name">Your Notebook</div></div><script>setTimeout(function(){if(window.dssAudio&&window.dssAudio.penScratch)window.dssAudio.penScratch();},500);</script>]](else:)[<div>He won’t give it for free. Your pockets are mostly empty. Look for something to trade.</div>]]
<!-- 2026-10-14 (Sam: the manuscript stolen; pink for him): the book on the fence's pile; the coin or the pocket key buys it back -->(if: $bookAt is "foyles")[<div><span>On the same pile, a price chalked on its cover, is your manuscript.</span></div><!-- 2026-10-24 (Sam, Q11: "show both"): the coin and the pocket key are both offered while both are held; either one buys the book back -->|bookfence>[<!-- 2026-10-25 (Sam: "a bit of a mess"): each offer in its own div; the <br> between them was being folded away, so the two links ran together on one line -->(if: $hasCoin is true)[<div>(link: "Pay with the coin")[(set: $hasCoin to false)(set: $bookAt to "")(replace: ?bookfence)[<span>He bites the coin and hands you the book. You put it back in your bag.</span>]]</div>](if: ($dreamKey is a string) and ($dreamKey is not ""))[(set: _bprice to $keyNames's ($dreamKey))<div>(link: "Trade the " + _bprice + " for the book")[(if: $dreamKey is "cocaine")[(set: $keyCocaine to "traded")](else-if: $dreamKey is "ticket")[(set: $keyTicket to "traded")](else-if: $dreamKey is "slip")[(set: $keySlip to "traded")](else-if: $dreamKey is "lighter")[(set: $keyLighter to "traded")](else-if: $dreamKey is "eye")[(set: $keyEye to "traded")](set: $dreamKey to "")(set: $bookAt to "")(replace: ?bookfence)[<span>He takes it and hands you the book. You put it back in your bag.</span>]<script>document.querySelectorAll('.pocket-cell').forEach(function(c){c.remove();});</script>]</div>](unless: ($hasCoin is true) or (($dreamKey is a string) and ($dreamKey is not "")))[<span>He won’t give it for nothing. Find something to pay him with.</span>]]]\
|ccrstash>[(display: "Stash Point")]
[[Back to the street|Dean Street]]

