:: Soho Square: the gardener’s hut
Massive earthworms are breaking through the floor!
<div id="dss-worm-game">
<h2>WHACK-A-WORM</h2>
<p class="worm-instructions">Keep the worms out. <span class="dss-desk-only">Click or tap a hole, or use keys 1–6.</span><span class="dss-touch-only">Tap a hole.</span><br>Thirty seconds. Eighteen worms to win.</p>
<div class="worm-meters"><span>HITS <b class="worm-score">0</b></span><span>SECONDS <b class="worm-time">30</b></span></div>
<div class="worm-wall" aria-label="Six holes in the tiled wall">
<button type="button" class="worm-hole" aria-label="Hole 1: empty"><span class="worm-body"></span><span class="worm-number">1</span></button>
<button type="button" class="worm-hole" aria-label="Hole 2: empty"><span class="worm-body"></span><span class="worm-number">2</span></button>
<button type="button" class="worm-hole" aria-label="Hole 3: empty"><span class="worm-body"></span><span class="worm-number">3</span></button>
<button type="button" class="worm-hole" aria-label="Hole 4: empty"><span class="worm-body"></span><span class="worm-number">4</span></button>
<button type="button" class="worm-hole" aria-label="Hole 5: empty"><span class="worm-body"></span><span class="worm-number">5</span></button>
<button type="button" class="worm-hole" aria-label="Hole 6: empty"><span class="worm-body"></span><span class="worm-number">6</span></button>
<span class="worm-pipe" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</div>
<button type="button" class="worm-start">Pick up a spade</button>
<div class="worm-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<div class="worm-tally"></div>
<div class="worm-payment">
<span data-outcome="win">(link: "worm-win")[(unless: $wormPlayed is true)[(set: $wormPlayed to true)(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 8))(display: "Bars Now")<div class="inventory-note">MORALE +8</div>]]</span>
<span data-outcome="excellent">(link: "worm-excellent")[(unless: $wormPlayed is true)[(set: $wormPlayed to true)(set: $confidence to ($statGain: $confidence, 12))(display: "Bars Now")<div class="inventory-note">MORALE +12</div>]]</span>
<span class="worm-again" hidden>[[Again|Soho Square: the gardener’s hut]]</span><span data-outcome="loss">(link: "worm-loss")[(unless: $wormPlayed is true)[(set: $wormPlayed to true)]]</span>
</div>
</div>
