}

:: Next Footer [footer] {"position":"3350,2600","size":"100,100"}
{<!-- 2026-10-12: the header renders before the passage's own (set:)s, so its NEXT lagged a screen behind (the overnight
     playthrough: it said CECIL COURT on O'Flatterly's Gift). The footer runs after them and redraws it. -->
(display: "Next Redraw")
<!-- 2026-10-12 (Sam, the overnight list item 5): a link that changes things without leaving the passage (a drink in
     place, a talk that unfolds, a hook clicked open) left NEXT where it was until the next screen. After any such click
     the script below presses this hidden link, which runs Next Redraw again in place. -->
