{<!-- 2026-10-28 (Sam, playtest notes 34 and 35, ruled "the lore front and centre"): a lore note opened is kept in $loreRead, and the
     NOTEBOOK's LORE section prints every note read, in full (dssLore keeps the words). The link sets _lore before it displays this. -->(unless: $loreRead is an array)[(set: $loreRead to (a:))](unless: $loreRead contains _lore)[(set: $loreRead to $loreRead + (a: _lore))]}

