{<!-- 2026-10-12 (Sam, the overnight list item 3): the primer (MORALE, SOBRIETY & HAUNTS) waited for the French or the
     first haunt, so a player following NEXT met it late, after both bars had already moved. It now also comes the first
     time either bar leaves its starting 70, on the next screen where NEXT may show (not the opening pages or a dream).
     The French and the haunt boxes still raise it if they come first; $primerShown keeps it to once a night. -->
