(if: $haunts is an array and $haunts's length > 0 and $hauntPrimerShown is not true)[(set: $hauntPrimerShown to true)<script>setTimeout(function(){ if(window.dssShowHauntPrimer) window.dssShowHauntPrimer(); }, 3500);</script>]
}


:: Lore Chariots of the Gods [system]
<div class="dss-book-lore"><p>Published in 1968, //Chariots of the Gods?// is a book by the Swiss author Erich von Däniken. It proposes that extraterrestrials visited Earth in antiquity and were worshipped as gods.</p><p>Von Däniken interprets ancient monuments, artworks and religious accounts as evidence of these visits. He writes of the Egyptian pyramids, the Nazca Lines, the statues on Easter Island and the prophet Ezekiel’s vision of a heavenly chariot wheel.</p><p>Scholars reject him as a fantasist, though quietly some will admit to enjoying his game.</p></div>


