:: JEFFREY’s tune [char-jeff venue-coach]
<!-- 2026-10-24: Sam's exact approved prose. No key is spent, moved or awarded. -->
(if: ($dreamKey is "lighter") and ($jeffreyTune is not true) and (($keySlip is "seed") or ($keySlip is "Coach and Horses bar")))[
(set: $jeffreyTune to true)
<div class="jeffrey-tune-prose">JEFFREY palms the betting slip that was under his glass.<br>
‘Light?’ he says, ‘I can’t read this.’<br>
He knows the result but forgets which horse he backed.<br>
You hold the lighter to him, over the paper which he pushes perilously close to combustion, and reading 'Southgate's Arkestra' and knowing it didn't place, slips the slip back under his glass and from his lips there is a tune he has been humming, louder now than the breath that it was under.<br>
You listen till he stops.</div>
<button type="button" id="jeffrey-hear-tune">Listen to the tune</button>
<script>
(function(){
  var button=document.getElementById('jeffrey-hear-tune'), sound=null;
  if(!button)return;
  function listen(){if(sound)sound.stop();sound=window.dssAudio&&window.dssAudio.jeffreyTune?window.dssAudio.jeffreyTune(false):null;}
  button.addEventListener('click',listen);
  listen();
  var observer=new MutationObserver(function(){if(!button.isConnected){if(sound)sound.stop();observer.disconnect();}});
  observer.observe(document.querySelector('tw-story'),{childList:true,subtree:true});
})();
</script>
]
[[Back to the bar|Coach and Horses bar]]


:: BENITO’s nail [venue-french]
<!-- 2026-10-25: Sam's text; approved quotation/spacing fixes only. Leaving does not set a completion flag. -->
(unless: $benitoDrawing is true)[<div class="benito-nail-request">On BENITO's left hand, his drawing hand, you clock a nail that has split down to the matrix. The stray splint catches at his cuff.<br>
‘Oh sod this,’ he says, ‘Here, hold my finger.’<br>
You hold it while he takes the nail between his other hand's finger and thumb. He goes to pull, then stops, and says, ‘No. You do it.’<br>
BENITO lays his hand flat on the table.</div>
[[Pull the nail.|BENITO’s drawing]]
[[Leave it alone.|The French]]
](else:)[[[Back to the bar|The French]]]

:: BENITO’s drawing [venue-french]
(unless: $benitoDrawing is true)[(set: $benitoDrawing to true)<div class="benito-nail-result">You take the splint and pull. Blood begins to glaze his fingertip.<br>
‘Give me that napkin.’<br>
He swaddles his broken nail and presses it close.<br>
You drink a sip or two and when, soon enough, the pain and blood subside and he can hold a tool again, he says, ‘Let me show you something.’<br>
He draws four creatures, each with four faces and four wings. Turning the paper towards you, ‘Keep it,’ he says.<br>
You put it in your notebook.</div>]
(display: "BENITO Drawing Art")
<div class="benito-drawing">(print: $benitoDrawingArt)</div>
[[Back to the bar|The French]]

